\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Interrogatio episcopi Canturiorum Agustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ecclesiae et episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qualiter cum suis clericis conuersentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex dilectione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quam portabat inuitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
