\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lucius Caecilius Firmianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lactantius: Divinae institutiones (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lactantius. Diuites sunt non qui diuicias habent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et nichil concupiscunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lib. 5 cap. 15 \u167 \'a7 4, ed. S. 448 Z. 4-7). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sapientia est intelligencia ad bonum rectumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que improborum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lib. 5 cap. 17 \u167 \'a7 34, ed. S. 458 Z. 1-3). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scientia est deum nosse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in hoc iustitia continetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lib. 6 cap. 5 \u167 \'a7 19, ed. S. 498 Z. 16f.). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nichil est enim, ut ait orator, opere et manufactum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et consumat uetustas. Beneficentia enim nulla est ubicumque necessitas non est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lib. 6 cap. 11 \u167 \'a7 25f., ed. S. 524 Z. 1-3, Z. 7). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nichil a iusto faciendum est, nisi quod sit beneficium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 persolutum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lib. 6 cap. 12 \u167 \'a7 7, ed. S. 526 Z. 1-4). \endash  Darunter wohl von Sanftls Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Breuis Comment\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rius in Pentateuchum, Libros Josue, Judicum, Ruth, Regum, Paralipomenon, Esdrae, Tobiae et Judith, excerptus ex postilla Nicolai de Lyra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -IV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: L. Caeli Firmiani Lactanti opera omnia. Bd. 1: Divinae institutiones et epitome divinarum institutionum, ed. Samuel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Brandt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Wien 1890 (CSEL 19).}

