in \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 82: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ego cogito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ier 29,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sicut aduentum noui regis solent diuersi nuncii precurrere, quidam precurrunt ipsius aduentum denunciandum, alii autem ad monendum populum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 de ewangelio autem sermonem require\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [in] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 dominica in media quadragesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Accepit Ihesus panes et fregit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (vgl. Mt 14,19; Mt 15,36; Mc 6,41; Mc 8,6; Io 6,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Explicit. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -222d\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Besitzeintrag von N\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , auf Rasur: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Iste liber est fratris Othonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (Rest verblasst). \endash  Alphabetisches Stichwortverzeichnis von N\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
