\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Collectio exemplorum, fabularum, sententiarum necnon auctoritatum secundum ordinem alphabeti
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De gula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Gule vicium dissuadent scriptura et exempla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Uicium gule dissuadet scriptura tamquam fomentum omnis peccati. Sap. viii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sobrietatem docet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Sap. 8,7); [ad] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [manos] xiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non in comessacionibus et ebrietatibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rm 13,13) \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 16) Am Rand: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Legitur in gestis Alexandri et epistolis Brag\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 manorum, quod, cum audisset Alexander de uita et commendacione Brag\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 manorum, post multa, que scripsit, eis promisit multa et maxima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Seneca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Cetera animalia natura dieicat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 deiciat) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad pastum, hominem vero erexit ad sidera\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , ut appetat et erigatur potius mens eius ad supernas et angelicas delicias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) In der Kopfzeile: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De accidia seu pigricia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b; (Z. 1) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Accidiam dissuadent scriptura et exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b; (Z. 11) Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschrift: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De accidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Contra accidiam, que maxime impugnat fortissimos in ecclesia, id est uiros religiosos claustrales et contemplatiuos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85; (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Contra accidiam nos mouere debent exempla sanctorum patrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85; (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Im Seitensteg unten: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exemplum contra accidiam seu pigriciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b; Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschrift: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De accidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Senex quidam et philosophus docebat filium suum dicens: Recordaris meorum uerborum cuiusdam stulti, pigri et garruli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 W\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 lpes. Castigauit arabs filium suum dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Fili, ne dimittas pro futuris principia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 lupus boues et caseam perdidit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) [Uxor] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dicit Johannes Damascenus, quod quidam diues habebat filium vnigenitum juuenem, cui desponsauit filiam cuiusdam diuitis pulcram et nobilem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 qui non ex corde solem adoraui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Berlin, SBB-PK, Ms. theol. lat. 4\u176 \'b0 270, 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ; zur ausf\u252 \'fchrlichen Beschreibung vgl. Gerard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Achten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 , in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die theologischen lateinischen Handschriften in Quarto der Staatsbibliothek Preu\u223 \'dfischer Kulturbesitz Berlin. Bd. 2: Ms. theol. lat. qu. 267-378. Berlin 1984 (Kataloge der Handschriftenabteilung 1,2), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 S. 30f.; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Mainz, StB, Hs. I 240, 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  6525 (Hs. genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

