\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Servasanctus Tuscus de Faenza: Liber de exemplis naturalibus (lib. I-II)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Lib. I: De articulis fidei. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Occurrit discutere, utrum necesse sit ponere deum esse; nulli ergo verti debet in dubium, cum sit hoc originale fidei fundamentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 articulum uero de operacione glorificacionis distinguunt in duos, scilicet in resurrectionem carnis et gloriam anime. Similiter articulum conceptionis et natiuitatis coniungunt in unum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. II: De sacramentis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Postquam auxiliante Christo, quantum mihi a domino datum est, demonstraui, quomodo non est contrarium rationi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 confundatur ergo et humana lasciuia, quando in auibus est continencia tam modesta et congruorum temporum seruancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (erg\u228 \'e4nzt von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tractatus compendiosus de deo et sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ohne den von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grabmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Liber de Exemplis (wie oben 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 95-97, edierten Prolog zum Gesamtwerk \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Cum solus in cella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 \lquote . \endash  Vgl. ferner \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RS 810 I-II; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mohan, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Initia, S. 87, 261; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (mit Supplement) 1242 (Cum solus in cella) und 3578 (Hs. jeweils genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

