\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Inhaltsverzeichnis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de \u182 \'b6 Libero arbitrio, Fide et bonis operibus, Inuocatione sanctorum, Imagi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ginibus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 honor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [andis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 seu adora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ndis], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sanctorum reliquiis, Uotis, C\u230 \'e6libatu Monach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [orum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et re\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [liquorum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [acerdotum], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Veritate corp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [oris] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et sang\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [uinis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Christi, Transsubstantiatione pa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [nis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et Communione unius speciei, Purgatorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.}

