\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expositio canonis missae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expositio Canonis Miss\u230 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Neben der \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Opusculum mancum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pr\u230 \'e6fatio. Quia totum m\u255 \'ffsterium nostr\u230 \'e6 salutis in Sacramento Eucharisti\u230 \'e6, quod in sacro Miss\u230 \'e6 officio celebratur, ideo illud merito solenniter peragendum est. Et quia singul\u230 \'e6 partes miss\u230 \'e6 inennarbilem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte inenarrabilem) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dulcedinem refundant, diuinorum m\u255 \'ffsteriorum (designant enim nichil aliud quam gesta, facta et opera Chris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et non diabolicas imaginaciones, ut nobis H\u230 \'e6retici iniuste obtrudunt), ideo de singulis Particulis huius sacrificii Miss\u230 \'e6 breuiter dicendum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De variis nominibus Miss\u230 \'e6. Habet autem istud officium miss\u230 \'e6 multa nomina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\u176 \'b0 Dicitur Missa propter rationes pr\u230 \'e6dictas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\u176 \'b0 Dicitur Eucharistia ab \u8218 \'82eu\lquote , quod est bonum, et \u8218 \'82charis\lquote , id est gratia, quasi bona gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sed unde desumptum est et cum spiritu tuo. Ab Apostolo Paulo ad Thimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [teum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vltimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 || Textabbruch. \endash  166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer; 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer bis auf Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Omnia propter finem fiunt, sine quo nec utilia esse possunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .}

