\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Theologische Exzerpte
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Priusquam legem populo in monte Syna dominus per Moysen daret per quam errantem a suis erroribus refrenaret ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Queritur autem quare lex data fuerit. Ad hec sic dici potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de x preceptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum preceptum secunde tabule. Honora patrem et matrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 e sacramentis legalibus deinceps est dicendum. Hec autem sacramenta sicut et cetera in tribus consistebant, in rebus, in factis, in uerbis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Locutus est dominus ad moysen. Dominus legem moysi dedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In lege Carnalibus data et cruda et dura, id est non spiritualiter intellecta. IIIIor continentur prohibita, permissa, mandata, cerimonie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 T\u8249 \'8bres sollempnitates septimi mensis quarum prima tubarum scilicet primo, secunda expiationis scilicet x\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 mo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tercia scenopheia scilicet quinta decima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De oblationibus populi. Postquam diuersitates sollempnitatum executus est de oblationibus populi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Post preceptorum enumerationem que eorum obseruationibus debeantur premia exponi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 offerri debet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Preceptum fuit in lege quod primiciis et decimis domino offerendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 re uideamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) von anderer Hand (zu beziehen auf 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus Magistri Hvgonis de constructione tabernaculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Exzerpte erw\u228 \'e4hnt bei Heinrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weisweiler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ma\u238 \'eetre Simon et son groupe. De sacramentis. Textes in\u233 \'e9dits. Pierre le Mangeur, De Sacramentis. Texte in\u233 \'e9dit. Louvain 1937 (Spicilegium Sacrum Lovaniense 17), S. XXII f. \endash  (Nr. 1) Incipit \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Paris, Bibl. Sainte Genevi\u232 \'e8ve, 1369, 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; (Nr. 1, 6) auch in Avranches, Bmun, Cod. 106, 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

