\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I (Bl. 1-80)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Peregrinus de Oppeln: Sermones de tempore (T1-T65)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titelblatt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber sermonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 1: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dominica prima in aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ecce rex tuus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 21,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In hiis uerbis propheta consolatur sanctos patres, qui diuersis tribulacionibus afflicti fuerant ante aduentum Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et sic sanguine suo adamantem fregit, id est deleuit peccatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 2-9. \endash  (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 10 mit Zusatz 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Z. 34-39: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hic triduo quidam miles quesiuit dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 dicit: ulterius te sequi non possum, quem dominus ibi assumpsit in celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 11-19. \endash  (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 20 endet Ed. S. 93, Z. 113. \endash  (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 21-23. \endash  (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In cena domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Rex Assuerus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Est 1,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In istis uerbi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [s] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [i] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 notari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte notare) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 possumus. Primo quis sit ille, qui tam grande conuiuium faciat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 hec est turpis et inmunda cena, a tali cibo protegat et custodiat nos pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rep. 4,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  S. 551 Nr. 37. \endash  (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De passione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Cvm egressus fuero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ex 9,29). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Legitur in Genesi, quod Iacob completis sermonibus, quibus erudiuit filios, collegit pedes suos in lectulo et obiit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et cum clamore et luctu intrauit Ierusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . Mit Zusatz 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Z. 22-26: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vidit caput ad osculandum et brachia extenta ad amplexandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 tocius corporis extensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rep. 4,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  S. 551 Nr. 43; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Oxford, BodL, Ms. Hamilton 50, 197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \endash  (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 25-32. \endash  (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 33 entspricht Ed. S. 153, Z. 27-S. 155, Z. 112. \endash  (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Si quid pecieritis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Io 16,23), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 licet semper sit orandum tamen modo specialiter, quam omnes discipuli precipue modo orabant, ut acciperent sanctum spiritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quia melior fuisset obediencia quam victima, sicut dixit ei Samuel, quod nobis prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Si quid pecieritis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Io 16,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In presenti ewangelio docet dominus orare auarus, non libenter, non docet aliquem, ut a se aliquit petat, sed dominus docet nos celestia a se petere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ideo epistola sequitur: Estote factores uerbi dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Iac 1,22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et quia salutem debemus, ideo dicit ewangelium: Si quid pecieritis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 34-43. \endash  (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 44 endet Ed. S. 210, Z. 176; 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Z. 15-18 mit Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Super hoc eciam habemus exemplum\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de xl\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  militibus martyribus,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quorum vnus effugit de captiuitate fluminis propter frigus ad balneum et mox exspirauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 45-64.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Peregrini de Opole Sermones de tempore et de sanctis, e codicibus manu scriptis primum ed. Richardus \plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs20 Tatarzy\u324 \'f1ski\plain \f3\lang1024\fs20 . Warschau 1997 (Studia przegl\u261 \'b9du tomistycznego 1), S. 3-304\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . \endash  Vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rep. 4, S. 548-556 Nr. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 104, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hs. S. 557 genannt. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  Lit.:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Gilles G\u233 \'e9rard\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Meersseman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Notice bio-bibliographique sur deux fr\u232 \'e8res pr\u234 \'eacheurs sil\u233 \'e9siens du XIVe si\u232 \'e8cle nomm\u233 \'e9s Peregrinus, in: Archivum Fratrum Praedicatorum 19 (1949), S. 266-274, hier S. 269 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Franz Josef \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 , in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u178 \'b2VL 7 (1989), Sp. 402-404.}

