\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Sermones de dedicatione templi (C11)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Martinus Oppaviensis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 At ille festinans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 19,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hiis uerbis et in sequentibus huius ewangelii tria notantur, videlicet ammiranda saluatoris dignacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 28) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sextum, quod debet dari pauperibus et egenis, non diuitibus, vnde Zacheus de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [dit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 pauperibus, non diuitibus, non cognatis, et sic imitatus est Zacheus in bonis operibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 nam et saluator ait: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Multi ueniunt ab oriente et occidente et recumbent cum Abraham et Ysaach et Jacob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mc 8,11), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod ipse prestare nobis dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Jacobus de Voragine: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 odie salus huic domui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 19,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quamdiu homo in hac uita est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 peccator est et ideo dei reconciliacione indiget\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ibi oraciones fidelium effunduntur, ibi sanctorum reliquie reconduntur. Ista enim videlicet sunt ei ualde terribilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (Nr. 1) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rep. 4, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 148 Nr. 320. \endash  Druck: GW M21435 (= BSB-Ink M-239), Bl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 [G8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -H1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 , Schluss abweichend und mit Zusatz. \endash  (Nr. 2) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 3, S. 265 Nr. 596. \endash  Druck: Edit16 CNCE 32350 (Venedig: Giovanni Battista Somasco, 1573), Bl. 447\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -448\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 33.}

