\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II (Bl 81-150)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Peregrinus de Oppeln: Sermones de sanctis (S1-S85)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 1: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Uestigia illius secutus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Iob 23,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dominus uocans Petrum et Andream dixit eis: Venite post me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 4,19; Mc 1,17), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 volens, ut uenirent post eum non solum gressu corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et sic per viam passionis secutus Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 celi hereditatem consecutus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 2-4. \endash  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 5 mit Zusatz 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Z. 8-11: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exemplum de heremita, qui uoluit ire ad celum cum apostolis nec cum angelis nec cum beata uirgine nec Christus personaliter pro eo ueniret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 6-29. \endash  (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 30 endet Ed. S. 445, Z. 138. \endash  (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 31-39. \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 40 endet Ed. S. 491, Z. 112. \endash  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Nr. 41, 42. \endash  (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exaltacio sancte crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Clamauit Moyses ad dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ex 15,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In uerbis istis notantur tria circa exaltacionem sancte crucis. Primo ostendit ibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Clamauit Moyses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Secundo crucis exaltacio ibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Qui ostendit ei lignum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vbi ait Augustinus: Graciam et gloriam crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quod dominus noster tam multa obprobria sustinuit absque culpa, si dei passio ad memoriam reducitur nec adde durum est, quod non equo animo tolleretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De sancto Matheo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Uidit Jhesus hominem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 9,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In verbis istis tria notantur. Inmensa dei bonitas et ibi, vbi ait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sequere me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Secundo beati \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mathei felicitas et hec ibi, vbi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Relictis omnibus, secutus est eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 5,28) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quare nolebant emendari et illuminari, scandalizabatur lux vnde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ecce ostende nobis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lucem miseracionum tuarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  (Sir 36,1). \endash  (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De sancto Michaele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Michael et angeli preliabantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Apc 12,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Draco iste, qui septem capita habet, dyabolus est cum membris sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vielm. suis),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuius septem capita sunt septem vicia capitalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Crisostomus: Castitas rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. res) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est angelica, vitet ergo luxuriam, qui effugere uult anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [et]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diffusionem regere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Oxford, BodL, Ms. Hamilton 50, 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 46 endet Ed. S. 518, Z. 89. \endash  (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 47 endet Ed. S. 522, Z. 83. \endash  (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 48. \endash  (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 49 endet Ed. S. 530, Z. 152. \endash  (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 50 mit Auslassungen, endet Ed. S. 534, Z. 111. \endash  (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 51, 53. \endash  (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De sancto Clemente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Aque multe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ct 8,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hic notantur tria circa passionem sancti Clementis. Primum est passionis acerbitas, cum dicitur \u8218 \'82Aque multe\lquote , id est mare, quod est mater omnium aquarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 hec quattuor custodiuit beatus Clemens, ideo meruit a domino accipere benedictionem. Psalmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [23,5]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hic accipiet benedictionem a domino, quam nobis prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [dignetur]. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rep. 4,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  S. 563 Nr. 184. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Oxford, BodL, Ms. Hamilton 50, 250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \endash  (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De sancta Katerina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Erat formosa ualde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Est 2,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Verba ista leguntur de puella, que nuncupatur Hester, quam rex Assuerus pre omnibus aliis puellis sibi elegit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rectitudo sine peruersitate, pulchritudo sine deformitate, ad quam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, vielm. quas) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 cum beata Katerina perducamur prestante domino nostro Ihesu Christo, qui est honor et gloria in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rep. 4,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  S. 563 Nr. 185. Oxford, BodL, Ms. Hamilton 50, 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  Schreiberspruch: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quis scripsit scripta, manus eius sit benedicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Finito libro sit laus et gloria Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Peregrini de Opole Sermones (wie oben), S. 307-547. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Rep. 4, S. 557-563 Nr. 106-186, Hs. genannt S. 573. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meersseman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Notice (wie oben 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 270 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung Oxford, BodL, Ms. Hamilton 50 (Prov.: Erfurt, Peterskloster) vgl. auch Matthias \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Eifler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Bibliothek des Erfurter Petersklosters im sp\u228 \'e4ten Mittelalter. Buchkultur und Literaturrezeption im Kontext der Bursfelder Klosterreform. Teilbd. 1: Darstellung; Teibd. 2: Kataloge und Anh\u228 \'e4nge. K\u246 \'f6ln/Weimar/Wien 2017 (Ver\u246 \'f6ffentlichungen der Historischen Kommission f\u252 \'fcr Th\u252 \'fcringen 51,1-2), Teilbd. 2, Nr. 273, S. 883.}

