\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge und Federproben
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Spem habeo, quia propter nos aliquid boni dicere potero. Qui baptizatur a mortuo. Hoc legitur in Ecclesiastico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 34,30). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui baptizatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 id est qui lavatur, laudem triplici modo, corde contricione, oris confessione, operis satisfaccione, debent autem lauare tria, cor, faciem et manus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 in eius dote\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 intelligimus cordis mundiciam, quam qui seruare ualde laudabiles sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (stark gek\u252 \'fcrzt und verblasst), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quam ipse nobis p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [raestare] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ominus], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Predigtlehre: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Et nota, quod est communis ornatus loquendi in omni sacra scriptura et in omni predicacione, id est sermone, quem diuidunt phi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [losophi] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 in tres partes, solitus in stilum grandiloquum, mediocrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 humilem, in quibus oportet, quod predicator sicut et alii habeant uerba conueniencia materie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et humilibus uerbis conuenientibus usus est dicens ad Philippenses iii\u176 \'b0 capitulo: Hec omnia \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 reputaui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut stercora, ut Christum lucri faciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (Phil 3,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ad hanc observanciam plene inuenies per tota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [m] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sacram paginam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Federproben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mocht ich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Omnis ornatus eorum et omnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. Gn 2,1). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 O deus meus, vt quid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. Mt 27,46). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mocht ich vnd chund\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Falzsteg zwischen Bl. 149 und 150 mit zwei Eintr\u228 \'e4gen von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand, querst\u228 \'e4ndig: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ben\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ignoque quasi pro turpi amatore suscipitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Schluss von Cantus 001967); darunter Namenseintrag, besch\u228 \'e4digt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Johans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de wintshaim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vicarius unniuersitatis}

