\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Commentarius in libros Boethii de hypotheticis syllogismis (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Modus tractandi talis est ut ostendat constitutionem sillogismorum ypoteticorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propter aliam partem quam ne \u8230 \'85are ne dicetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Rep. Init. Bd. 2 S. 677 Nr. 21248.}

