\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Raimundus de Pennaforti: Summa de matrimonio
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipit summa de matrimonio a magistro Raimundo c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [omposita]\u8249 \'8b (Prolog) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Qvoniam frequenter in foro penitenciali dubitaciones circa matrimonium immo etiam interdum quasi perplexitates occurrunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Verzeichnis der tituli. \endash  (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De sponsalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quoniam sponsalia precedere matrimonium consueuerunt, ideo primo loco de sponsalibus est agendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 puta, quia domum refecit, potest retinere, ut ff. De impensis in rebus dotalibus factis, l. 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Voluptarie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (D 25.1.7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 uero perdidit, sicut ibi dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Explicit summula matrimonii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Sanctus Raimundus de Pennaforte. Bd. 1C: Summa de matrimonio. Decretales novae. Responsiones ad dubitabilia. Quaestiones variae canonicopastorales. Summula de consanguinitate et affinitate, ed. Xaverio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Ochoa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  / Aloisio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Diez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Rom 1978 (Universa Bibliotheca Iuris 1C), Sp. 901-998; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Raymond of Penyafort, Summa on Marriage, Translated with an Introduction by Pierre J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Payer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Toronto 2005 (Mediaeval Sources in Translation 41)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schulte, GQ 2, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 S. 412f.;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kuttner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Repertorium (wie oben 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), S. 445 (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D\u237 \'edaz y D\u237 \'edaz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Index, S. 282 Nr. 1332 (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Scriptores 3, 3408 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 N\u246 \'f6rr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Handbuch der Quellen und Literatur (wie oben 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 375;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (mit Supplement) 4943\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (jeweils ohne diese Hs.).}

