\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Raimundus de Pennaforti: Responsiones ad Dubitabilia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dilectis in Christo fratribus, N. priori de ordine predicatorum et N. ministro de ordine fratrum minorum in regno Tunicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum ex constitucione domini pape Innocencii sint excommunicati, qui vendunt naues et deferunt arma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed in satisfactione penitencie mitius agatis cum eis, prout uestra discrecio uiderit expedire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Ochoa/Diez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  1C (wie oben 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), Sp. 1021-1036\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schulte, GQ\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  2, S. 409f.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kuttner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Repertorium (wie oben 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), S. 446f. (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 az y D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 az\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Index, S. 280f. Nr. 1326 (ohne diese Hs.);\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 3, 3406 (diese Hs. genannt).}

