\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Raimundus de Pennaforti: Sex decretales fratribus ordinis praedicatorum transmissae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 (112\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epistula\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Uenerabilibus et karissimis in Christo fratribus et prioribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ordinis predicatorum, ad quos littere iste peruenerint, fr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ater]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 R\plain \f3\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf18 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 aymundus\plain \f3\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf18 ], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 domini pape penitentiarius salutem et orationes in domino. Sex decretales inscriptas uobis utiles et tamen in consciliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam in confessionibus necessarias uobis ad presens de noua compilatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8230 \'85 (L\u252 \'fccke im Umfang von sechs Buchstaben), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum nostrum amicum et familiarem nostri ordinis thesaurarium Uincentium, duxi sub nostro sigillo fideliter transmittendas. Orate pro me misero peccatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Z. 21) Collectio decretalium: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 5.39.54 (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ochoa/Diez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1C, Nr. I.1)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2=44\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 5.3.45 (= Nr. I.2); (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 3.40.9 (= Nr. II.30); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 5.19.19 (= Nr. II.48); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 5.27.10 (= Nr. II.51); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 5.39.56 (= Nr. II.58); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7=45\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 5.3.46 (= Nr. II.40); (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 1.6.49 (= Nr. II.1) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 63\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 X 5.39.60 (= Nr. II.62).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Ochoa/Diez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  1C (wie oben 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), Sp. 1001-1018. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schulte, GQ\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  2, S. 410;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kuttner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Repertorium (wie oben 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), S. 448 (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D\u237 \'edaz y D\u237 \'edaz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Index, S. 280 Nr. 1325 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 3, 3405 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Boese\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 \u220 \'dcber die kleine Sammlung \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Gregorianischer Dekretalen (wie oben 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 72-80, zur Textl\u252 \'fccke s. S. 75 Anm. 18.}

