\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regula Benedicti
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bis auf Kraus-Nr. leer. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit Registrum super regulam sancti Benedicti abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abbas diligenter cogitet quid sit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abbas Christi nomine est appellandus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 63\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Zelus bonus et malus vel amarus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 42\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prohemium in regula beatissimi patris nostri Benedicti abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui leui jugo Christi colla submittere cupis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus sancte regule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ausculta, o fili, precepta magistri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula regule monachorum. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De generibus vel vita \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 monachorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Deo protegente prouenies. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 Edition: (Prooemium) Heinrich Suso \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Brechter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Versus Simplici Casinensis abbatis. Ihre Stellung in der Textgeschichte der Regula Benediciti, in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Revue b\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 50 (1938), S. 89-135, hier S. 91; (Regula) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Benedicti regula, rec. Rudolphus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hanslik\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Wien 1960, Ed. altera emendata 1977 (CSEL 75, 75a).}

