\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Innocencius tercius de statu monachorum tercio libro decretalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b X 3.35.6. \endash  (249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Gregorius tercius de statu monachorum libro quo supra ex consilio Lateranensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b X 3.35.2. \endash  (251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Innocencius tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [de] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 libro et titulo ut supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b X 3.31.20. \endash  (252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Gregorius nonus de regularibus et transeuntibus ad religionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b X 3.31.1. \endash  (252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Allexander tercius vbi supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b X 3.10.4. \endash  (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Innocencius tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b X 3.31.16. \endash  (254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Innocencius tercius in concilio generali de penitenciis et remissionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b X 5.38.12.}

