\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis: Dogma sive modus vivendi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipit metrice dogma salubre viuendi proficiendi nouiciis fratribus penitencie pugnam ingredientibus transferens se custoditum nichilominus im\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, vielm. in) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 professos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec tibi viuendi sit formula proficiendi | Qui cupis ardenter, domino seruire libenter | Sepe recorderis, bone frater, quod morieris | In tractu mortis nimis est angustia fortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 W\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 lnera sacrata tibi sint medicamina grata | In cruce stans plora crucifixum semper honora | Ut gaudere queras mortis, cum venerit, hora | Omnia, que dixi, laus gloria sit crucifixi | Qui legis, implora pro me, deprecor, ora. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 4428, 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Clm 2822, 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Augsburg, SuStB, 8\u176 \'b0 Cod 116, 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Venedig, B Marciana, Cod. 33 chart., Nr. 7 (s. Bibliotheca manuscripta ad S. Marci Venetiarum, digessit et commentarium addidit Joseph Giuseppe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Valentinelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 2. Venedig 1869, S. 207); Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Cod. 4108, 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck (jeweils mit Auslassungen und Umstellungen): GW 8590, Bl. a i\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 20-b 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 13; Sancti Bonaventurae \u8230 \'85 Operum Omnium \u8230 \'85 Supplementum 3, ed. Benedictus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bonelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Trient 1774, Sp. 1168-1180. \endash  Vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum 7618 (diese Hs. genannt), ferner 17041. \endash  Lit.: Jean-Barth\u233 \'e9lemy \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haur\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 au\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Des po\u233 \'e9mes latins attribu\u233 \'e9s a Saint Bernard. Paris 1890, S. 31f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Distelbrink, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bonaventurae scripta, S. 109f. Nr 84\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

