\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Raimundus de Pennaforti: Summa de matrimonio
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipit Summa Matrimonii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b (Prolog) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Qvoniam frequenter in foro penitentiali dubitationes circa matrimonium immo etiam quasi perplexitates occurrunt interdum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85; (Z. 10-18) Verzeichnis der tituli. \endash  (Z. 18) Tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De sponsalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Qvoniam matrimonium sponsalia precedere consueuerunt, ideo primo loco de sponsalibus est agendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 puta, quod domum refecit, potest retinere, ut C. De impensis in rebus dotalibus factis, l. 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Voluptaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (D 25.1.7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 uero perdit, sicut ibi dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Liceat autem tam super dote quam super aliis articulis plurima fuissent, ubi plena noticia in causis matrimonialibus haberetur, dicenda, hec tamen que premissa sunt, breuitatis causa sufficiant. Super operis imperfectione ueniam postulans \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et que corrigenda uiderit et addenda, non inuidenti animo sed benigno corrigat et emendet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Sanctus Raimundus de Pennaforte. Bd. 1C: Summa de matrimonio. Decretales novae. Responsiones ad dubitabilia. Quaestiones variae canonicopastorales. Summula de consanguinitate et affinitate, ed. Xaverio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Ochoa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  / Aloisio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Diez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Rom 1978 (Universa Bibliotheca Iuris 1C), Sp. 901-998. \endash  Zu weiterer Lit. s. Clm 14750.}

