\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Kalenderberechnungen
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Terminus inicii quadragesime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 VIII KL MAR, III KL MAR\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si uis scire concurrentes, require in viiii Kalendis Aprilis et in quale feria viii kalendis euenerit, tantos concurrentes habetis eodem anno. Et qualis luna in xi kalendis Aprilis euenerit, talem epactam habetis in omni tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thorndike/Kibre,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sp. 1473.10)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Kalendis Nonis et Idibus ac diebus xii Mensium. Ianuarius, Augustus et decemper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iiii Nonas habent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnes menses octaua Idus habent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thorndike/Kibre,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sp. 652.5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 B i vi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ii vii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regulares ad inueniendas ferias kalendarum secundum egyptios adiunctis concurrentibus anni cuius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 cumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uolueris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Von anderer Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Heinricum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Martius v, Aprilis i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Februarius vi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thorndike/Kibre,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Sp. 1346.8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isti sunt dies egyptiaci, in quibus non exeas, non causas queras, non plantas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!, recte plantes)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uineam, non animal dometo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte domito), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non metens, non uindemiare nec sanguinem minuere, quia nocent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 IIII NON. IAN, VIII ID IAN, X KL FEB, XIII KL FEB\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 VIII KL NOV, VIII KL DEC, III ID DEC\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epacte mille. xi, xxii, iii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regulares ad inueniendam lunam kalendarum secundum egyptios adiunctis epactis anni cuius uolueris. September v, October v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustus xiiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) bis auf Federproben leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (Nr. 1) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Donatella\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Nebbiai\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La biblioth\u232 \'e8que de l'Abbaye de Saint-Victor de Marseille (XI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -XV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  si\u232 \'e8cle). Paris 2005 (Documents, \u233 \'e9tudes et r\u233 \'e9pertoires 74), S. 242. \endash  (Nr. 2). Auch u.d.T. Ratio Gaii Caesaris de ordine anni per duodecim menses. \endash  Druck: Ps.-Beda Venerabilis, De embolismorum ratione computus, PL 90, Sp. 799; vgl. auch Charles W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Jones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bedae Pseudepigrapha. Scientific Writings falsely attributed to Bede. Ithaca 1939, S. 74f. \endash  (Nr. 3) David \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Juste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les manuscrits astrologiques latins conserv\u233 \'e9s \u224 \'e0 la Bayerische Staatsbibliothek de Munich. Paris 2011 (Documents, \u233 \'e9tudes et r\u233 \'e9pertoire 81), S. 139f.; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: N\u252 \'fcrnberg, GNM, Hs. 3224, 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 4) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: N\u252 \'fcrnberg, GNM, Hs. 3224, 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

