\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II (Bl. 102-120)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bonaventura: Parvum bonum de triplici via
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paruum bonum vel regimen consciencie d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bonauenture, quod vocatur fons vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecce descripsi eam tripliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 22,20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum omnis scientia gerat trinitatis insigne et precipue illa, que doceat in sacra scriptura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et in prima uiget consideracio. In ceteris uero dominatur affeccio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cap. 3 \u167 \'a7 7).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 4646, Bl. CVI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -CXII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 38. \endash  Edition: Sancti Bonaventurae opera omnia 8 (Quaracchi, wie oben 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 3-27, zur handschriftl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung ebd. S. X-XXV, Hs. genannt S. XVIII Nr. 155. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 2, S. 43 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 305am; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Distelbrink, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bonaventurae scripta, S. 22f. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 18; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (mit Supplement) 1856 (ohne diese Hs.).}

