\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Augustinus: De spiritu et anima
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb105\sa105\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipiunt excerpta Augustini de libro anime et spiritu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Magna namque negligencia est, nescire quid illud \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sit, quod celestia tam profunde cogitamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ne uacua sint, si strenuum operarium inuenerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 40, 779-784). \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De differencia spiritus et anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De duplici vita anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De oculo anime\u8249 \'8b Spiritus dicitur mens racionalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  et est tamq\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uam oculus anime, ad quem pertinet ymago et cognicio dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut bonum omnium commune fiat et quod quisque in se non habet, in altero possideat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 40, 785-792). \endash  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De caritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Caritas dei uia est ad \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 homines et uia hominum ad deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quoniam formam ignis retinet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 40, 792-802). \endash  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quomodo sensus fiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quedam uis ignea aere temperata a corde ad cerebrum ascendit, ibique purificata et colata per oculos, aures, nares\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 factus est homo et delicie illius esse cum filiis hominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 8,31) (PL 40, 802-807). \endash  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De caritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Caritas est concordia \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mentium et societatis et societas electorum, vita beatarum animarum et angelorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex desiderio patrie sue et uisionis dei, quem cernere finis est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PL 40, 809-816). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Der Verfasser ist m\u246 \'f6glicherweise Alcherus Claraevallensis. \endash  Druck: PL 40, 779-832; PLS 2, 1364. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 27; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kurz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus, Bd. 1, S. 231-235 (ohne diese Hs.); CPPM IIA, 153.}

