\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugo de S. Victore: Arrha animae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipit soliloquium Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Loquar secreto anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hoc totis precordiis concupisco.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Amen. Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Druck und Lit.: s.o. 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kurz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus, Bd. 1, S. 220f. Nr. 19 (Hs. genannt).}

