\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb-vb \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas de Aquino: Ex lectura super Johannem (cap. 1)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Thomas de uerbo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dicendum est, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quid sit hoc, quod dicitur verbum. Ad cuius euidenciam sciendum est, quod secundum philosophum ea, que sunt in uoce, sunt signa earum, que sunt in anima passionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 patet etiam, quod cum in qualibet natura illud quod procedit in similitudine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [et identitate] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nature ei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [us], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 a quo procedit, videtur, filius, et quod sit in vltimo, quod ideo dicatur filius, et productio eius dicatur generatio\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch u.d.T.: De differentia verbi divini et humani. \endash  Edition: S. Thomae Aquinatis super evangelium S. Joannis lectura, ed. Raffaele \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cai\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Turin/Rom 1952, S. 7-9 \u167 \'a7 25-29. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dondaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Shooner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 394 Nr. 1820.}

