\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas de Aquino: De operationibus occultis naturae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipit tractatus Thome de occultis operationibus nature\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam in quibusdam naturalibus corporibus quedam naturales actiones apparent, quarum principia nobis manifeste apprehendi non possunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 actiones vero, quas supra diximus, consequi corporum formas, sunt naturales, vtpote ex principiis intrinsecis procedentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Sancti Thomae Aquinatis ... Opera omnia iussu impensaque Leonis XIII. P.M. edita. Bd. 43: Opuscula IV. Rom 1976, zur handschriftl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung S. 164-168 (diese Hs. S. 165 Nr. 28 mit Sigle M\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  bezeichnet), S. 183-186 (Edition). \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zinner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 379 Nr. 12386 (Folioangabe falsch); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dondaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Shooner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 394 Nr. 1820.}

