\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Commentum in primum librum Ethicorum ad Nicomachum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quecumque scripta sunt, ad n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ostram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 octrinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 cripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 unt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ] (Rm 15,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sicut dicit philosophus primo Ethi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [corum]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Si vtique aliud aliquid divinorum est donum hominibus rationabile est felicitatem dei datam et maxime \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 humanorum quanto optimum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Aristoteles, Ethica Nicomachea; Bekker 1099b11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vt in minus philosophus felicitatem siue beatitudinem donum dei. Hec autem felicitas in dei tol\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [l]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 itur cognitione communi. Vnde Augustinus in libro de beata vita: Constitit inter nos, qui simul aderamus, non esse beatam vitam nisi perfectam cognitionem dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 32, 588) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt uero affectus nostri erigantur ad suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch. \endash  (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Besitzvermerk, wohl 2. H\u228 \'e4lfte 15. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iste liber pertinet ad sanctum Emmeramum Ratisponensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Anonymer Kommentar zu Buch 1 der Nikomachischen Ethik des Aristoteles. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dondaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Shooner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 394 Nr. 1820.}

