\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Orationes ad sanctam trinitatem
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctus sanctus sanctus dominus Deus Sabaoth, sancta trinitas et indivisa unitas, pater et filius et spiritus sanctus. Domine deus, omnipotens eterne et ineffabilis sine fine atque inicio, quem unum in trinitate et trinum in unitate confitemur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O clementissima maiestas infinita, o beatissima trinitas indiuisa et benedicta vnitas gloriosa. Tu filius, dominus omnipotens, deus rex piissimus et gubernator vniuersorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 protege, salua, benedic, sanctifica famulum tuum crucis per signaculum, morbos auerte corporis et anime, hoc contra signum nullum stet periculum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine Iesu Christe fili dei vivi, per sanctam tradicionem, vendicionem, comprehensionem, alligacionem et flagellacionem tuam et per spineam coronam tuam et sceptrum tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et colloca me in sinum Abrahe, amici tui, vbi tecum et cum omnibus electis tuis letari merear sine fine. Qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Auch u.d.T. Oratio Augustini; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Augsburg, UB, Cod. II.1.4\u176 \'b0 43, 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Berlin, SBB-PK, Ms. theol. lat. 4\u176 \'b0 72, 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; vgl. Die handschriftliche \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Werke des heiligen Augustinus. Bd. 10,2: Ostdeutschland und Berlin. Verzeichnis nach Bibliotheken, bearb. von Isabella \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schiller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Wien 2009 (Ver\u246 \'f6ffentlichungen der Kommission zur Herausgabe des Corpus der Lateinischen Kirchenv\u228 \'e4ter 26), S. 87; Innsbruck, UuLB, Cod. 402, 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 8\u176 \'b0 Cod. ms. 193, 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Henricus Suso: Cursus de aeterna sapientia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salutem mentis et corporis donet nobis Ihesus sapientia dei patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 torium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus in adiutorium meum intende. Eterne sapiencie fontem adoremus. Venite exsultemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ympnus: Jhesus, dulcis memoria dans vera cordis gaudia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fragilitatem nostram, quesumus domine, propicius respice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et tibi summo bono ardenti desiderio iugiter adherere. Per eundem. Eterna sapientia benedicat et custodiat corda et corpora nostra. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Heinrich Seuses Horologium sapientiae. Erste kritische Ausgabe unter Ben\u252 \'fctzung der Vorarbeiten von Dominikus Planzer, O.P., hrsg. von Pius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 K\u252 \'fcnzle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Freiburg (Schweiz) 1977 (Spicilegium Friburgense 23), S. 606 Z. 4-S. 618 Z. 13; zur separaten Rezeption des Cursus vgl. ebd. S. 246-249 (diese Hs. nicht genannt).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas a Kempis: De imitatione Christi (lib. 3)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Confirma me deus per gratiam sancti spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ne sic enim incepta pergitur via\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cap. 27.16-21; Ed. S. 207). \endash  (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oratio. Domine Deus meus, tu es omnia bona mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et antequam natus essem in mundo. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cap. 3.25-34; Ed.: S. 139f.). \endash  (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Concede, benignissime Ihesu, michi gratiam tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hoc est in te summo et eterno bono, dormiam et requiescam. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cap. 15.15-22; Ed.: S. 175). \endash  (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine deus meus, ne elongeris a me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et pacienter consolacionem tuam exspectare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cap. 23.13-17; Ed.: S. 197). \endash  (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oratio. Clarifica me, Ihesu bone, claritate eterni luminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et absque te friuola sunt vniuersa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cap. 23.18-26; Ed.: S. 198f). \endash  (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oratio. Sit nomen tuum benedictum, domine in secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quanto difficilius, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 tanto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tibi facilior est mutacio dextere excelsi. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cap. 29.1-16; Ed.: S. 209f.).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: De imitatione Christi libri quatuor, ed. Tiburzio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vatikanstadt 1982 (Storia e attualit\u224 \'e0 6).}

