\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis: Orationes Carthusiae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 reator omnium rerum, deus omnipotens, cuius principium inicium non recipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Odonay\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte \plain \f1\ul\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 donay) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deus, magne et mirabilis, qui precipis proximum diligi et pro inimicis orari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 R\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex regum, o altissime domine Ihesu Christe, splendor glorie et figura substancie summi patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 T\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 u solus sanctus, tu solus dominus, tu solus altissimus, Ihesu Christe, sacerdos eterne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 H\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ospes honoris hospicium amoris gaudium in requie deus et domine, spiritus sancte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rogamus te per id\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24\cf1 U\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 eni\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancte spiritus, victor invincibilis, nostra victus miseria, cape nos cathenis septiformis gracie tue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 S\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anctus, sanctus, sanctus dominus deus exercituum, sancta trinitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n manus tuas, domine, commendamus nos per personarum trinitatem et maiestatis vnitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ve, lucis speculum, deitatis sacrarium, trinitatis triclinium festiuitas angelorum et hominum Maria gratia plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die Anfangsbuchstaben der neun Gebete ergeben CARTHUSIA. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Basel, UB, B X 11, 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Weimar, HAAB, Oct. 63, 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haimerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Fr\u246 \'f6mmigkeit, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 97 und Anm. 574-578. \endash  (Nr. 2) Auch gedruckt in: GW M39510 = BSB-Ink S-19, Bl. 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

