\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Orationes ante eucharistiam V
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O dulcissima miseratrix miserorum peccatorum, virgo perpetua sancta Maria, assiste nunc mihi sicut astitisti vnigenito tuo domino nostro Ihesu Christo pendenti in cruce \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sacratissimum corpus et sangwinem domini nostri Ihesu Christi, qui pro salute humani generis mactabaris in cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ave redemptor mundi, qui pro nobis dignatus es hanc carnem de virgine immaculata Maria sumere et hunc pretiosissimum sangwinem de tuo sancto latere effu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [n]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dere voluisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et requiem eternam concede, quatenus te pie patre miserante ad eternam beatitudinem valeamus pervenire. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine Ihesu Christe, via, veritas et vita, petimus, ut tui nos consortes facias, qui de celo veniens vitam mundo largitus es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui solus mundus es, absterge, ut fa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ciati corpore tuo et sangwine ab omnibus piaculis emundemur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qvi venisti redimere perditos noli dampnare redemptos. Redemptor mundi, adiuua nos, ne pereat in nobis redemptio tua per assumpcionem corporis et sangwinis tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et in eternum celestis potus mihi ante omnia et super omnia dulcis et proficuus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ave sanctissimum et celeberrimum corpus dominicum, in hoc sacramento veraciter contentum tam magnum, ut in crvce pro tocius generis humani redempcione pependisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Heidelberg, UB, Cod. Sal. VII 1, 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; St. Gallen, StiftsB, Cod. Sang. 520, p. 232. \endash  (Nr. 2) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haimerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Fr\u246 \'f6mmigkeit, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 90f. Anm. 537\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \endash  (Nr. 6) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wilmart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Auteurs, S. 379 Anm. 1; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haimerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Fr\u246 \'f6mmigkeit, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 70 Anm. 379, S. 75 Anm. 423.}

