\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Orationes ante eucharistiam VII
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ) Item alie orationes. Domine, sancte pater, omnipotens eterne deus, concede mihi reo et infelicissimo peccatori sacratissimi filii tui, domini nostri Ihesu Christi, corpus et sanguinem ita sumere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed solum in me viuas, me quoque tibi solum viuere facias. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oratio. Omnipotens et misericors deus, ecce ego miser et indignus peccator, accedo ad sacramentum corporis et sanguinis vnigeniti filii tui, domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oratio. Omnipotens sempiterne deus, tue gracie pietatem supplici deuocione, vt omnium malorum meorum vincula soluas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oratio. Summe sacerdos et vere pontifex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ne irasceris, queso, domine benignissime, ne irasceris, clementissime Ihesu, quod ego inmundus inmundo corde ac polutus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 poluta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mente ad sacrosanctum corpus pretiosumque sangwinem tuum accedere presumo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 reuelata tandem facie contemplari. Saluator mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine, deus meus, non sum dignus, vt intres sub tectum meum, sed confisus de tua pietate et clemencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salutacio ad sacramentum. Ave fili dei viui dulcissime, domine Ihesu Christe potentissime. Ave verbum patris, filius virginis, agnus dei, salus mundi, hostia sacra, verbum caro factum, fons pietatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oratio. Domine Ihesu Christe, licet sim nimis indignus eciam invocare nomen sanctum tuum multoque indignior confiteri tractare iugiterque sumere dignissimum tui corporis sangwinisque misterium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 semper interpellans pro nobis. Qui cum eodem patre et s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [piritu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ancto]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sit honor et gloria ac gratiarum accio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus, qui nos eximia caritate tua ita gratuite dilexisti et proprio vnigenito tuo pro nobis a morte non pepercisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 amore amplectendo sibi benedicto filio tuo in dulcedine spiritus tui mereamur feliciter vniri. Cui tecum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 2) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 237, 279; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Haimerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Fr\u246 \'f6mmigkeit, S. 126 Anm. 771. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 3) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Deshusses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sacramentaire 2, S. 106f. Nr. 2200. \endash  (Nr. 4) Johannes Fiscannensis, Oratio ante missam, ed. PL 17, 829-833; PL 158, 921A-924C; vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Wilmart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Auteurs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 101-125, Edition S. 114-124. \endash  Lit.: Kurt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ruh\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 1 (1978), Sp. 327f. \endash  (Nr. 5) Druck: GW M39510 = BSB-Ink S-19, Bl. 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 6) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Haimerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Fr\u246 \'f6mmigkeit, S. 91 Anm. 537. \endash  (Nr. 7) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Wilmart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Auteurs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 24 Anm. 2 und S. 412 Nr. III.}

