\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Horae de passione domini
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ad Matutinam: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Heu misera condicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Primam: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iam lucis orto sidere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Tertiam: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cvr diem inutiliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Ad Sextam: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio sequitur bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O mira dei bonitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Nonam: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O stupor incognitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad Nonas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Ad Vesperas: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quas hore laudes efferam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vesperas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Ad Completorium: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iam dies, ecce, preterit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Comple\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [torium] (AH 30, S. 61-64 Nr. 25; Hs. mit Sigle C genannt). \endash  Collectae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnipotens sempiterne deus, qui vnigenitum filium tuum, dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum, crucem, claues coronam spineam et lanceam diram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a peccatorum nostrorum nexibus liberemur et ad\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  gaudia perducamur eterna. Per eundem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85}

