\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Orationes diversae II
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Clementissima domina et dulcissima virgo sancta Maria, mater dei, omni pietate plenissima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicat me, pater et filius et spiritus sanctus. Benedicat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancta trinitas et indiuisa vnitas. Benedicat me totus exercitus angelorum et custodiat me ab omni malo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 benedicat me, sanctum sepulchrum, in quo iacuisti. Amen. Per crucis huius signum fugiat procul omne malignum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Druck: GW M39510 = BSB-Ink S-19, Bl. 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

