\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Orationes ad BMV I
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [G]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aude, dei genitrix, virgo semper immaculata, Maria, mater gracie, mater misericordie, quia iam corpora \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et anima super omnes choros angelorum exaltata es et coronata ad reginam celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nos perducat tuis meritis et precibus filius tuus, dominus noster Ihesus Christus, cum quo tu, gloriosa virgo Maria, viuis ac regnas per infinita secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ant.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regina celi letare alleluia, quia quem meruisti portare, alleluia, resurrexit sicut dixit alleluia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Cantus 004597); \u8483 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gaude letare virgo Maria alleluia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus, qui perpetuam virginem Mariam corpore et anima in celum assum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [p]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sisti et coronasti, concede nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tabat mater dolorosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iuxta crucem lacrimosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (AH 54, S. 312f. Nr. 201); (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Interveniat pro nobis, quesumus, domine Ihesu Christe, nunc vel in hora mortis nostre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Corpus orationum 3178b)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Ant. 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ave nostra dei genitrix intacta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cantus a00605, a00605a-c); Ant. 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gaude dei genitrix, virgo immaculata, gaude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cantus 002920).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 3) Andreas\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Krass\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Stabat mater dolorosa. Lateinische \u220 \'dcberlieferung und volkssprachliche \u220 \'dcbertragungen im deutschen Mittelalter. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1998 (Forschungen zur Geschichte der \u228 \'e4lteren deutschen Literatur 22), S. 31 (diese Hs. mit Sigle m15), 44 (zur handschriftl. Verbreitung), 51, 149 (Position in Andachts- und Gebetb\u252 \'fcchern).}

