\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Orationes ad BMV II
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Maria succurre miseriis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctissima et gloriosissima, piissima et clementissima virgo Maria, commendo tibi animam et corpus meum, votum meum et omnia mea diuina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (nachgetragen in der Fu\u223 \'dfzeile)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et humana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sancta Maria succurre miseris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sanctissima et gloriosissima et piissima dei genitrix, virgo Maria, tu voci oracionis mee propicia intende et pias ac puras manus pro me ad filium tuum extende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sancta Maria succurre miseriis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Regina clemencie \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maria vocata diuersis antiquitus modis nominata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut dolores mulceas et emendas fata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Hymnen, Bd. 2, S. 411f. Nr. 600\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 16) Unmittelbar anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primum fuit gaudium | Cum, virgo, vidisti | Gabrielem nuncium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 virgo virginum melioria in eum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (AH 31, S. 175, Nr. 170; Str. 6 ab Vers 2 abweichend)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aue gaude. Salue vale. O beatissima dei genitrix virgo Maria, mater misericordie et consolatrix omnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Alia oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Aue, virgo virginum, flos et maris stella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (AH 30, S. 268f. Nr. 148). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oracio vel commendacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Me commendo tibi, deus alme petendo, ut me pausantem conserues et vigilantem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Deus, pater eterne, omnibus assistens, omnium artifex scientiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et laudabiliter terminandi in laude tue maiestatis assurgam. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Te matrem dei laudamus | Te Mariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [virginem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 confitemur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1-3) Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14528, 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 4) Ulrich St\u246 \'f6ckl, Abt von Wessobrunn, Psalterium Virginis Mariae in tria Rosaria dispertitum. Tegernsee 1573, Bl. 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (VD16 S 9184). \endash  (Nr. 6) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Ebstorf, KlosterB, IV 5, 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Mainz, StB, Hs I 300, 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 8) Druck und Lit. s.o. 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (mit leicht abweichendem Wortlaut).}

