\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sertum beatae Mariae virginis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item Sertum beate virginis Marie editum a Conrado priore Carthusiensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ordinis]\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aue, salue, gaude, uale | O Maria, non vernale | Sed hiis rosis spiritale | Tibi plecto nunc crinale | Figurarum flosculis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O Maria, recreamen | Placa patrem natum flamen | Ut finale post examen | Sibi nos coniungat amen | In celesti patria. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: verglichen mit GW 4070 = BSB-Ink C-526, Bl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 a1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 ]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 -[a3]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Chevalier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  1, Nr. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 1803\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Repertorium 1 (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2011), S. 876, B 1700-360/5.}

