\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oratio ad BMV III
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aue mundi spes, Maria, aue mitis, aue pia | Plena gracia reis, da solacia | Ave virgo, mater Christi | Tu, que sola meruisti | Esse mater sine viro | Et lactare more miro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mors, si carnem meam frangat | Mors secunda non me tangat | Et si caro computrescat | Spiritus in te requiescat | Dum resurgam te visurus | Apud te semper sim mansurus. Ihesu Christe, saluator mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
