\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De confessione
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum est ordo siue modus, quod secundum determinacionem doctorum confessor in confessione debet obseruare. Primo si accedens ad confessionem dicat confessori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Poterit confessor respondere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus sit in corde tuo et in labiis tuis, ut humiliter, discrete et vtiliter peccata tua confitearis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnia quoque bona opera ecclesie militantis et que in ipso dono dei fecisti et facies seu facere disposuisti in futuris, in nomine p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [atris] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et f\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ilii] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [piritus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancti]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et finaliter confitenti poterit dicere confessor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vade in pace et amplius noli peccare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote . \endash  35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ungedruckt.}

