\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Antoninus Florentinus: Confessionale \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8218 \'82Defecerunt\lquote  (Recensio brevior)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In tractatu de instruccione simplicium confessorum editum a domino Anthonino archiepiscopo Florentino sic dicitur de infirmis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa infirmos sic est agendum aut enim est talis in articulo mortis aut non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 a domino papa pro vltimo articulo mortis tue. In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Druck: Bl. l5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -l7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item tractatus de absolucione et penitencie iniunccione ipsius Anthonini archiepiscopi Florentini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Postquam penitens dixit ex se pacta sua uel ex interrogacione sui confessoris \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut querat semper oraciones et participaciones bonorum, que fiunt in religionibus et indulgenciis et huiusmodi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Druck: Bl. l3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - l5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps.-Johannes Chrysostomus, Sermo de poenitentia:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Crisostomi de penitencia. Prouida mente et profundo cogitatu cognosci debent duo rerum distincta negocia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et plena penitencia tua atque perfecta promerebit indulgenciam prestante vero domino nostro Ihesu Christo in secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Druck: Bl. l7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -m1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Item tractatus Antonini archiepiscopi Florentini de informacione et interrogacionibus, quo ad coniugatos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nunc formande sunt interrogaciones non ad omnes, sed ad quosdam secundum status eorum, et primo quo ad coniugatos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 si uterque eciam filios \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [non]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  educat in timore dei et obedienca mandatorum eius ad quod tenentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Druck: Bl. g4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -g8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ). \endash  (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Eciam interrogandum est. Si videlicet osculatus est aliquem uel aliquam ex libidine et extra coniugium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 uel misit huiusmodi ex amore libidinoso mortaliter peccauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Druck: Bl. g3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 2-g4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 3). \endash  (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Scias eciam, quod luxuriam, que committitur extra matrimonium, semper facit mortale peccatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 operatus est eciam sacrilegium et ob hoc grauius peccatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Druck: Bl. d6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 12). \endash  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De delectacione morosa. Delectacio morosa reperitur, ut frequenter in tepidis et multum negligentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 si habuit horrorem ad uitam futuram propter delectaciones carnales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Druck: Bl. g4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 3-g4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De inmundicia. Inmundicia potest intellegi, cum quis immunde comedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et preter voluntatem ac sine procuracione et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [non] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 est mortale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Druck: Bl. g3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 18-g3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 16). \endash  97a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -97mm\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: verglichen mit GW 2097 = BSB-Ink A-572. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schulte, GQ\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  2, S. 445; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes, S. 73-75; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Scriptores 1, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 239 (S. 81 Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (mit Supplement) 4301; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 CALMA 3 (2011), S. 299 Nr. 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Johannes Chrysostomus, Omnia opera \u8230 \'85 in septem tomos divisa. Bd. 5. Basel: Andreas Cratander, 1525 (VD16 J 398), Bl. 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: Andr\u233 \'e9 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wilmart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La collection des 38 hom\u233 \'e9lies latines de Saint Jean Chrysostome, in: The Journal of Theological Studies 19 (1918), S. 305-327, hier S. 307 Anm. 1; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 CPPM IA\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 2353.}

