\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Thomas de Aquino: Summa theologiae IIa-II\plain \f1\b\super\lang1033\fs24 ae\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sequentes Questiones sunt ex Secunda secunde beati Thome. Sequitur prima questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vtrum votum obedience sit potissimum inter vota religionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Responsio secundum Thomam qu. 186, art. 8:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Respondeo dicendum, quod votum obediencie est precipuum inter tria vota religionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod non est in voto obediencie dispensare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (qu. 186 art. 8 conclusio, ad 1, ad 3). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Utrum obediencia sit maxima virtutum. Responsio secundum Thomam, qu. 186, art. 3 in responsione principali dicendum sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [quod] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 peccatum consistit in hoc, quod homo, contempto deo rebus, commutabilibus bonis inheret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicitur enim I Io 2, quod qui dicit se nosse deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Io 2,4) (qu. 104 art. 3 conclusio). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1452\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Alia questio sancti Thome\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Utrum religiosus teneatur obedire prelato suo precipienti sibi aliquid contra regulam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 item in dubio dicit Augustinus xxiii, qu. 1: Quid culpatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Decretum Gratiani, C.23 q.1 c.4). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Alia questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Utrum votum obediencie sit potissimum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (s. Nr. 1). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Questio de obediencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Utrum obediencia sit maxima virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (s. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nr. 2). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Questio de continencia regularis vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Utrum perpetua continencia requiratur ad religionis perfeccionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Qu. 186 art. 4 responsio principalis dicendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [est], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quod ad statum religionis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 requiritur abstraccio, que hominem impedit ne totaliter feratur ad dei seruicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sit dampnatus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Jerominianus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui adequauit matrimonium virginitati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (qu. 186 art. 4 conclusio). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Questio de paupertate regularis vite ordinis sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Utrum paupertas requiratur ad perfeccionem religionis. Responsio secundum Thomam, qu. 186 art. ii, responsio principalis dicendum, quod status religionis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est quoddam exercicium et disciplina, per quam pervenitur ad perfectionem caritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ideo multum valet ad celestem beatitudinem consequendam, vnde et dominus in ewangelio dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vade et vende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 19,21) (qu. 186 art. 3 conclusio, ad 2, ad 4). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vtrum religiosus semper peccet mortaliter transgrediendo ea que sunt in regula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 frequencia tamen peccati disposicionem inducit ad contemptum secundum illud prouerbiorum 18: Impius, cum in profundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 18,3) (qu. 186 art. 9); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Satis concordat cum hiis Vl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ricus], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vbi supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , [\u167 \'a7] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Cum autem dominus et sequentibus et addit sic dicens, quod alia statuta sunt sub precepto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sicud frangere silencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 3) Johannes de Friburgo, Summa confessorum, lib. 3, tit. 33, qu. 8; Paris: Jean Petit, 1519, Bl. cliiii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 7b) Ulrich von Stra\u223 \'dfburg, De summo bono, lib. 6, tract. 4 \u167 \'a7 10, ed. in: Bd. 6,3: Liber 6, Tractatus 4, 1-15, hrsg. von Coralba \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Colomba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Irene \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zavattero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Mit einem Vorwort von Loris \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sturlese\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Hamburg 2017 (Corpus philosophorum Teutonicorum medii aevi 1,6,3), S. 96 Z. 129-137.}

