\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 -119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Bernhardus Claraevallensis\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Liber de praecepto et dispensione
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Bernhardus de precepto et dispensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Prima igitur questio circa regulam nostram versatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et si inpenitens perseuero vsque ad mortem, peccaui eciam dampnabiliter. Hec idem Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 3: Tractatus et opuscula, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Rom 1963, S. 253-294, hier S. 254 Z. 23-S. 275 Z. 5.}

