\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Hieronymus: Epistula ad Rusticum monachum (ep. 125)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ieronimus ad Rusticum monachum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nunc, inquit, monachi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [in]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cunabula mores que \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 discutimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 multo tempore disce, quod doceas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ep. 125 \u167 \'a7 8-17, ed. CSEL 56, S. 127 Z. 15-S. 137 Z. 8). \endash  (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Disce, quod possis docere, et rationabilem hostiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 offeras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Christo, ne miles antequam tyro, ne magister plus sis quam discipulus. Hec ille\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 8, ed. ebd., S. 127 Z. 9-11). \endash  (Z. 6) Daran Kurzzitate in Auswahl: (Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus super Cantica, sermone 22: Tv, qui in congregacione es, bene viue, ordinabiliter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Sermo 1 in sollemnitate Petri et Pauli ap., in: Opera omnia 5, rec. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , wie oben 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 190 Z. 9-11; (Z. 17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Claustralis paradisus ad suauem spirantis austri clementiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Sententiarum series tertia, \u167 \'a7 91, in: Opera omnia 6,2, rec. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , wie oben 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 140 Z. 19-21); (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ideo monacho professionem, habitu et incessu demonstra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in gestu grauitas. Hec Jeronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Isidorus Hispalensis, Synonyma, lib. 2 \u167 \'a7 43, ed. CCL 111B, ed. Jacques \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Elfassi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 96f. Z. 431-434). \endash  (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) Kalendernotiz zum 25.3.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec omnia facta sunt in annunciacione dominica viii Kalendas Aprilis annunciacio Marie: Passio domini, mundus creatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicunt eciam iudei in hac die dominum ad iudicandum omnem venturum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. AH 15, S. 10 Nr. 5). \endash  (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota: Sex operatur aqua per presbyterum benedicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 17608). Im Seitensteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1453\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

