\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas a Kempis: De imitatione Christi (lib. 1)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De monastica vita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Cap. 17: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oportet, ut discas te ipsum in multis frangere, si vis pacem et concordiam cum aliis tenere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 propter deum humiliare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 47f.). \endash  (Z. 21) Cap. 12-13.5: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bonum nobis est, quod aliquando habeamus aliquas grauitates et contrarietates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia in illis homo humiliatur, purgatur et eruditur. Amen. Hec ille\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 34-36). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 FA. 1453 Brigide virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1. Februar 1453).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: De imitatione Christi libri quatuor, ed. Tiburzio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vatikanstadt 1982 (Storia e attualit\u224 \'e0 6).}

