\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Fides catholica (Schema)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Scitum fidei katholice compilatum a beato Jeronimo quo ad sanctam trinitatem 1453\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b Schema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pater est Deus, Pater non est Filius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Filius est Deus; Filius non est Spiritus Sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Spiritus Sanctus est Deus; Spiritus Sanctus non est Pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .}

