\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bonaventura: De praeparatione ad missam
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Tractatus Bonaventure de corpore Christi et de preparacione ad eius deuotam suscepcionem rectamque misse celebracionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ad honorem gloriose ac indiuidue trinitatis et ad honorem excellentissimi sacri corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 hoc autem non reputes posse tua uirtute, sed auxilio gracie, quod ipse tibi et mihi prestare dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec Bonaventura Cardinalis de corpore Christi. 1453 in die Gregorii pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 in Castello\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (12. M\u228 \'e4rz 1453).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 De instructione sacerdotis ad se praeparandum ad celebrandam missam. \endash  Edition: Bonaventurae, Opera omnia 12, ed. Adolphe Charles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peltier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Paris 1868, S. 278a-287b. \endash  Sancti Bonaventurae opera omnia. Bd. 8: Opuscula varia ad theologiam mysticam et res Ordinis Fratrum Minorum spectantia, ed. studio et cura PP. Collegii a Sancta Bonaventura. Quaracchi 1898, S. CXVIII (Hs. genannt), S. 97-106.}

