\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Hoffmann von Schweidnitz: Tractatus de communione sub utraque specie
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sequuntur aliqua excerpta \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex tractatu magistri Johannis Hofmann sacre theologie professoris, que versantur circa sacramentum Eukaristiae\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  1421\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dubitatur, an propter nocturnam pollucionem quis debeat a sumpcione Christi corporis abstinere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quamuis possit ad tempus laudabiliter abstinere propter reuerenciam sacramenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Druck: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Bl. 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 11-157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 3). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item quattuor modis solet fieri pollucio quandoque: ex firmitate et debilitate uel ex superfluitate illius humoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 attamen si talis prius in illis cogitacionibus pessimis consistit et sic intellige de pluribus aliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cauenda circa intencionem consecrantibus. Qvicumque intendit celebrare uel eciam in sanitate communicare, cauere debet, ne post mediam noctem cibum aut potum sumpserit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 nec esset turbatus in capite. Hec ex summa Hostiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Druck: Johannes \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hoffmann von Schweidn\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 itz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Tractatus de communione sub utraque specie. Venedig 1571); zum Verfasser s. 14776, 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 2. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f3\lang1024\fs20 Polonica w \u347 \'9credniowiecznych r\u281 \'eakopisach bibliotek monachijskich. Opracowali Jerzy \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wolny\plain \f3\lang1024\fs20  / Mieczys\u322 \'b3aw \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Markowski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  /\plain \f3\lang1024\fs20  Zdzis\u322 \'b3aw \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kuksewicz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Breslau u.a. 1969, S. 105 (Hs. genannt). \endash  (Nr. 2) \u196 \'c4hnlicher Text in: Thomas de Aquino, Summa theologiae, III\u170 \'aa qu. 80 art. 7 conclusio. \endash  (Nr. 3) Edition: Consuetudines castellenses 1, ed. Petrus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Siegburg 1996 (Corpus consuetudinum monasticarum 14,1), S. 262 Z. 10-263 Z. 1. Vgl. auch Hermannus de Schildesche, Speculum sacerdotum (GW 12301 = BSB-Ink H-110.050), Bl. v\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 [vi]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .}

