\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas a Kempis: De imitatione Christi (lib. 1)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De monastica vita. Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oportet, quod discas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  te ipsum in multis frangere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 propter deum humiliare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cap. 17); (vorletzte Zeile) cap. 19; (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 20; (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 22; (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 16; (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 13; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 8; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 9; (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 10; (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 11; (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 12; (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 2; (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 3; (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 4, 6; (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 7; (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 25; (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tantum proficies, quantum tibi ipsi vim intuleris. Benedictus. Cum humiliari et turbari te uideris, habeto illud signum in bonum omnino argumentum gratie appropinquantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt ammoniciones ad spiritualem vitam vtiles ad fratrem Chunradum de Fric\u658 ?laria 1453 in vigilia annunciacionis virginis Marie per fratrem Fridericum professum monasterii S. Emmerami ordinis S. Benedicti dyocesis Ratisponensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. auch oben 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Edition: De imitatione Christi libri quatuor, ed. Tiburzio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vatikanstadt 1982 (Storia e attualit\u224 \'e0 6), S. 7-86. \endash  Lit.: Piergiovanni \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bonardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Tiburzio\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L'imitazione di Cristo e il suo autore. Bde. 1-2. Turin 1964, hier Bd. 2, S. 215 Nr. 249 (Hs. genannt); Stephanus G.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Axters\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , De imitatione Christi. Een handschrifteninventaris bij het vijfhonderdste verjaren van Thomas Hemerken van Kempen, \u8224 \'86 1471. Kempen 1971 (Schriftenreihe des Kreises Kempen-Krefeld 27), S. 65 (Hs. genannt).}

