\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ordo S. Benedicti cepit Anno domini v\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  xxxi\u176 \'b0. Ordo Cluniacensis Anno domini viii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  xii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item M ccc l xxxxviii 1388 translacione beate Birgitte nouem 9 dies post festum Michaelis sub Bonifacio papa nono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (7. Oktober 1388).}

