\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hermannus de Schildesche: Speculum sacerdotum (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quando sacerdos deficit uel moritur ante Canonem non est necesse, quod alius missam compleat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed que desunt in summa et lectura Hostiensis in ty\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 tulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de ce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 lebracione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  misse plenius continentur, ubi requirantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 12301 = BSB-Ink H-110.050, Bl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 [vi]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 [vii]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .}

