\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De vita claustrali II
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Venerabilis Beda dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O uos sacerdotes dei, vos tangunt sermones mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 13074). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bonaventura: Si quis ad altaria digne cupias celebrare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 17901). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O homo velox ad mensam, tardus ad ecclesiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 11178). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec seruare decet omnem religiosum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ut sit deuotus in choro, discretus in capitulo, sobrius in refectorio, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 disciplinatus in omni loco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 numquam extra se in cordis evagatione.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si prelatus es, sit triplex incorruptio: sermo dulcis, hilaris w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ltus, pietas cordis, puritas mentis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Si sacerdos es, serua castitatem, tene feruidam obieccionem, postpone uoluntatem propriam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 12) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De cottidiana discussione sui ipsius et que sint fugienda et que tolleranda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sepissime discute te ipsum et considera mentis et corporis tui statum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 non diligi indignum nec ullam ei reuerenciam exhiberi, quare contra iustum deum conaris diligi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 debet studere ergo virtutibus ornari, quibus merearis diligi a deo et hominibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Augustinus ad monachos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ista sunt instrumenta ad perfeccionem monachi. Nam qui adhuc rudis est et in desertum vadit, vbi potest se probare?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 humilitatem et pacienciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ed. S. 581f. Z. 43-74); (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sunt enim quidam, qui volunt esse remoti a mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quoniam omne opus bonum a deo et ipso auxiliante perficitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ed. S. 580 Z. 1-18). \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Reuolue hoc in corde tuo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Monachus debet sepissime ex intimo cordis affectu voluntati diuine voluntatem suam plenarie subicere et resignare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 perduc me ad te, qui es benedictus in secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Kurzzitate u.a. von Bernhard: (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 4-12) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mens, que sancti spiritus a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [b]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scessum ignorat, patet seduccioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Opera omnia 1, rec. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Talbot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , wie oben 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 98 Z. 21f.); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Spiritus sanctus, quando venit uel quando recedit, periculosissime ignoratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Opera omnia 1, rec. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Talbot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , wie oben 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 15f.); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ergo cum te torpore uel accidia affici sentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 donec denuo, suscitante gratia, factus promptior alacriorque, curas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Opera omnia 1, rec. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Talbot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , wie oben 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 124 Z. 26-S. 125 Z. 1). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec omnia ex libello, qui uocatur \u8218 \'82Ineuitabile\u8219 ', que supra scripta sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sciendum est, quod perdicio pereuntium non procedit ex voluntate dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic semper miseri erunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 4) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Neustift/Novacella, Augustiner-Chorherrenstift, Cod. 145, 314\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 6)\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 David ab Augusta, De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione secundum triplicem statum incipientium, proficientium et perfectorum libri tres, castigati et denuo editi a patribus collegii s. Bonaventurae. Quaracchi 1899, lib. 1, cap. 41, S. 56f. (mit Zusatz). \endash  (Nr. 7) Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ancien sermon monastique dans le manuscrit Palat. Lat. 295, in: M\u233 \'e9langes Eug\u232 \'e8ne Tisserant 6. Vatikanstadt 1964 (Biblioth\u232 \'e8que Vaticane 1, 6; Studi e testi 236), S. 577-582. \endash  (Nr. 8) Gerlaci Petri opera omnia, cura et studio Mikel M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kors\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  cum epistolarum translatione Helen \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rolfson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Turnhout 1996 (CCCM 155), S. 291 Z. 512-521. \endash  (Nr. 10): Honorius Augustodunensis, Liber Inevitabile, ed. PL 172, 1203D.}

