\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De consuetudinibus monasticis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item 1098 Robertus abbas monasterii Molismensis propter transgressionem et deformacionem regule sancti Benedicti primo fundauit Cystercium ibique collectis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 postea monachis erant fundata quasi centum 60 monasteria et sic deinceps quomodo nunc Bernhardinenses siue Cistercienses vocantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 2a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 (180\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Z. 3) De iterata professione nouiciorum et (!) est uel hospitum: Ego frater N veniens de alieno monasterio in hoc monasterium \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 etiam si tale quid ei in dormiendo contingat. \endash  \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 2b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 18) Profess der Konversen: Item professio vnius conuersi, si scit legere, legit per se, sin autem magister suus legit loco sui et talis est forma: Ich pruder N gelob stetikait vnd bekerung meiner syten \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 vnd schont mich nit von meiner wartung. \endash  \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 2c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 (181\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) Gebetsvorschriften f\u252 \'fcr das Offizium der Konversen: Ad matutinas (?) scilicet ad terciam oracionem. Pater noster kyri\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [e] kn\u1265 ?ende oder gena\u1265 ?gt, darnach den gelauben vnd Ave Maria \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 vnd al\u658 ? vil Requiem vnd sol da\u658 ? verpringen in Jars frist. \endash  \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (181\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9bQualiter instante tribulacione \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deus inuocandus est\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b Anima ad Christum: Sit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nomen tuum, domine, benedictum in secula, qui voluisti hanc temptacionem et tribulacionem venire super me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tanto tibi difficillior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 H\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ec mutacio dextere excelsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 76,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec Bernhardus. 1453 quinta feria cene ante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [festum]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Septem gradus, per quos deducendus est contumax monachus. Primus est admonicio secreta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in capitulo 23 regule et 28 capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Z. 7-letzte Zeile) Daran Kurzzitate von Bernhard, Augustinus, Ambrosius. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Bibelverse: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Moyses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Genesis primo capitulo. Creauit deus celum et terram et omnia, que in eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Gn 1,1) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Matheus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Et in vitam eternam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 25,46). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1453 Leonis noni pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b (19. April 1453). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Professformel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ego frater N., presbyter et monachus professus monasterii sancti N. ordinis S. Benedicti cognosco et fateor publice, quod reuerendus in Christo pater et dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ad petitionem meam accomodauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 hanc cedulam propria manu scriptam trado.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Datum 1454 dominica etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) M\u246 \'f6glicherweise an das Exordium parvum angelehnter \u220 \'dcberblick \u252 \'fcber die Gr\u252 \'fcndung des Klosters C\u238 \'eeteaux durch Robert von Molesme. Edition des Exordium u.a. in: Les plus anciens textes de C\u238 \'eeteaux. Sources, textes et notes historiques, ed. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de la\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Croix Bouton\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Jean Baptiste \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 van Damme\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Achel 1974 (C\u238 \'eeteaux, Commentarii cistercienses. Studia et documenta 2), S. 54-86, hier cap. 3 S. 59f. \endash  (Nr. 2a) Consuetudines castellenses 1, ed. Petrus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Siegburg 1996 (Corpus consuetudinum monasticarum 14,1), S. 377 Z. 24-S. 378 Z. 1, 18-24; (Nr. 2c) vgl. ebd., S. 420 Z. 26-S. 422 Z. 15. \endash  (Nr. 3) De imitatione Christi libri quatuor, ed. Tiburzio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vatikanstadt 1982 (Storia e attualit\u224 \'e0 6), lib. 3, cap. 29, S. 209f. \endash  (Nr. 4) Consuetudines castellenses 1 (wie Nr. 2a), S. 331 Z. 4-11.}

