\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Capitulum de Paschate invencione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 . [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 abito itaque numero supra, quam currit luna in aureo numero et etiam littera dominicali ad propositum tempus, in quo diem pasche inquirere volueris, memorie commenda hos versus: Suaue bi vacatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  Z. 8) Am Rand, beschnitten: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 De numero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  [cycli] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 lunaris consta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [t] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 decem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  [et novem]. [Q]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 vare autem cyclus lunaris constat ex decem et nouem annis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Est quia in decem et nouem annis sunt ducenti triginta quinque menses lunares complete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 invenitur coniunccio solis et lune post reuolucionem decem et nouem annorum in principio eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (unleserlich) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 iterum fieret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 coniunccio solis et lune, quia ita non est, vt prius probatum fuit, ideo per sedecim horas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85||}

