\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I (Bl. 1-81)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sermones de BMV
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [F]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ecit sibi rex Salomon tronum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (III Rg 10,18-20). \endash  (Z. 7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salomon rex, dei filius, qui omnis suo nutu regit, sapiens et pacificus, qui etiam suo sanguine pacificauit ea, que sunt in celo et in terra, fecit tronum grande de ebore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ebur candidum et frigidum et ipsa munda a peccato et frigida a mala concupiscentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia exaltata est super ordines angelorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Septem gradus septem opera misericordie sunt, que in ea fuerunt: Esuriui, sitiui, hospes eram, nudus eram, in carcere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [eram], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 infirmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [eram] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et uisitastis me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Due manus tenentes hinc tamen sedile due vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [sunt], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 scilicet actiua et comtemplatiua, que singulariter et specialiter in ea fuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Duo leones stantes iuxta brachiola sunt Gabriel archangelus et Iohannes evangelista, quorum alter anime virginis, alter corporis eius custos deputatos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, vielm. deputati) [sunt], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 qui bene leones dicuntur propter rugitum altissime uocis, unus ait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Aue maria, gratia plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (Lc 1,28), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 alter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In principio erat uerbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (Io 1,1) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 supplica ergo, virgo beata, filio tuo hoc ad ipsum perueniamus, ubi regina cum ipso per infinita secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\u8230 \'85 (verblasst) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 de purificacione Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quedam matrona nobilis in beata uirgine maximam habebat deuocionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 illa autem cereum pro maximis reliquiis conseruauit et omnes infirmi, qui tangebantur, protinus curati sunt. Rogemus ergo dominum Ihesum nos custodiat ab omni malo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Stark interpolierte und erweiterte Fassung des Libellus de corona virginis, cap. 25 (Verfasser vermutlich Ildephonsus Toletanus); Druck: PL 96, 317A-318C. \endash  (Nr. 2) Edition: Jacobi a Voragine Legenda aurea vulgo historia Lombardica dicta, rec. Theodor \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Graesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Dresden/Leipzig 1846, cap. 37 \u167 \'a7 2, S. 165f.; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Maggioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1, cap. 37, S. 249f.\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 152-177\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

