\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sermones \u8218 \'82Bartholomaeus\lquote  de tempore et de sanctis (T1-T64, S21-S80)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) De tempore. Nr. 130: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In aduentu dominica i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedictus qui venit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 21,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fratres karissimi, istud ewangelium, quod hodie lectum est et eciam in ramis palmarum legitur, quomodo dominus per duos discipulos nuntiauit aduentum suum in Ierusalem \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 vt nos reuocacione digni simus, prestet nobis pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Nr. 191 (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 23-27) mit Gebet, mhd.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Herre Ihesu Christe, setze unser tage in d\u253 \'fdnen vrid vnd erlose vns von der ewigen p\u253 \'fdn, daz wir werden gezalt in der schar diner erwelten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 193: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica xxiiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abeuntes pharisei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 22,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodie legitur in ewangelio, quomodo iudei dolose querebant a domino, si deberent censum dare Cesari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod hiis sociemur in exsequiis nostris. Dignetur prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sanctis. Nr. 194: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In purificacione Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Postquam impleti sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Lc 2,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Lucas scribit nobis hec uerba, quia in lege Moysi scriptum erat, quod omnis masculus die octavo circumcidetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quod cum Symeone verisimiliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 percipiamus. Dignetur prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 247: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miseremini mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 19,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia in predicto themate de statu animarum loqui intendimus, sciendum est, esse quattuor loca, in quibus anime resolute a corporibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 totum regnum celorum in perpetuam libertatem. Rogemus dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Explicit opus magistri Wilhelmi de \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Melitona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zu Verfasser und Werk sowie zu weiterer Lit. s. Clm 14724, 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Zum Predigtbestand s. Johannes Baptist \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Sermonesreihen des Johannes Ludovici von W\u252 \'fcrzburg OESA, in: Augustiniana 23 (1973), S. 218-241, hier S. 230-241 (Hs. genannt S. 241); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.Lu> Nr. 130-247 (nach dieser Hs.).}

