\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Miracula et exempla
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quidam uir sanctus orauit dominum, ut sibi ostenderet diuersam uitam hominum, vidit ergo in spiritu quendam haurientem aquam et in uas perforatum mittentem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Vitas patrum, lib. 7, cap. 37, ed. PL 73, 1054AC). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fuit quidam episcopus nomine Theophilus, qui fuit nimis auarus. Contigit autem, ut quadam die esset aput suum patriarcham, qui fuit sanctus homo, et omnia et ministrauit pauperibus propter deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fuit Parisius quidam legis peritus omni sciencia plenus, habens reditus ad duo milia marcarum, insuper thesaurum ad lxxx milia marcarum auri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vt mundi accedatis ad communionem audite. Fuit quidam episcopus habens hanc gratiam a deo, qui, quando communicabant homines, uidit in uultibus eorum, quibus peccatis essent implicati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fuit quidam homo nobilis et diues vnicam habens filiam, seruorum uero unus nimis dilexit ipsam, sed hic sciens se indignum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mulier quedam inuoluta grauissimo peccato venit oc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ulte ad sanctum Johannem episcopum dicens: Pater sancte, crimen ego peccatrix commisi, quod tam magnum est, quod nemo poterit enarrare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erant due uirgines nobiles ualde et formose, que uirginitatem suam deo uouerant, una nomine Felicula et altera Perpetua, comprehense sunt ergo a quodam iudice et multis afflicte tormentis, ut negarent Christum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sancti coronantur quadruplici corona, scilicet argentea, stellea, aurea, gemmea. De prima Zacheus ultimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [capitulo]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Surge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, vielm. Sume) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 argentum et fac coronam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Za 6,11) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 xxi\u176 \'b0 Rome in ecclesia sancti Magni in uigilia natiuitatis Christi xv viri et xv mulieres ante missam coream ducebant, tunc presbiter iratus monuit eos, ut desisterent et missam audirent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quidam miles strenuus dum diu milita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [vi]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sset, incepit cogitare intra se, cui nam militaret, et dum sic cogitaret, apparuit ei pulcherrima uidua coronata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quedam uirgo claustralis ualde deuota dum delicias paradisi in corde suo frequenter reuolueret et ex hoc iubilum cordis sentiret tandem rapta in sublimine uidit celestem coream \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur de quodam apostata, qui fugiens errauit in solitudine et dum sic usque in diem tertium ieiunus errasset, uenit ad quoddam castrum in alto monte situm \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum duo scolares diuites in dileccione et deliciis mutuo uiuerent, quadam die de sua prosperitate quam bona esset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Uppsala, UB, C 370, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 24\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quidam rex habuit quendam militem probum sed moribus et uita paruum et sepe monitus se noluit corrigere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Johannes Herolt, Sermones discipuli, exemplum 46, Druck: VD16 H 2569, Bl. h1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 28\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Narrat Beda in hystoria anglorum, quod quidam bonus homo resuscitatus a mortuis ductus est in uallem latissimam, ubi anime sicut pallee tempestatis ictu iactabant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 29\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Princeps quidam multam tyrannidem in suum populum exercebat et res pauperum iniuste auferebat dabatque latronibus, quos habebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 30\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miles quidam castrum habuit in communi uia et omnes transeuntes siue seculares siue religiosos sine misericordia spoliauit uirginem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Uppsala, UB, C 85, 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; C 303, 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Imperator quidam habuit uxorem pulchram ualde et castam, quam ipse ob hec nimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ille quodam die transiuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 marinas precepitque ei, ut imperium gubernaret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Seite stark verblasst)|| Vermutlich Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Aufgef\u252 \'fchrt werden lediglich Exempla gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferen Umfangs; Initien der Exempla Nr. 2, 3, 8, 10, 13, 15, 19, 21-23, 25-27 s. Initienregister.}

