\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Conradus de Saxonia: Sermones de tempore (T41-T44)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 181: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [H]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omo quidam erat diues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 16,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicitur Ecc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lesiasticus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatus diues qui inuentus est sine macula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 31,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Certe diues iste de triplici macula hic reprehenditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quos secum arsuros presumit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 182; (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 184; (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 185; (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 186; (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 187; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 188; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 189; (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 191. \endash  (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 190: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 adem mensura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 6,38). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [cut]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 bonam pro bona, pro mala malam mensuram recipietis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 triticum est verbum dei, quod mensuram non habet veritatis et scripture et secundum capacitatem et condignitatem auditorum et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch (Druck: Bl. CCLV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 1, S. 759f. (Hs. S. 764 genannt). \endash  Druck: Ps.-Bonaventura, Sermones de tempore et de sanctis. Paris 1521, Bl. CCXLV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -CCLV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

