\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sermones de diversis I
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [A]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 d mensam magnam sedisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Sir 31,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diligenter considera, que apposita sunt circa faciem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [uam] (Prv 23,1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia te talia oportet preparare. Prouerbiorum xxiii. Mensa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 magna dicitur corpus Christi tribus de causis. Primo propter magnam caritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 8, S. 681 Nr. 36). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nos autem gloriari oportet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II Cor 11,30; II Cor 12,1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam qui gloriari noluerit, uicium ingratitudinis incurrit. Glorificemur itaque quam crux operata, sunt tria in Christo, tria in homine iusto, tria in predicatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 apientia edificauit sibi domum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 9,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salomon ille sapientissimus, qui multa dixit ad erudicionem, enim pertulit inter cetera. Verbum, quod prediximus conueniens et quasi proprium tante festiuitatis, que est vna precipuarum sollempnitatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [A]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 stitit regina a dextris tuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 44,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In uerbis istis circa gloriose virginis assumpcionem quinque notantur. Primum est potestatis eius imperium in hoc, quod dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 regina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1, S. 501 Nr. 355; Bd. 6, S. 441 Nr. 43, S. 474 Nr. 3). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ignum magnum apparuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Apc 12,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mulier ista beata virgo est, quod nomen sit sexus non corrupcionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 amicta sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 iusticie, id est decorata tali ac tanta prole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 luna sub pedibus eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 id est omnia transitoria et mutabilia sub affectibus eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 6, S. 146 Nr. 77)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 leuata est nubes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Nm 10,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ita habetur in exemplo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et congruunt hec verba eius assumpcioni et comparatur nubi beata virgo multas causas. Nubes enim velox est, obscura, suspensa, volat, tonat, coruscat, pluit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [B]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eeseleel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fecit sibi archam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Ex 37,1-2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hac archa posita fuit vrna aurea habens manna et virga Aaaron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Hbr 9,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beseleel interpretatur vmbra dei et significat Christum. Spiritus oris nostri, Christus dominus, captus est in peccatis nostris, cui diximus: In vmbra tua vivemus in gentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lam 4,20) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beati qui habitant in domo tua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 83,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Est enim domus dei inferior, interior et superior. Beati, qui habitant in prima, scilicet in militanti ecclesia. Beatiores, qui habitant in secunda, scilicet secum in domo proprii cordis. Beatissimi, qui habitant in tercia, scilicet in celesti patria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cui tradidit animas sanctorum, ut perducat eas in paradysum, ad quem nos perducat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

