\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Petrus de Remis: Sermones de communi sanctorum (C2-C8)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb240\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nimis honorati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 138,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amici dei apostoli sunt propter tria. Primo propter voluntatem, conformitatem et concordium vnitatem, quia uera est amicicia idem velle siue nolle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 plurimum autem honorabit eos in iudicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch. Fortsetzung auf 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Predigt Nr. 1b) (Druck: De apostolis, sermo 3, S. 324b-325a Z. 46; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 4, S. 753, Nr. 464).}

