\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sermones de diversis II
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Textanfang defekt. ||\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Psalmus: In lumine w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ltus tui ambulabunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 88,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gloria mundana mundique potencia vana, cum tibi dicat: Aue, sicut ab hoste caue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 827, V. 2, dort mit weiteren Nachweisen) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Petrus de Remis, Sermo de uno confessore: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [D]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omine quinque talenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 25,20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota iste paterfamilias tripliciter bona diuisit. Vni dedit quinque talenta, alteri duo, alteri vnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de hac negociacione prouerbiorum: Malum est, dicit omnis emptor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 et cum recesserit, tunc gloriabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 20,14) (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 4, S. 755 Nr. 499; nicht im Druck). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Petrus de Remis, Sermo de uno confessore: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hennoch placuit deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 44,16). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [En]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 noch, qui interpretatur dedicatio, uidelicet est iste confessor, qui ex officio dignitatis ecclesiam dedicauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui sic esset Ennoch, placeret deo et transferetur in paradysum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: De uno confessore, sermo 3, S. 354b-355b; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 4, S. 755 Nr. 500). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [O]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Israhel, quam ampla est domus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Bar 3,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Locus huius possessionis est humilis confessio peccatoris. Vnde Salomon: Si spiritus haben\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ti]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s potestatem super se ascenderit, locum tuum ne demiseris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecl 10,4). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Spiritus potestatem haben\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ti]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 id est spiritus malignus, qui sepe potestatem habet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [C]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 onfessio valet ad peccati cognicionem, ad solucionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, wohl solutionis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 satisfaccionem, ad crucificacionem dimissionis peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i uis ad uitam ingredi, serua mandata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 19,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum est non habet deos Athen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 iens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 es propter illud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 mandata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In ibique nobis falsam dileccionem, quotiens homo conuertat ad creaturas eas, plene diligendo, committit ydolatriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [N]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ota, quod tres sunt cruces. Prima latronis desperantis, secunda orantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Memento mihi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tercia Christi. Primus crebre meruit et non profuit. Secundus meruit et tamen profuit ad subiectum. Tercius non meruit et tamen portauit scilicet pro nobis et nobis profuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [S]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ic veniet quemadmodum, uidistis eum euntem in celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Act 1,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum, quod dominus sex modis celos ascendit et in eisdem sex modis reuertetur ad iudicandum. Primus modus eius ascensionis est quam eleuatis manibus ascendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (u.a. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 781 Nr. 361; Bd. 6, S. 179 Nr. 79; Bd. 8, S. 670 Nr. 91; Bd. 9, S. 381 Nr. 32). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [P]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 araclitus spiritus sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 14,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paraclitus paraclitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 idem est quam consolator, quia consolatur nos in omni tribulacione nostra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II Cor 1,4), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia admodum olei est medicinalis, quia dolores mittigat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et tumores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 782 Nr. 365; Bd. 8, S. 670 Nr. 97). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Innocentius III. Papa, Sermones de sanctis, sermo 30 (S79): \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [D]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uo Cherubim clamabant alter ad alterum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Is 6,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Duo Cherubim, quorum alter clamat ad alterum, duo sunt testamenta, quorum alter consciens in alteri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que sub vna solempnitate omnium sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 merita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 veneratur, ad laudem et gloriam indiuidue trinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: PL 217, 587D-590C). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Obsecro uos tamquam aduenas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Pt 2,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Differencia est inter aduenam et peregrinum. Aduene sunt, qui ueniunt aliunde in terram alienam mansuri. Peregrini sunt, qui transeunt per terram alienam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 8, S. 646 Nr. 35). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mundus autem gaudebit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 16,20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gaudium mundi in quatuor consistit. In nitore uestium, in potu, in cibo, in suaui sompno, in corporis suauitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 8, S. 646 Nr. 36). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qvesiuit verba utilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecl 12,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In uerbis istis insinuatur, qualis fuerit ille N., qui fuit scripturarum diuinarum subtilissimus inquisitor. Hoc notatur cum dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qvesiuit verba utilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 fuit eciam earum prudentissimus predicator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Numquid nosti ordinem celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Iob 38,33). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In verbis istis ad honorem beati Michaelis archangeli ceterorumque angelorum duo poterunt considerari, scilicet angelorum celsitudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec verba profert anima ad corpus, cum uidit se esse dampnanda et crucianda sine fine morte perpetua. Tunc incipit maledicere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 plasuemare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, f\u252 \'fcr blasphemare) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 corpus suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [icit]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 O infelix corpus, pereat dies, in qua natus sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Iob 3,3-4) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus pauperem facit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Sm 2,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notatur, quod deus pater pauperem fecit dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum, filium suum, in natiuitate, dicauit eum in die palmarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ascendam in palmam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ct 7,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Palma est angusta inferius et superius lata, sic anima, que uult ascendere, debet esse stricta et gracilis inferius ad omnes uoluptates et carnales affectiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 super hunc ramum oritur flos lilii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 2-3) Zu Druck und Lit. s.o. 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 17) Edition und Lit.: Wolfgang\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Fleischer,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Untersuchungen zur Palmbaumallegorie im Mittelalter. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1976 (M\u252 \'fcnchner germanistische Beitr\u228 \'e4ge 20), S. 19 (diese Hs. mit Sigle M3, datiert 13. Jh., s. auch Herkunft), S. 44-70 (zur EP-\u220 \'dcberlieferung, diese Hs. genannt S. 47f., 51, 69), S. 232 Z. 25-233 Z. 30 (Druck).}

