\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titel: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber piarum precationum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, dar\u252 \'fcber datierter Besitzeintrag (s.o.). \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vitalis Rubrevallensis: Versus ad lectorem
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratris Vitalis Rubreuallensis ad lectorem huius collectanee carmen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui rerum plasten venerandaque numina celi / Exorare velis thura ferendo precum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vitalis (si nosse velis) Rottaler auctor /Ac benedictina relligione pius / Cenobium diui Petri quem fouit alumnum / Ecce Salisburgi dicito: uiue cui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [! sonst: vale] (12 Verse) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Telos \u8230 \'85 1519,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  es folgt kurzer Hinweis zum Kalendarium. \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.}

