\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vitalis Rubrevallensis: Carmen elegiacum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fratris Vitalis Rubreuallensis laudem istius collectanee et capitum ecclesie nomina recensentis carmen elegiacum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Adsis heroas summati thure supernos / qui clebrare precum frater amice velis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 V. 5: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hinc ego Vitalis monachus professus in ede / hic domini Petri Rottaler atque vocor / Pontificum Thome summus dum presul ouili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Te maneant superum premia: viue vale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Telos 1519\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. Weiterhin in den Versen genannt: Papst Leo X., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rex Hispanorum Charolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (der sp\u228 \'e4tere Kaiser Karl V.), Kardinal Matth\u228 \'e4us Lang, Leonhardus Keuzschacher, Abt Simon [von St. Peter in Salzburg]. \endash  28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.}

