\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gaius Iulius Solinus, De mirabilibus mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Eczerpt, cap. 1)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Z. 3) \u8250 \'9b\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de muliere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nam fausta quaedam ex plebe partu uno edidit geminos IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , mares II\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 os\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...-\u8230 \'85 (Z.12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 agelastus cognominabatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: Theodor \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mommsen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , C. Iulii Solini Collectanea rerum memorabilium. Berlin 1864 (Reprint 1958), Cap. I, 51-72, S. 16, Z. 19-S. 21 Z. 11. \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung: Mary Ella \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Milham\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A Handlist of the Manuscripts of C. Julius Solinus. In: Scriptorium 37 (1983), S. 126-129 (Hs. genannt S. 127).}

