\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De coniugationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Exzerpt)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De coniugationibus. Prime coniugationis uerba vel actiua vel neutra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  a secunda persona abiecta s et adiecta m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (Z. 17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De secunda coniugatione. Secunde coniugationis uerba i vel u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 30) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tercie coniugationis uerba inicio antecedit \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 composita simplicium preterita seruauit ut confugio. gi Super\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  // Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u220 \'dcber die Konjugation von Verben, anscheinend ohne nachweisbare Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung.}

