\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notae I
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anathole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic auctor ostendit, quomodo nomen Ade formatum sit. Legitur enim, quod creator omnium creaturarum post mundi creacionem volens hominem facere, eum formauit. Quo formacio vel facto volens ei imponere nomen, misit quattuor angelos, scilicet Gabrielem, Raphaelem, Michaelem et Vrielem, in mundi quattuor partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 alia est causa, quod vellet redimere cum sua morte omnes quattuor partes mundi. I\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ta constitutum est hoc nomen Adam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Auaricia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . a. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sollicitat, turbat, perdit, grauat, inquinat, inflat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fortuna interrogatur ab auaro et sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pone modum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ponam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pete, quod vis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Plena sit archa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Streitgedicht, S. 122 Anm. 1); c. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Angelus alloquitur Ioachim de prole futura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Obuiat Anna sibi capiens noua corde fideli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; d. Schema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ille vir est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quem non variat fortuna biformis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quem non superat sexus mulierbris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 animo proprio si quis dominatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 viciis quicumque viriliter obstat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 11473f.). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De dedicacione notabile bonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus est in loco isto septem modis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo tamquam pater misericors, ut peccata dimittat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 septimo quasi rex pugnaturus, ut astare sibi volentes aspiciat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

