\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Littera dominicalis et numerus aureus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sciendum est, quia, quod litteras quelibet diccio subscripta continet tot septimanas a die natiuitatis domini vsque in dominicam \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82Invocauit\lquote , cum diebus superfluis computamus. Notandum est, quod principalis littera cuiuslibet diccionis eodem modo pro littera sumitur dominicali, dies autem superflui eisdem litteris dominicalibus adiunguntur ita videlicet G vi, F v, E iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , D iii, C duo, B i signando, sed huic littere A nulla dies superflua coniungetur. Notandum est, quod littera B prescripta semper bisextum signat anno ab incarnacione domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . Folgt eine Liste f\u252 \'fcr die Jahre 1300-1400: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 M\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 bonitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 M\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 I artauerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 M\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 lxxxx 9\u176 \'b0 E 6, M\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 lxxxxx \u176 \'b0 C 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Explicit. Expliciunt littere dominicales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .}

