\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De carne et sanguine Christi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quidam mirantur, quomodo panis possit fieri caro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et vinum sanguis Christi. Isti videant, quomodo ex pane comesto et vino bibito procreatur in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 h\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omine caro et sanguis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 isti videant, quomodo a corde virginis exiuit incontaminatus et de sepulchro clauso surrexit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 13) Im Anschluss Wetterregeln: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si pluit in festo Processi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Martiniani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2.7.), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quadraginta dies continuare solet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si fuerint venti, generantur prelia genti.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Melk, StiftsB, Cod. 807, 204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

