\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notae II
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad similitudinem quattuor parcium mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quattuor fiant epistolarum decursus, qui presentantes statum omnium personarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vel consequi possit, quod affectat, cupit, gestit, desiderat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Bitte um Schuldenerlass (Musterbrief): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Do\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 mine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 reveren\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de iudex, peto, ut aures vestras meis precibus vel verbis humiliter inpendatis et causam hanc versantem et virga iudiciaria debito fine de bundagio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (bondagio?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  decidatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 14) Versus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mulierem tangere non est bonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. I Cor 7,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mulier debet cauere ne ornatu vel pulchritudine vel aliquo modo prouocet virum. Mulier casta est amanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mulier una aliam iuuat in maleficiis suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 CCCM 160, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ed. Elisa \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Brilli,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  S. 302 Nr. 536\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Clerici inter meretrices castitatem debent seruare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 CCCM 160, S. 88 Nr. 149\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Oratio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine Jhesu Christe, scribe in corde meo vulnera tua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 125).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Druck: Guidonis Fabe summa dictaminis, cap. 177, ed. Augusto \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gaudenzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Il propugnatore 23,1 = N.S. 3,1 (1890), S. 287-338, Bd. 23,2 = N.S. 3,2, S. 345-393, hier Bd. 2, S. 382-384 Z. 16. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 (Nr. 4) Druck u.a.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 De venerabili sacramento altaris, cap. 30, in: Sancti Thomae Aquinatis Doctoris angelici ordinis praedicatorum Opera omnia. Bd. 17. Parma: Petrus Fiaccadorus, 1864, S. 135-176, hier S. 173a Z. 21-26.}

