\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Formulae breves litterarum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine Ludovice, mei fideli obsequio premissa presentibus vobis notum facio et abrenuncio conuencionem et contractum, quem mutuo fecimus, quia michi inconueniens foret \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nouerint vniuersi, quos nosce fuerit oportunum, quod lator presentans michi rite est confessus et ut spirito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte spiritu) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in domino bene contritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerendo in Christo, patri domino, domino N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ico]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [a]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 decano kathedralis ecclesie Frisingensis, N. humilis sacerdos ac pastor uel vicarius in Tawfchirchi, quamquam poterit reuerencie et honorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u252 \'fcbergeschrieben \endash is f\u252 \'fcr honoris) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vestre discrecioni signiffico per presentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [quod]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eorum quidam interfectus est in plebe mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nouerit dignitatis vestre auctoritas, Ulricus, presencium exhybitorem de suo excessu fore confessum, videlicet per aliquod tempus a suo habitu deposcocasse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!, f\u252 \'fcr depoposcisse?) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex parte Hainrici confessus presencium consorcium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Premissa reuerencia debita noueritis, domine dilectissime, mihi incumbit necessitas ob hanc causam mencionem facio de isto testamento mihi facto ab illo homine bono vobis noto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex parte hospitali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Wohl Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. Medieval and Renaissance Letter Treatises and Form Letters. Bd. 3: A Census of Manuscripts Found in Part of Europe. The Works on Letter Writing from the Eleventh through the Seventeenth Century Found in Albania, Austria, Bulgaria, France, Germany, and Italy, ed. Emil J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Polak\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leiden u.a. 2015, S. 478 (Hs. genannt, ohne n\u228 \'e4here Angaben).}

