\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Casus episcopales
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isti sunt casus episcopales. Primum. Qui facit incestum cum sua consangwinea uel sua sorore vel matertera vel commatre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; es folgen Nr. 2-16; (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 heredes ignorantur vnde versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui facit incestum, deflorans etc, quere eos ante in libro etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota. Hiis inhibetur corpus Christi sub pena excommunicacionis et sunt xxv et magis genera hominum, videlicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Wohl Textabbruch. \endash  Rest der Spalte leer.}

