\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I (Bl. 1-68)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mechthild de Hackeborn: Liber specialis gratiae (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  Pars 1, cap. 17: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quisquis deum w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 lt diligere ad eius se teneat passionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sicut recordacio amarissime passionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ed.: Solesmes, S. 51). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 6) Pars 1, cap. 16: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et ideo quociens homo in recordacione passionis mee ex amore ingemiscit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde salubriter w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 lneratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ed.: Solesmes, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 S. 49). \endash  (Z. 10) Pars 1, cap. 15: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Debet autem homo rememorari acerbissimam passionem quintupliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo cogitando suam incomprehensibilem omnipotenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qua morte amarissima est pro homine amaricatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ed.: Solesmes, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 S. 47f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Bromberg\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 388 Z. 6-14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (Z. 19) Pars 1, cap. 5: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et ideo laudo te, o amor fortissime; benedico te, o amor sapientissime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et operabitur in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ed.: Solesmes, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 S. 19f.; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Bromberg\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 252 Z. 5-10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition:\plain \f3\lang1033\fs20\cf18  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. Mechthildis virginis OSB Liber specialis gratiae. Opus \u8230 \'85 editum Solesmensium O.S.B. monachorum cura et opera. Paris 1877, S. 1-421 (Revelationes Gertrudianae ac Mechtildianae 2). \endash  Vgl. auch die Edition nach Utrecht, UB, Hs. 247, in: Het boek der bijzondere genade. Uitgeven naar een Nijmeegs Handschrift door Richard Louis Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bromberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 1: Inleiding en tekst; Bd. 2: Partituur en bijlagen. Zwolle 1965 (Zwolse drukken en herdrukken 51,1-2), hier Bd. 1, S. 190-462. \endash  Lit.: Margot \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schmidt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 6 (1987), Sp. 251-260, hier 252-256.}

