\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ablassgebete
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Innocencius papa circumiuit quoddam cimiterium sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte sanctis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 meditacionibus intentus nichil pro animabus orans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Audiuit voces animarum dicencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt vobis associemur et vobiscum in celis coronemur, tunc innumerabiles anime responderunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem Innocencius dedit cuilibet dicenti deuote hanc oracionem in loco sepulture christianorum trecentos dies indulgenciarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Suscipe, clementissime domine deus meus, meritis et precibus beatissime uirginis Marie et omnium sanctorum officium seruitutis mee et, si quid in hiis laudibus dignum egi, propicius respice, et quod negligenter actum est, clementer ignosce per Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

