\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II (Bl. 69-116)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis: Epistula de cura rei familiaris
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Epistola beati Bernardi ad nobilem Raymundum militem de domestica cura siue regimine rei familiaris vtilius gubernande et bene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Gracioso et felici militi Raymundo, domino castri Ambrosii, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus in senium deductus salutem.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Doceri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 petisti a nobis de cura et rei familiaris modo utilius gubernande\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad quem eam perducat dampnabilis senectus. Vale.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 182, 647-651. \endash  Edition: Clive D. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cossar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The German Translations of the Pseudo-Bernhardine Epistola de cura rei familiaris. G\u246 \'f6ppingen 1975 (G\u246 \'f6ppinger Arbeiten zur Germanistik 166), S. 97-102. \endash  Lit.: Werner \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\u246 \'f6ver\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 1 (1978), Sp. 754-762, hier Sp. 758.}

