\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Bernardus ad quendam fratrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Uenerabili patri W\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ilhelmo], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 frater B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ernardus], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et fratrum, qui \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in Claraualle sunt, inutilis seruus, salutem in domino. Usque modo si qua me scriptitare precepisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si quis accepit iam esse bonus, non inuideat melioribus et qui sibi uidetur agere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 melius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 182, 893-916C. \endash  Edition: Sancti Bernardi opera ad fidem codicum recensuit Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bd. 3: Tractatus et opuscula. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Rom \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 1963, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 81-107 Z. 11.}

