\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Bernhardus Claraevallensis: Formula honestae vitae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Epistola beati Bernhardi abbatis ad quendam monachum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Petis a me, frater carissime, quod numquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [et nusquam]\plain \f4\i\lang1033\fs18\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a suo prouisore audiui aliquem petisse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f4\i\lang1033\fs18\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia profectus tuus gaudium est medium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte meum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et corona mea in domino. Vale mi frater. Explicit epistola Bernardi ad quendam monachum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Verfasser ist m\u246 \'f6glicherweise Bernhardus Silvestris. \endash  Druck: PL 184, 1167C-1170C. \endash  Lit.: Zur Verfasserfrage s. Barth\u233 \'e9lemy\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Haur\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 au,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Notices et extraits de quelques manuscrits latins de la Biblioth\u232 \'e8que Nationale 2. Paris 1891, S. 344-346; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 73; Ferdinand \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cavallera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: DSAM 1 (1937), Sp. 1499-1501, ebd. 1500. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (mit Supplement)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  3897; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 CPPM 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 B, 3091; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hammesse/Szyller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 23713\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .}

