\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Collecta aliqua ex quodam sermone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Iterum Maria \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ammiratiue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 dixit ad angelum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo fiet istud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 1,34). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In quibus verbis gloriose et aliis, que subiungit, vide supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nobis Luce primo proponitur virgo Maria in quadruplici virtute imitanda primo in hoc, quia in credendo non fuit preceps et subita, sed grauis et circumspecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ob hoc eciam tempus illud potatum diei plenitudo temporis, in quo misit deus filium suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
