\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Godefridus Viterbiensis: Carmen in laude Babenbergae (ex Pantheone, pars 17)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Item de Heinrico claudo et de gloriosa ciuitate eius Bamberga extant versus Gotfridi Viterbiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Bawaricus fluuius w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 lgo Radancia dictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Me vocat historia, Pauo beate, vale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pistorius/Struve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 330f.; MGH 22, S. 240 Z. 14-19, 21-37, S. 241 Z. 1-24). \endash  (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De Heinrico claudo laudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Heinrici claudi meritum sollempniter audi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Corpora debilium plurima sana dari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pistorius/Struve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 331; MGH 22, S. 241 Z. 25-34).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Compendium originis, obitus et virtutis de singulis apostolis (ex Pantheone, pars 14): \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Petrus apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Roma prius mundum totum vicisse mundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte videtur) \u8230 \'85; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Paulus doctor gencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Johannes ewangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b; (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Jacobus Zebedeus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Andreas apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Philippus apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mathias apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mathias fuerat vnus de septuaginta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Jude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 scariothis fit locus vnus ei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pistorius/Struve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 240f.). \endash  136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
