\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta varia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In Auswahl: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verbum caro factum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Io 1,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Que lingua rethoris siue predicatoris valet enarrare quam plena sint hec verba supernis misteriis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 verbum, quod erat in principio apud deum, fiat caro de carne mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augustinus de agone christiano: Stulti sunt, qui dicunt, quare non poterat deus aliter sapientia homines liberare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 que caritate filii dei non sanatur?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (CSEL 41, ed. Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Zycha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 114 Z. 9-S. 115 Z. 13). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augustinus in doctrina christiana. Doctor scripturarum et doctor fidei et debellator erroris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quid exspectare debeant intimare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (CCL 32, ed. Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Martin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 119 Z. 1-5). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Idem: Doctrina per malos, palmes in sepe, botrus inter spinas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ne imiteris mala facientem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (In Iohannis euangelium tractatus, tract. 46, \u167 \'a7 6, CCL 36, ed. Radbodus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Willems\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 401 Z. 26-29). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gregorius super illud prouerbium Salomonis. Doctrina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uiri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Prv 19,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eo minus quisque ostenditur doctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et mundicia non ualet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictus. Mitis et inuicte verna Christi benedicte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Initia carminum 11128). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Decretum concilii Basiliensis, qualiter hore canonice sint dicende extra chorum, quod incipit: Quoscumque etiam alibi beneficiatos seu in sacris constitutos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ne sis quasi, qui temptat deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Publici concubinarii intelligendi sunt non solum hii quorum concubinatus per sentenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum effectu non dimittit. Ex decreto concilii Basiliensis, quod incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Quicumque clericus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \lquote .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Herzogenburg, StiftsB, Cod. 15, 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Schluss abweichend). \endash  (Nr. 5) M\u246 \'f6glicherweise zitiert nach Thomas Hibernicus, Manipulus florum, Lemma Doctrina sive doctor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  n; vgl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 The Electronic \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Manipulus florum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Project, http://web.wlu.ca/history/cnighman/index.html); dort auch Nachweis der Originalzitate. \endash  (Nr. 7) Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mansi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  29, Sp. 106f. Nr. V. \endash  (Nr. 8) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mansi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  29, Sp. 101f. Nr. I, hier Sp. 102BC.}

