\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus in formali de honesta vit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non affectes fieri predicator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non prius habendo didicerit. Hec Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: David ab Augusta, De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione secundum triplicem statum incipientium, proficientium et perfectorum libri tres, castigati et denuo editi a patribus collegii s. Bonaventurae. Quaracchi 1899, S. 17f.}

