CL 120, S. 323-325 Z. 1118-1171). VD16 B 8211 (II), 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 12. Mc 7,31-37; (275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Lectio 1-4: PD II, 69. VD16 B 8211 (II), 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 13. Lc 10,23-37; (276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Lectio 1-4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Adheret hiis lectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 acerba curasset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ambr. M., Expos. Lc VII,69-73, CCL 14, S. 237-239 Z. 701-752). VD16 B 8211 (II), 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 14. Lc 17,11-19; Lectio 1-4: PD II, 74. VD16 B 8211 (II), 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 15. Mt 6, 24-33; Lectio 1-4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ad hanc ipsam intencionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et pater uester celestis pascit illa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Aug., Serm. in monte II, \u167 \'a7 14,47-15,51, CCL 35, S. 138-141 Z. 1031-1095). VD16 B 8211 (II), 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 16. Lc 7,11-16; Lectio 1-4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hic locus ad utramque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 uitande mortis indulserit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ambr. M., Expos. Lc V,89-92, CCL 14, S. 163-165 Z. 923-970). VD16 B 8211 (II), 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 17. Lc 14,1-11; Lectio 1-4: PD II, 80. VD16 B 8211 (II), 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 18. Mt 22,34-46; Lectio 1-4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dolebant Pharisei Seduceos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ideoque inuidia ducti\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 PL 118, Sp. 703B), (Z. 21) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 conuenerunt in unum, ut multitudine uincerent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 spiritum donauit hominibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Opus imperfectum in Matthaeum, hom. 42, PG 56, Sp. 872 Z. 35-Sp. 873 Z. 22). VD16 B 8211 (II), 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 19. Mt 9,1-8; Lectio 1-4: PD II, 89. VD16 B 8211 (II), 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 20. Mt 22,1-14; Lectio 1-4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Regnum celorum, fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et alios audiuimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Greg. M., Hom. in evang. II,38, CCL 141, S. 361-363 Z. 29-94). VD16 B 8211 (II), 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 21. Io 4,46-53; (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Lectio 1-4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Lectio sancti euangelii, quam modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 abhominabile est apud deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Greg. M., Hom. in evang. II,28, CCL 141, S. 239-242 Z. 1-54). VD16 B 8211 (II), 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 22. Mt 18,23-35; (285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Lectio 1-3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ideo assimilatum est regnum regi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 de cordibus uestris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Hieron., Comm. in Mt III, CCL 77, S. 163-165 Z. 672-709); (286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Lectio 4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sciendum est, quia ille recte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 munus pro culpa sumit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Gregorius Magnus, Dialogorum libri IV,62\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sources Chretiennes 265, ed. Adalbert de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vog\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u252 \'fc\u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  / Paul \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Antin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 204 Z. 1-10). VD16 B 8211 (II), 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  Dominica 23. Mt 22,15-21; (286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Lectio 1-4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Tunc abeuntes Pharisei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et que sunt dei deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Hieron., Comm. in Mt III, CCL 77, S. 202-204 Z. 1740-1783). VD16 B 8211 (II), 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 24. Mt 9,18-22; Lectio 1-4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Et ecce uir cui nomen erat Jairus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 omnia corruisset in mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Beda, In Lc expos. III,8, CCL 120, S. 188f. Z. 865-900). VD16 B 8211 (II), 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Dominica 25. Io 6,5-14; (288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Lectio 1-4: PD I, 1. VD16 B 8211 (II), 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  Rest von 289\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  sowie 289\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lektionen f\u252 \'fcr die 3. Nokturn an den Sonntagen 1-25 nach Trinitatis mit Lectio secundum evangelium (Perikope) und Oratio sowie Lectio 1-4 (= Lectio 9-12); ohne liturgische Gesangspartien. \endash  Vgl. auch die Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14757, 406\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; 14771, 352\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; 14774, 365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; 14828, 235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

