\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hermannus Augiensis: Prognostica de defectu solis et lunae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prognostica eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Hermanni] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de eclipsi solis et lune necnon de equali lune per Zodiacum discursione et ad solis coitum recursione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 L\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 una ut notum est unoquoque mense suo, id est a coitu suo cum sole usque ad proximum coitum, totum Zodiaci ambitum circuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Me tamen laboris mei per quem aliquid naturali cursui vel propinquum inueni, non penitet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Werk entstanden 1049. Transskription: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Germann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s.o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 341-350. Online verf\u252 \'fcgbare Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Karlsruhe Cod. 504 (https://digital.blb-karlsruhe.de/blbhs/content/pageview/1161722).}

