\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Kommentar zu Einzelkapiteln der Abbreviatio compoti Hermanni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si enim quisque lunaris mensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [cap. 29]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Habeat igitur lunaris mensis XXVIIII dies XII horas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ergo si computandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [cap. 32]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Pone ergo totius decennouenalis cycli dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ergo singulis\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [cap. 32], (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in decennovenali dierum cyclo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [cap. 33]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Haut ignotum est cuique solaris anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quas si per CCXXX V menses diviseris etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b [cap. 34], (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quam huiusmodi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b [cap. 35] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sicut in precedentibus cuilibet scire cupienti exposuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 XXVIII particulas ad impletionem embolismalium mensium procrescere uidebis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kommentar zu cap. 29, 32-35.}

