\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Berno Augiensis: De observatione ieiunii quattuor temporum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 Epistola dedicatoria: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item prologus eiusdem abbatis ad supradictum archiepiscopum de obseruatione ieiunii \u8729 \'b7IIII\u8729 \'b7 temporum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amantissimo domini Ariboni odorifero pontificum flori Bern\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Doctrina et ueritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 roboratum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Dialog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit dialogus inter Bern abbatem augiensis cenobii et monachum Gerungum habitus qualiter \u8729 \'b7IIII\u8729 \'b7 temporum ieiunia per sua sabbata sint obseruanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Licet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (interlinear: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pater uenerande\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in his sacris ieiuniorum diebus expoliata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .B. S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 atis egregie fili hoc diffinisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b.G. h\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 oc scilicet ut cum una fides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magisterio quo utaris modo in abstinendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Direkt anschlie\u223 \'dfend Nachtrag (wohl noch von der selben Hand in etwas hellerer Tinte\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ): \plain \f1\i\caps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verba sancti Avgustini\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Quisquis rebus pretereuntibus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 improbandum est quod facimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed. des Widmungsschreibens: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schmale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Briefe (wie oben 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 49f. Nr. 16 (diese Hs. Sigle E\plain \f1\sub\lang1033\fs20 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Druck des Textes: PL 142, 1087-1098. \endash  Zum Werk: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Oesch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Berno und Hermann (wie oben 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 53f. Nr. 3; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Blume\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bern von Reichenau (wie oben 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) S. 87 Nr. 3; vgl. auch Catalogus IV, n. s. 2,4, zu Clm 14477,74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Nachtrag aus Augustinus Hipponensis, De doctrina christiana, Lib. 3 cap. 12, Druck: PL 34, 73.}

