\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 III (Bl. 24-38)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Commentarius in Macrobii commentarium in Somnium Scipionis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Am oberen Rand (Hand des 14. Jh.s): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Astronomia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . [P]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 lato inter philosophos peritissimus librum de r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [e] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ublica] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 constitucione composuit. In fine cuius operis homines ad iusticiam inuitauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 non minatur? penam transgressori. In opus premia decuit penam MAIORVM\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (Schluss in II,17,13).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kommentar zu einzelnen Lemmata des Macrobius-Kommentars. Zusammenfassend zur Verfasserfrage (Guillaume de Conches? (Martin Grabmann); anonym? (Edouard Jeauneau); Hugo? (der Name wird erw\u228 \'e4hnt 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 2 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 dicens Hugo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8230 \'85 und 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 9 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 me Hugonem non sequestrat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8230 \'85): Irene \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Caiazzo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Lectures m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vales de Macrobe. Les \u8218 \'82Glosae Colonienses super Macrobium\lquote ; \u233 \'e9tude et \u233 \'e9dition. Paris 2002 (\u200 \'c8tudes de Philosophie M\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale, 83), S. 84f.}

