\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugo de Sancto Caro: Speculum ecclesiae cum speculo sacerdotum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicit apostolus ad Ephesios: Induite uos armatura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Eph 6,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec armatura est uestis sacerdotalis configuratiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, recte significativa) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 septemplicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (korr. aus septemplicibus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uirtutis represen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ta]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tiua uestium Christi, quibus indutus fuit tempore passionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 hec casula representat purpureum vestimentum, quo milites circumdederunt Ihesum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Io 19,2). \endash  Kolophon: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deo gloria et honor completus sub anno domini 1380 in proximo tertia feria post festum nativitatis Marie ab Henrico \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 l\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ocato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit libellus septem sacramentorum questionibus cum declaratis de preparatoriis vestium introductis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Darunter in kleinerem Schriftgrad Di\u228 \'e4tetikum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vtatur cibis bonis et faciliter digestibilibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: verglichen mit BSB-Ink H-428 = GW n0264, Bl. b ii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Hugonis a St. Charo tractatus super missam seu speculum ecclesiae, ed. Gisbert \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 S\u246 \'f6lch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . M\u252 \'fcnster 1940 (Opuscula et textus historiam ecclesiae eiusque vitam atque doctrinam illustrantia 9), S. 8-10 Z. 10. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 1, S. 48 Nr. 2aw;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Scriptores 2, 1990 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (mit Supplement) 1589 (ohne diese Hs.).}

