\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Guilelmus de Montibus: Commentum in \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Peniteas cito peccator\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \lquote 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Glosse: \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Peniteas cito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 id est non tardes conuerti ad dominum deum tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Sir 5,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Illud aduerbium potest demonstrari articulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cito es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sic cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Peccator peniteas cito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 id est svbito et repente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pro ex quo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iudex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 id est deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sit miserator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 id est misericors directis, id est iustis scilicet penitentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (Z. 20) Text V. 1-2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Peniteas scito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 peccator cum sit miserator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iudex dulcis et sunt tibi quinque tenenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (Z. 22) Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Spes venie, scriptum sit tibi uerbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sperate in eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, recte eo) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 omnis congregatio populi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\lquote  (Ps 61,9); (Z. 24) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cor contritum, scriptum sit tibi uerbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cor contritum et humiliatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote  (Ps 50,19); (Z. 26) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Confessio culpe, scriptum sit tibi werbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui abscondit peccata, non exaudietur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\lquote  (Prv 28,13) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Text V. 46: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dic Venalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (Z. 7) Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dic que sunt a mente relapsa, ergo seiungit istum versum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 id est confitearis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tua delicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 id est ista quatuor genera, de quibus dictum est et super\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 reuela ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 generaliter et bene patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ||. Wohl Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Gedicht in gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferem, Kommentar in kleinerem Schriftgrad. \endash  Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Goering\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , William de Montibus (wie oben 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 116-124 (mit Interpolationen), vgl. auch S. 478 Nr. 10. \endash  Lit.: Hugh \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 MacKinnon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , William de Montibus, a Medieval Teacher, in: Essays in Medieval History Presented to Bertie Wilkensen, ed. by Thomas A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sandquist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Maurice R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Powicke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Toronto 1969, S. 32-45, hier S. 40-44\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (mit Supplement) 3193, 3812.}

