\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aenigmata (Nachtrag)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic notantur aliqua enigmata: Primum est, ut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (expungiert) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut dicatur vni, quot annorum sunt uel quod vnus dicat vni, quot denarios habet in pera sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 si vnitas esse habuit in police, si duo habuit in indice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .}

