\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tonitruale
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Januarius. Si thonutrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sonuerit, ventus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte ventos) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 validos et habundancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [m]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 frugum et bellum in eo designat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In Nouembre. Si tho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [nitrus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 so\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [nuerit], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 annone habundanciam pacemque \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 populi et concordiam designat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: Curt F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Buhler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sixteenth-Century Prognostications: Libri Impressi cum Notis Manuscriptis (Part II), in: Isis 33 (1941/1942), S. 609-620, hier S. 613 (mit \u228 \'e4hnlichem Wortlaut); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Juste, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Manuscrits astrologiques, S. 138 (nach dieser Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

