\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Albertus Magnus: Paradisus animae (cap. 1-24)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nunc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, recte Sunt) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quedam vicia, que frequenter speciem virtutum assumunt, ut cum vere sint vicia, credantur esse virtutues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Cap. 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Caritas vera ad deum et perfecta est, quando anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [cum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 omnibus viribus suis ardenter se deo infundit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 talis tristicia nullam confert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  [gratiam], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 delaniat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (!, recte dilaniat) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 iuxta illud: Sicud tynea vestimento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Prv 25,20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 et alibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 In merore animi deicitur spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (Prv 15,13). \endash  Cap. 25: [G]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ratitudo vera et perfecta est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 || Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Alberti Magni \u8230 \'85 opera omnia. Bd. 37: Mariale. Biblia Mariana. Paradisus animae. Liber de adhaerendo deo. Libellus de alchimia. Scriptum super arborem Aristotelis, ed. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Auguste \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Borgnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Paris 1898, S. 447-484b. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 1, S. 72 Nr. 6cq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Werner\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Fechter,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zur handschriftlichen \u220 \'dcberlieferung des ps.-albertischen \u8218 \'82Paradisus animae\lquote  und seiner \u220 \'dcbersetzungen ins Mittelhochdeutsche, in: ZfdA 105 (1976), S. 66-87 (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (mit Supplement) 5875 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

