\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nicolaus Andreae: De officio lamentationum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Veni sancte spiritus, reple tuorum corda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [fidelium]. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Pro presentis declaracione tractatus et nostre salutis pie informacione est aduertendum, quod, quia rei cognitio dependet ex causarum complemento, ergo huius libri siue tractatus quattuor sunt cause, scilicet materialis, formalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  drittletzte Zeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Causa aut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [em] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 efficiens dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [fuisse] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 magister Nicolaus de Audieo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (!, recte Andree) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 civitate Teatina doctor decretorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 quinto et ultimo, quid fuerit fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 in passione domini Christi testamentacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (!, recte testamentum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 uel restauracio. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt lamentaciones reportate a manu Henrici de Salbinger in ciuitate Geskensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Geseke, Lkr. Soest?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  anno domini m\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 lxx\u176 \'b0 8\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Pennae probationis und notae, darunter Besitzeintrag auf 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber est Rudolphi Koburger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nicolaus Andreae stammte aus Chieti und ist als Doktor des kanonischen Rechts im 1. Viertel des 14. Jh.s nachgewiesen (s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schulte, GQ\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  2, S. 398\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; GW 2, Sp. 217; Bio-Bibliographical Guide to Medieval and Early Modern Jurists, Report No. r439). \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Berlin, SBB-PK, Ms. lat. 4\u176 \'b0 376, 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Darmstadt, Hessische UuLB, Hs 1021, 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Halle, UuLB, Qu. Cod. 96, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Kassel, UB/LMB, 4\u176 \'b0 Ms. theol. 19, 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Prag, B Nationalmuseum, XX. B. 5, 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (vormals Admont, StiftsB, Cod. 550); Stuttgart, W\u252 \'fcrttembergische LB, HB III 37, 194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Wolfenb\u252 \'fcttel, HAB, Cod. Guelf. 269 Helmst., 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

