\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nota sicut novem sunt ordines angelorum, cum quibus angeli glorificantur in patria, sic scilicet sunt camere infernales, ut dampnati ducentur, miseri recipiuntur, torquentur, deuorantur. Primus locus est enim tenebre palpabiles \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 nonus locus est abyssum profundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hii tales deuorantur, scilicet predones, vsurarii, exactores pauperum et huiusmodi, qui deuorant ple\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [bem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [eam] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [icut] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [cam] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 pa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [nis] (Ps 13,4). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nota sicut multi sunt gradus peccatorum in hoc seculo, ita multi sunt gradus penarum in inferno. Ys\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [aia]:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  In mensura contra mensuram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Is 27,8) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sunt qui super predictum de diuina misericordia desperant et hii grauissime. Auertat hoc a nobis deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nota quod tria sunt genera diuitum, quorum primi dampnantur, secundi saluantur, tercii multam gloriam proniterentur. Similiter de pauperibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sed omnes homines intelligentur in iudicio congregandi secundum gloriam quam felices, ergo sunt tales pauperes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Rep. 7, S. 253 Nr. 100).}

