\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exempla varia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exemplum de Judeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quidam ciuis magnas fecit expensas ob magnum nomen et vanam gloriam et tandem defecit in expensis et cum ulterius christianam pecuniam sibi mutuare nolent, iuit ad quendam judeum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Nr. 2797). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De ascensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ascendit Christus tripliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 potenter, latenter, festinanter. De primo Ys\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [aia]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quis est ille, qui graditur in multitudine fortitudinis sue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. Is 63,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sic nos ascenderemus potenter mundum calcando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quidam fuit valde secularis et peccator et habuit duos socios similes sibi. Hic uidit in sompnis, quod t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [h]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 roni positi sunt et iudicium dampnacionis in eos tres factum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De quadam abbatissa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Fuit quedam strennua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  abbatissa, cui sorores et moniales multum inuidebant, que concepit per querelam et ille scientes significabant episcopo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Nr. 4; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mairhofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 94 Nr. 46). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De clerico seculare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quidam clericus multum secularis et lubricus et ab inimicis suis interfectus extra cimiterium sepultus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dexter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Nr. 4). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De quodam fure suspenso. Quidam fur Eppo nomine furtis se et suos calebat, sed tamen fuit cultor et seruicialis beate uirginis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (Jacobus a Voragine, Legenda aurea, ed. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 2\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Maggioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 , cap. 127.122-127, S. 910; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Cra\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Nr. 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De quodam clerico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quidam clericus fuit canonicus apud Pysam ciuitatem, qui venerabatur beatam virginem et parentibus suis defunctis compulsus est ab amicis suis ducere vxorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (wie Nr. 6, ed. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 2\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Maggioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , cap. 127.128-134; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Crane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Nr. 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 8\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exemplum de elemosina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quidam episcopus in predicatione sua interseruit sepius hec verba: Qui reliquerit domum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 19,29) \u8230 \'85 (Odo de Ceritona, Parabola 136, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hervieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 317; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mairhofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 215 Nr. 472). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quidam rex quendam pauperem et humilem in tanta dignitate exaltauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Odo de Ceritona, Parabola 137, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hervieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 317f.). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exemplum de corpore et anima. Rex quidam habuit pulchram filiam et dilectam valde, habuit etiam tamen vnum ferocem nimis, qui fuit ligatus tribus cathenis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Gesta Romanorum, cap. 27, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Oesterley\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 324f.). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 11\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De diabolo. Beatus Macharius quodam sero per uiam aspiciebat et uidit demonem in figura hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Verba seniorum Nr. 61, PL 73, 769C-770C). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 12\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quidam ab hostibus suis captus et in uinculis reclusus. Cumque diu fuisset in uinculis et non redisset, vxor sua credidit ipsum defunctum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 13\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exemplum de asperitate cibi. Quidam monachus propter asperitatem ciborum ordinis Cysterciensis exiit claustrum, cui quidam occurrens quesiuit causam vnde exiuisset \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exemplum de episcopo. Quidam episcopus habuit secum vnum medicum ad consolacionem sui corporis et unum legistam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mairhofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 210 Nr. 448). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 15\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De milite. Exemplum. Quidam miles, dum grauiter infirmaretur, rogabat quendam religiosum, ut pro ipso oraret ad dominum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (Odo de Ceritona, Parabola 171, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hervieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 332; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mairhofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 217 Nr. 480). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 16\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Verba cuiusdam doctoris sapientis audiui talia michi precipienti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [s]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exite \endash  inquit \endash  qui saluari desideratis, separate vos a vanitate mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Cruz Palma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 79 Z. 16-S. 80 Z. 7). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 17\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De contemptu mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Egredimini in montem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (II Esr 8,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exhortatio ad mundi contemptum, karissimi, verba ista sunt prophete Esdre, qui hortatur nos eorum significatione ad contemptum mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Decem pene infernales. Impii sustinebunt decem penas infernales, quia transgressi sunt decalogum legis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 19\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Apprehendent septem mulieres \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Is 4,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Septem mulieres significant septem dona spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Peregrinus de Oppeln, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Rep. 4, S. 553 Nr. 70). \endash  Nachtrag von anderer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Prosperitas rerum temporalium est eterne damnationis evidentissimum signum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Vorliegende Exempelsammlung aufgef\u252 \'fchrt in: Jean-Thi\u233 \'e9bault\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Welter\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  L'exemplum dans la litt\u233 \'e9rature religieuse et didactique du Moyen \u194 \'c2ge. Paris/Toulouse 1927 (Biblioth\u232 \'e8que d'histoire eccl\u233 \'e9siastique de France 8), S. 484 (ohne n\u228 \'e4here Identifikation). \endash  Nachweis einzelner Exempla in: Gesta Romanorum, ed. Hermann \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Oesterley\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 . Berlin 1872 (Nr. 10); L\u233 \'e9opold\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  Hervieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 , Les fabulistes latins depuis le si\u232 \'e8cle d'Auguste jusqu'\u224 \'e0 la fin du moyen \u226 \'e2ge. Bd. 4: Eudes de Cheriton et ses d\u233 \'e9riv\u233 \'e9s. Odo de Ceritona. Paris 1896 (Nr. 8f., 15); Liber de miraculis Sanctae Dei genitricis Mariae, ed. Bernardus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Pez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 . With an Introduction and Notes and a Bibliography of the Wrtitings of Thomas Frederick \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Crane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 . Ithaca 1925 (Studies in Romance Languages and Literature 1) = ND der Ausgabe Wien 1731 (Nr. 6f.); Elise F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Dexter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 , Miracula Sanctae Virginis Mariae. Madison 1927 (Studies in the Social Sciences and History 12) (Nr. 5); Frederic C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Tubach,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  Index exemplorum. A Handbook of Medieval Religious Tales. Helsinki 1969 (FF Communications 204) (Nr. 1, 4); Barlaam et Iosaphat. Versi\u243 \'f3n vulgata latina, ed. \u211 \'d3scar de la \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Cruz Palma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 . Con la traducci\u243 \'f3n castellana de Juan de Arce Solorceno. Madrid u.a. 2001 (Nueva Roma 12) (Nr. 16); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Mairhofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  (wie oben 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  Z. 24) (Nr. 4, 8, 14f.).}

