\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beichtformular
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ad habendum salutiferum confessionis ordinem hec breuiter conscripsi. Primo fiat confessio de puerilibus, utpote de inobediencia et offensa parentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 scelera mea atque delicta ostende mihi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Iob 13,23). \endash  (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 7-11) Merkverse: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quis, quid, vbi, per quos, quociens, cur, quomodo, quando \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Initia carminum 16103; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Proverbia 25432); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Integra, deuota, simplex, discreta, fidelis, pura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quis, quid, vbi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (s. Nr. 1); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ordo, etas, numerus, mora, delectacio, sexus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Augustinus: O tam repersisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [s] (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 mihi amaritudine, ut in te solo quererem delectacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Paulus: Non sunt condigne \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (Rm 8,18).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Edition: Pierre \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 , Deux formulaires pour la confession du milieu du XIIIe si\u232 \'e8cle, in: Recherches de Th\u233 \'e9ologie ancienne et m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale 31 (1964), S. 43-62, hier S. 46f. (Inhalt), S. 57-60 (handschriftl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung, ohne diese Hs.) S. 60-62 (Edition). \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Dondaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Shooner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  1, S. 335 Nr. 915, 4; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 (mit Supplement) 221 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 .}

