\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quidam negociator magnarum opum ad extrema deductus pro salute anime cogitare cepit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 uitam finiens migrauit ad Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mairhofer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , wie oben 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 24, S. 187 Nr. 363).}

