\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 IV (Bl. 85-88)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones varii III
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  Hildebertus Lavardinensis, Sermones de sanctis, Sermo 82: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Facta sunt encenia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Io 10,22-28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Fratres karissimi, edificauit Salemon templum domino in Ierosolyma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 dampnatus est iste, non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [pro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rapina, sed pro tenacitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (PL 171, 731A-733A). \endash  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 11) Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Preterea est aliud, fratres karissimi, de diuitibus, quod peius est, quia fures domini uocantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ut purgati peruenire possitis ad regales nuptias, juuante domino nostro Ihesu Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Galfredus Babio, Sermo 62: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exvrge, qui dormis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Eph 5,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hucusque, fratres karissimi, satis dormiuistis, hucusque pigritati estis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quid est ab ea inquinari, nisi cum eo excommunicari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ivo Carnotensis, Sermo 7: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quoniam presentium obseruacione dierum utrumque Christi aduentum celebramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ipse saluus erit, sic tamen quasi per ignem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (I Cor 3,15) (PL 162, 567A-568C). \endash  (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 29-43) Zusatz 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In ipsa enim resurrectione ignis consurget\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sed etiam sponte ledere conatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ; (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 43-88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 5) Zusatz 2. Hermannus de Runa, Sermones festivales, sermo 64: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nec scientes, k\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [arissimi], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 preparemus nos in aduentu iudicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 qui nunc pius pontifex pro nobis interpellat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ; (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 5-7) Zusatz 3. Hildebertus Lavardinensis, Sermones de diversis, Sermo 123: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Deus autem, qui facit habitare unius moris in domo, ut post actum cursum celeste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 accipiatis premium et regnetis cum eo in perpetuum. Quod prestare ipse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, 901D). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Hildebertus Lavardinensis, Sermones de tempore, Sermo 16: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Cvm autem descendisset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 8,1-3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quando Christus, fratres karissimi, uoluit inter homines habitare et miraculis potentiam sue diuinitatis ostendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 recipiant uos in futuro in eterna tabernacula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (Lc 16,9), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 juuante d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [omino] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ostro] (PL 171, 416B-419B).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 (Nr. 1) Druck: Fortunato de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 S\u227 \'e3\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 o Boaventura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 , Commentariorum de Alcobacensi manuscriptorum bibliotheca libri tres. Co\u239 \'efmbra 1827, S. 110-116; Zusatz ebd. S. 113 Z. 5-S. 116. \endash  (Nr. 2) Druck: Spicilegium Liberianum. Bde. 1-3, dig. et rec. Francesco \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Liverani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 . Florenz 1863, S. 690-692. \endash  Lit.: Jean-Paul \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Bonnes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 , Un des plus grands pr\u233 \'e9dicateurs du XII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  si\u232 \'e8cle: Geoffroy du Loroux, dit Geoffroy Babion, in: Revue B\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 56 (1945/46), S. 174-215, s. App. I mit Liste der Initien und Drucke von Predigten des Gaufridus Babion S. 200-204, hier S. 204 Nr 63 (Numerierung wie bei Schneyer). \endash  (Nr. 3) Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung einschlie\u223 \'dflich Zusatz: Clm 14348, 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 ; Edition: (Zusatz 1) Henri M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  / R. M. Ir\u232 \'e8ne \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Binont\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 , La collection de textes divers du manuscrit Lincoln 201 et saint Bernard, in: Sacris Erudiri 15 (1964), S. 15-219, hier sermo 45, S. 150f. Z. 68-90; (Zusatz 2) CCCM 64, ed. Edmund \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Mikkers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  / Josef \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Theuws\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  / Roland \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Demeulenaere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 , S. 296f. Z. 102-111.}

