\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Udalricus de Windberg: Sermo de Eucharistia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo bonus et sermo de Corpore Christi. Probet autem se ipsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Cor 11,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si aliquis debet aliquid cibum recipere, oportet, quod videat et probet, vtrum esset bonus et stomachus sit bene dispositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum est autem, quod ille, qui debet hunc cibum accipere, debet quattuor probare. Primo se ipsum, quante sit puritatis, secundo debet probare corpus dominicum, quante sit maiestatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est enim medicina melioratiua, quia viuos et mortuos ad meliorem statum producit, vnde scribitur \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82Sit viuorum atque mortuorum remissio omnium delictorum\lquote . Rogemus dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 1350-1500, <U.W.> Nr. 35. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 /Hetzler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Zum Stand der Erforschung (wie oben), hier S. 135.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

