\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jacobus de Voragine: De letania maiore et minore
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Letania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. letanie) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 bis in anno fiunt, scilicet in festo Macii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. Marci) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et tribus diebus ante festum domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ascensionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Interpretatur enim letania rogacio vel supplicacio. Primo dicitur mayor, que est in die Marcii \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 propter tres causas, primo racione illius, a quo institutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, vielm. instituta) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 est, scilicet a magno Gregorio papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec autem pestis, qualiter ortum habuerit, in vita sancti Gregorii legitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Graesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , cap. 70, S. 312-313 Z. 17; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Maggioni\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , cap. 66.1-14, S. 473f.). \endash  (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quodam tempore Tyberis fluuius alueum egressus in tantum excreuit, vt super muros vrbis influeret et plurimas domos euerteret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ecce totum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. tota) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aeris infectio et turbulencia ymaginem fugeret ac si presenciam ferre non possent sic post ymaginem mira\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch (Ed. mit Auslassungen: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Graesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , cap. 46.4, S. 190-192 Z. 7; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Maggioni\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , cap. 46.42-66, S. 288-290).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Jacobi a Voragine Legenda aurea vulgo historia Lombardica dicta, rec. Theodor \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Graesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Dresden/Leipzig 1846\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Iacopo da Varazze, Legenda aurea. Edizione critica a cura di Giovanni Paolo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maggioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 1-2. \u178 \'b2Florenz 1998 (Millennio Medievale 6. Testi 3).}

