\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 III (Bl. 58-140)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Peregrinus de Oppeln: Sermones de sanctis (S30-S85)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Placens deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sap 4,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In verbis istis duo notantur de beato Marco. Primum eius sanctitas in hoc, quod dicitur placuisse domino, secundo eius felicitas et hoc ibi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 translatus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , scilicet in regnum celorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et nos debemus ipsum diligere, quia potest nos iuuare in corpore et in anima. Vnde Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit Abweichungen und Umstellungen, vgl. Ed. Nr. 24, S. 413-414 Z. 56; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Rep. 4, S. 559 Nr. 132\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Philippi et Jacobi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In domo patris mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Io 14,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quando princeps aliquis vel dominus magnus aliquis amicos suos exspectat licet in domo suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  multa sint, que pro eorum solacio competunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 qui conuersi sunt per doctrinam ipsorum et manent cum Christo in eternum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Rep. 4, S. 567 Nr. 238; (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Nr. 239; (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ) Nr. 241; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ) Nr. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 243; (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 244; (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 247; (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 248. \endash  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 De sancto Paulo apostolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Dedi te in lucem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (Is 49,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Quamuis verba ista scripta sunt in prophetis, tamen congrue potest dominus ea dicere ad beatum Paulum. In quibus verbis tria possumus notare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 sed beatus Paulus dignior est omnibus, quia non Parisius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (vgl. Ed. Nr. 32, S. 453-454 Z. 24; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Rep. 4, S. 560 Nr. 145). \endash  (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 250; (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 253; (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 257; (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  264; (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 267 (expl. abweichend); (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 268; (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 275; (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 284; (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 293; (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 302; (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 303; (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nr. 307: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ingressa est regina Saba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (III Rg 10,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Legitur ergo in libro Regum, quod Salomon ita diues fuit, quod temporibus suis argentum quasi lapides in Ierusalem reputaretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cesar respondit: Est aput nos puella incomparabilis sapiencie, que omnes sapientes confutat et deos nostros demones dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (expl. von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  abweichend).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rep. 4, S. 559f., S. 567-572 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Edition: Peregrini de Opole Sermones de tempore et de sanctis, e codicibus manu scriptis primum ed. Richardus \plain \f4\scaps\lang1024\fs20 Tatarzy\u324 \'f1ski\plain \f4\lang1024\fs20 . Warschau 1997 (Studia przegl\u261 \'b9du tomistycznego 1)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset2 Wingdings;}{\f3\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f4\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Exempla et sermones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aliud exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Alexander misit nuncios suos ad paradysum, qui cum venissent responsum est eis: Nichil posse facere nisi cum humilitate et quidam senex dedit eis lapidem ad similitudinem oculi, ut eum seruent domino suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Aliud exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ego sum panis vivus (Io 6,51). Fratres carissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Si aliquis mortuus loqueretur, verba eius libenter audiretis: In ueritate omnibus loquitur Christus et ut verba eius plenius intelligatis, recitabo ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Item nota exemplum de feretro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b (\u220 \'dcberschrift im Bundsteg wiederholt) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Iterum quidam audiens, quod utile esset recordari mortis, feretrum in camera sua posuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quando volueris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Velimus aut nolumus transeundum esse ab hoc mundo, ideo beati sunt, qui aliquid boni premittunt, vnde eternaliter viuant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Necesse est, fratres, ut sepius moneamus vos, qui simus sacerdotes vestri et racionem reddituri de animabus vestris, si aliquam ille inuisibilis lupus, id est diabolus, rapit et sicut pastor deperdita oue debet respondere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De dedicacionibus quocienscumque venitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Fratres, quocienscumque ad dedicaciones vel ad missas ecclesiarum conuenitis, tunc ideo conuenitis ut ludos et choreas exerceatis et alias vanitates ibi faciatis cum verbis et factis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b[De] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Inuencione crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Esoras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, vielm. Cosdras) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rex Persarum multas gentes suo imperio subiugauit et veniens in Ierusalem crucem domini detulit et in solio suo iuxta se posuit. Hunc ergo Eraclius imperator Romanorum interfecit et crucem in Ierusalem reportauit cum magna gloria et honore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Frederic C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tubach,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Index exemplorum. A Handbook of Medieval Religious Tales. Helsinki 1969 (FF Communications 204), S. 17 Nr. 126; S. 18 Nr. 141. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 2) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Graz, UB, Ms 1454, 395\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 7) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tubach,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Index exemplorum, S. 103 Nr. 1277.}

