\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de cena Domini
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dcberschrift: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De corpore Christi sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nolite sanctum dare canibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 7,6), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 id est peccatoribus. Mt vii\u176 \'b0. Vnde debemus notare inter homines quinque genera hominum, que signum dei ualde inhonorant. Primi sunt, qui indigne tractant, secundi sunt, qui indigniter tradunt, tercii sunt, qui ipsum indigne recipiunt, quarti sunt, qui ipsum indigne custodiunt, quinti sunt, qui ipsum semel in anno in hospicium cordis recipere uolunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 alioquin omnes ab ingressu ecclesie arceantur et moriens et eclesiastica \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 carent sepultura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui manducat carnem meam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 6,55). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctus Iohannes, qui hausit et potauit potum sapiencie de fonte dominici pectoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vere saluberrimus cibus est, per quem homo possidere potest vitam eternam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et iterum orauit et ad pristinam formam rediit et matrone dedit, quem eum sicut postea custodiuit in corde, quod eam Christo sanctificauit in anima et corpore. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Hamburg, SuUB, Theol. 1124, 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 2) Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14637, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Zur Predigt s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Sermonesreihen des Johannes Ludovici (wie oben 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 222 Nr. 31; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.Lu> Nr. 31.}

