\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de BMV
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omni anno in quadragesima inmago\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 crucifixi absconditur et inmago\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 beate Marie virginis et aliorum sanctorum propter tria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum deo non pacificarent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 De sancta virgine Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Que est ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (Ct 6,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Ista verba sunt scripta in Cantico 6 et bene \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 conueniunt hodierne festiuitati. Hodie enim agimus illam sanctam et venerabilem festiuitatem Marie gloriose virginis, sicut ipsa assumpta est in celum, vnde Jeronimus dicit, quod hec festiuitas maior et sanctior est quam aliqua festiuitas alicuius sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et bene ergo sancti angeli poterant mirari et dicere: Que est ista, que progreditur quasi aurora consurgens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 pulchra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut luna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine, dilexi decorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 25,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod domus decoris est corpus beate virginis Marie, de qua dicit dominus per Esechielem: Domum magestatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [e] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 glorificabo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Is 60,7), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fundamenta eius aromata, vnus paries cedrinus, alius eburnius, dectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. tectum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 domus aurum mundum et quis non diligit huius domus decorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quis non timebit eum, fuit enim natus in celo, in paradiso et in terra: Hic egressus est de domo virginali et dicitur angnus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!, recte agnus)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mansuetus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14637, 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Zur Predigt s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Sermonesreihen des Johannes Ludovici (wie oben 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 222, Nr. 34; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.Lu> Nr. 34. \endash  (Nr. 2) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Herzogenburg, StiftsB, Cod. 35, 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

