\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paulus Hungarus: Summa de poenitentia (cap. 1-8)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quare instituta sit confessio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De instruc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [t]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ione confessionis quinque sunt opiniones. Quidam dicunt, quod post peccatum primi hominis instituta fuit confessio, quando dominus interrogauit Adam de peccato commisso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quoad ecclesiam, que nescit nec potest iudicare de occultis, sed tantum de manifestis attenditur penes circumstancias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 || Textabbruch: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Duellius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 65 Z. 33.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Raimundus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Duellius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Miscellaneorum quae ex codicibus manuscriptis collegit. Bd. 1. Augsburg 1723, S. 59-83. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 531f. Nr. 25; Heinrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weisweiler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Handschriftliches zur Summa de paenitentia des Magister Paulus von Sankt Nikolaus, in: Scholastik 5 (1930), S. 248-260; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes, S. 24-26; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 3, 3184, Bd. 4, III 206: 3184; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (mit Supplement) 4919.}

