\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quam magnos studiosis afferat fructus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \u8210 - \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 uocabulum un\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 uscuiusque propositi proprietatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte proprietas) [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 partes tractante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte tractandae) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 || Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 CPL 887. \endash  Edition: Anicii Manlii Severini Boethii De divisione liber. Critical Edition, Translation, Prolegomena, and Commentary by John \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf18 Magee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 . Leiden u.a. 1998 (Philosophia antiqua 77), S. 1-6 Z. 19. \endash  Lit.: John\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf18  Magee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 , The Text of Boethius' De divisione, in: Vivarium 32 (1994), S. 1-50 (ohne diese Hs.).}

