\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 33-98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 52 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Fragmentum commentarii in Ovidii Amores
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 SVPER OVIDIVM SINE TITVLO. Inmerito me auertisti a materia bellorum quam assumpseram, quia non habebam materiam de pueris aut puellis que est apta pentametris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u182 \'b6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Musa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lib. 1.1.30). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eratho perorat scribentibus de amore, ad quam loquitur: O quiete iacent, sed uersor in lecto tota nocte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \u182 \'b6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Menia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lib. 3.13.34) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 docuitque incolas ritus sacrificiorum que fiebant in Grecia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Munk \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Olsen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L\rquote \u233 \'e9tude 2, S. 177 Nr. Cc. 13 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., L\rquote \u233 \'e9tude 4,1, S. 88 (Hs. ausgewertet); Incipitarium Ovidianum. A Finding Guide for Texts in Latin Related to the Study of Ovid in the Middle Ages and Renaissance, ed. Frank T. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coulson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Bruno \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Roy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Turnhout 2000 (The Journal of Medieval Latin. Publications 3), S. 58 Nr. 145.}

