\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sanftl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  I, p. 24, 56, 144, 153, 243, 439, 460; III, p. 1697, 1722; IV, p. 25, 46, 116, 122, 177; Albert \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Boeckler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Regensburg-Pr\u252 \'fcfeninger Buchmalerei des XII. und XIII. Jahrhunderts. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1924 (Miniaturen aus Handschriften der Bayerischen Staatsbibliothek in M\u252 \'fcnchen 8), S. 64f., 108f.; MBK 4/1, S. 223f. Z. 1527-1537; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klemm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rom. Hss. 1, Kat. 33 S. 31f.; Adam S. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cohen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Art of Regensburg Miscellanies, in: Medieval Manuscript Miscellanies: Composition, Authorship, Use, ed. by Lucie \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dole\u382 \'9ealov\u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Kimberly Ann \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rivers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Krems 2013 (Medium aevum quotidianum. Sonderband 31), S. 34-69.}

