\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistolae Senecae ad Paulum et Pauli ad Senecam
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 C\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aput Hieronimi ex libro uirorum illustrium super epistolas Pauli et Senece\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (von H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  LVCIVS ANNIVS Seneca Cordubensis et Fortini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!, recte Sotionis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 stoici discipulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a Nerone interfectus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (cap. 12, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Richardson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 15; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ceresa-Gastaldo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 100; s. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Barlow\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 122). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epitaphium Senecae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item uersvs \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (von H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Cura \endash  labor \endash  meritum sumpti pro munere honores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Initia carminum 3960; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schaller/K\u246 \'f6nsgen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  3242). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola Senece\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (von H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Seneca Paulo salutem. Credo tibi, Paule, nuntiatum, quid heri de te cum Lucinio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, recte Lucilio) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nostro de apocrifis et aliis rebus habuerim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nouum hominem sine corruptela perpetuum animal parit ad deum istinc properantem. Vale Seneca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Barlow\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , ep. 1-9, 11-14, S. 123-138).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 (Nr. 1) Edition: Hieronymus, Liber de viris inlustribus. Gennadius, Liber de viris inlustribus, ed. Ernest Cushing \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Richardson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . Leipzig 1896, S. 1-56 (Texte und Untersuchungen zur Geschichte der altchristlichen Literatur 14,1); Gerolamo, Gli uomini illustri. De viris illustribus, ed. Aldo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Ceresa-Gastaldo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  Florenz 1988 (Biblioteca Patristica 12), S. 56-234. \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Alfred \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Feder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 , Studien zum Schriftstellerkatalog des Heiligen Hieronymus. Freiburg im Breisgau 1927 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 Munk Olsen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 , L\rquote \u233 \'e9tude \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 2, S. 421f. [C 120]. \endash  (Nr. 2) Poetae Latini minores 5, rec. et emendavit Emil \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Baehrens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  / Friedrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Vollmer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . Leipzig 1883, S. 386 Nr. LXXIII; Carlo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Prato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 , Gli epigrammi attribuiti a L. Anneo Seneca. Rom 1964 (Biblioteca degli scrittori greci e latini 2), S. 102-104. \endash  (Nr. 3) Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14436, 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . \endash  Edition: Epistolae Senecae ad Paulum et Pauli ad Senecam, ed. Claude W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Barlow\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . Rom u.a. 1938 (Papers and Monographs of the American Academy in Rome 10), S. 8-26 (f\u252 \'fcr die Edition benutzte Hss., ohne diese Hs.), S. 69 (Hs. genannt).}

