\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber Quare Appendix II
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De quattuor temporibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In quattuor temporibus solemus ieiunare pro ordinandis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 abstinentia istorum dierum emendamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (App. II add. 64, S. 205 Z. 80-86); (Z. 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Viligilie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, recte Vigiliae) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 que a pastoribus in sero sancta nocte natalis domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iterum dico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gaudete, gentiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (ebd. S. 204f. Z. 26-79); (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 25) Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Octaua dies, in qua saluator noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 baptizatus est dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; (Z. 29) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ypapanti grece dicitur representatio siue apparicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 in templo presentatus in ulnis sancti Symeonis est elatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (vgl. App. II add. 24, S. 160f. Z. 37-39). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  vorletzte Zeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Legitur in ecclesiastica historia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 que numquam terminabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (App. II add. 63, S. 201-203 Z. 3-87). \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 9) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De tribus diebus ante pasca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [m]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Noscat uestri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (!, recte vestra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 caritas, quod in diebus solempniis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (!, recte sollemnibus),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  quantum possumus altaria ornamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 iterum uice mulierum reticent cantores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Agnus Dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \lquote  (App. II add. 12, S. 138f. Z. 1-54). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  Z. 24) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 De diebus rogationvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Letania grece, latine rogatio dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 a maiore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (!, recte minore) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 auctoritate indicta uel instituta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (App. II add. 25, S. 168f. Z. 1-37). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  vorletzte Zeile) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 De diebus pentecostes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Pentecoste grece, latine dicitur quinquagesima dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 illam summe pacis tranquillitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (App. II add. 64, S. 203f. Z. 4-25); (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  Z. 22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Sciendum est autem, quod infra hec duo festa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 hoc etiam obseruandum est singulis dominicis DIEBVS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (App. II add. 80, S. 227 Z. 1-5).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Oxford, BodL, Ms Lyell 40, Vatikanstadt, BAV, Cod. 482 Membr. miscell. in 8\u176 \'b0, 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . \endash  Edition: Liber Quare, ed. Georg Polykarp \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 G\u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 tz\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  Turnhout 1983 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 CCCM\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  60), hier Appendix (App.) II additio (add.) 12, 24f., 63f., 80. \endash  Lit.: Lorenz \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Weinrich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 , Das Buch Warum: Zur Liturgie im 11./12. Jahrhundert. Turnhout 2020 (Corpus Christianorum in Translation 33).}

