\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Zacharias Chrysopolitanus: In Unum ex quatuor sive de concordia evangelistarum. Praefatio secunda
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 De quattuor euangelistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mathevs cognomento Leui, conuocatio ad deum ex publicanis actibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et apprehendere expetunt, recognoscant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (PL 186, 35D-38C). \endash  Daran: (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  letzte Zeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prima media perfecta intellige prohibitiones, preceptiones, persuasiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in euangelio est imago clara distinctio ueritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cohen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Miscellanies, s.o. Lit., S. 40 Anm. 20).}

