\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Johannis evang.: \u8479 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Uox tonitrui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Cantus 007921); \u8483 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Victo senatu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Cantus 007921a); \u8483 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Gloria patri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Cantus 909000). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De dedicatione ecclesiae: \u8479 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Terribilis est locus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Cantus 7763); \u8483 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Cumque euigilasset Iacob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Cantus 7763zf); \u8483 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Gloria patri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Cantus 909000); \u8483 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vidit Iacob in somnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Cantus 007763zd). Mit adiastematischen Neumen.}

