\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II (Bl. 44-95)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ambrosius Autpertus: Expositio in Apocalypsin (lib. 7, cap. 16, versus 15)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u220 \'dcberschrift (beschnitten): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 DE CARITATE\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Caritas patiens est, quia inlata mala aequanimiter tolerat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quasi in augmento proprii profectus hilarescit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
