\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Isidorus Hispalensis: Allegoriae quaedam sanctae Scripturae. Ex veteri testamento
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 EPISTOLA \u7822 ?SIDORI AD HONORIUM\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 DOMINO CO\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 SANCTO AC REUERENTISSIMO\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 FRATRI HONORIO YSIDORUS SALUTEM. QUAEDAM NOtissima nomina legis et euangeliorum, quae sub allegoria imaginarie obteguntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Adam figuram Christi gestauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 qu\u230 \'e6 ab inimicis Christi multas\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8  mart\u7823 ?rum strages pertulit et glori\u281 \'ea c\u281 \'ealestis coronam accepit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (PL 83, 97-116C). \endash  Fortgesetzt auf 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 CPL 1190; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 RB 3 (9,1) Nr. 5173; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D\u237 \'edaz y D\u237 \'edaz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Index, S. 33 Nr. 109 (ohne diese Hs.).}

