\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lateinische Interlinear- und Marginalglossen
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 9) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [lib. 1 v. 37f.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Propter talem principem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 , S. 11 Nr. 37); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Ita loquitur de preteritis, quasi futura essent; ita solent loqui poete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 , S. 11 Nr. 38). \endash  (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  Z. 3) [lib. 1 v. 67] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic est sensus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Semper in se magna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 concidunt; nam nec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 fortuna gentes aliquas concitauit in populum terre pelagique potentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ipsos contra se pugnare interfecit Romano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 s (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 , S. 19f. Nr. 81). \endash  (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  Z. 5) [lib. 1 v. 174] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Quam egestas debuit suadere rapinam; vile nefas ideo, quia non creditur malum, si egestas suaderet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 32f. Nr. 174). \endash  (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 17) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [lib. 1 v. 186] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Ideo simulacrum Rome se Ce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [sari obtulit], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 antequam Rubiconem fluuium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  [transiret] \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 unde dicit \u8218 \'82patrie trepidantis\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 36 Nr. 186, mit Abweichungen) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 7) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [lib. 9 v. 771] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Musculus, id est paruus mus, quorum octo in homine esse dicuntur, in quibus, si quis uulneratur, non euadet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 749 Nr. 771). \endash  (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Z. 22) [lib. 9 v. 786]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nichil remansit de cadauere, quod cadauer est uestigium mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 21f.) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [lib. 9 v. 820f.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Ordo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  [verborum]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 matura toxica\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 , id est herba, qu\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 dam unde fit toxicum, qu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  legit \u8218 \'82fatilegi Sabei\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (v. 821) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8230 \'85 id est de illis corruptis poculis non tam cito aliquis interficitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 , S. 751f. Nr. 820). \endash  (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  Z. 29) [lib. 9 v. 864] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8218 \'82tibi conscius\lquote  id est tecum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [con]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 scius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  (s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 , S. 753f. Nr. 864) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 archanioribus, que nobis debuerint esse claustra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb240\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Glossen teils stark verblasst und abgegriffen sowie an den R\u228 \'e4ndern wohl bei der Neubindung (s.o. Einband und Herkunft) beschnitten. Marginalglossen nachweisbar zwischen 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (lib. 1-9), Interlinearglossen nahezu durchgehend eingetragen. \endash  Marginalglossen teils ediert in: Marci Annaei Lucani Pharsalia. Volumen 3 continens scholiastas, ed. Karl Friedrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig 1831.}

