\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Carmen secundum Cantica canticorum compositum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Crebro da mihi basia, cingant me quoque brachia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paruulas uulpes capite uellentes sepes uine\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\cf1 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , ingredi sic prohibite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (AH 20, S. 190 Nr. 256; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Initia carminum 3403).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb240\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: Stephen \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gaselee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Transition from the late Latin Lyric to the Medieval Love Poem. Cambridge 1931, S. 29-32, Hs. genannt S. 30; Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sz\u246 \'f6v\u233 \'e9rffy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Weltliche Dichtungen des lateinischen Mittelalters. Ein Handbuch. Bd. 1: Von den Anf\u228 \'e4ngen bis zum Ende der Karolingerzeit. Berlin 1970, S. 52-54; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Secular Latin Lyrics and Minor Poetic Forms of the Middle Ages. A Historical Survey and Literary Repertory from the Tenth to the late Fifteenth Century. Bd. 3. Concord, New Hampshire, 1994 (Medieval Classics: Texts and Studies 27), S. 113-115.}

