\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedictio Cerei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xultent \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iam angelica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 turba \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 una cum papa nostro Iohanne \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Papst Gelasius II. 1118/19) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et gloriosissimo rege nostro Heinrico \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Kg. Heinrich V., 1106-1125)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et simul et iam iocundissimo duce nostro Heinrico \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Hz. Heinrich IX. von Bayern, 1120-1126) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et antistite nostro Hartwico \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Bf. Hartwig von Regensburg, 1105-1126)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et abbate nostro N. \u8230 \'85 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
