\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I (Bl. II-23)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De vitis patrum liber quintus sive verba seniorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb240\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Prolog) Paschasius Dumiensis, Apophthegmata patrum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 DOMINO UENERABILI patri honorato Paschasio. Vitas patrum Grecorum, ut caetera facundia studiose conscriptas iussus a te, sanctissime pater, in latinum transferre sermonem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nisi aliqua displicuisse cognouero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (CPG 5571; PL 73, 1025f.). \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Libellus 1: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 INCIPIVNT ADHORTATIONES SANCTORUM PATRVM AD PROFECTUM PERFECTIONIS MONACHORUM\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 INTERROGAVIT QUIDAM abbatem Antonium dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quid custodiens placabo deum?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Libellus 2: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 INCIPIT DE EO QVOD OPORTET QVIETEM CVM FESTINATIONE SECTARI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Libellus 3: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 DE COMPVNCTIONE CORDIS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 DICEBANT DE ABBATE ARSENIO, quia totum tempus uitae suae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 atque omni plebe. Regnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 || Textabbruch (CPG 5570; PL 73, 855-861A).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: (Prolog) A vers\u227 \'e3o latina por Pasc\u225 \'e1sio de Dume dos Apophthegmata patrum, ed. Jos\u233 \'e9 Geraldes \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Freire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 1: Introdu\u231 \'e7ao cultural. Pasc\u225 \'e1sio como tradutor. Texte cr\u237 \'edtico; Bd. 2: Descri\u231 \'e7ao dos manuscritos. Genealogia dos c\u243 \'f3dices. Coimbra 1971 (nicht eingesehen).}

