\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thymo OP:\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus de septem sacramentis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb240\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De septem sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ad euidenciam sacramentorum noue legis primo uidendum est, quis ea instituit, secundo quid sit signum et de diuisione signorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Samaritanus, id est custos, Christus scilicet, uulnerato, id est humano generi, appropians\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Queris, an sit melius sepe an raro communicare. Respondit, quod melius sepe quam raro, quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 si panis cottidianus est, cur illum post annum accipimus, sicut Greci in oriente accipere consueuerunt. Accipe cottidie, ut tibi cottidie prosit. Sic uiue, ut cottidie possis accipere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (Zitat \u8218 \'82Si panis \u8230 \'85\lquote : Ambrosius Mediolanensis (?), De sacramentis, lib. 5.4.25, CSEL 73, ed. Otto \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Faller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , S. 69 Z. 64-67). \endash  53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch u.d.T.: Thymo Polonus (Bohemus), Tractatus super IV librum sententiarum Petri Lombardi. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 RS 1, S. 422 Nr. 917 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Scriptores 4, S. 409f. Nr. 3904 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hammesse/Szyller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1, Nr. 1162 (diese Hs. genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .}

