\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -17b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Publius Vergilius Maro: Bucolica
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Virgilius in Bucolicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Argumenta tetrasticha Bucolicon et Georgicon Ovidio falso attributa: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Qualis Bucolicis, quantus tellure domanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (4 Verse). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ecloga prima: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Publii Virgilii Maronis Bucolicon. Incipit Dramaticon Misticon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Titire, tu patule recubans sub tegmine fagi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 aioresque cadunt altis de montibus umbr\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga secunda. \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga tertia. \endash  (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga quarta. \endash  (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga quinta. \endash  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga sexta. \endash  (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga septima. \endash  (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga octava; (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , kopfst\u228 \'e4ndig) Nachtrag von V. 22-25, die auf 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  nach Z. 11 versehentlich ausgelassen wurden: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Menalus argutumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 non passus inertes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte inertis). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipe Menalios mecum, mea carmina, ducite Daphnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte Daphnim). \endash  (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga nona. \endash  (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) Ecloga decima: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Extremum hunc, Aretusa, mihi concede laborem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 Ite domum satur\u281 \'ea, uenit Esperus, ite, capell\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: (Nr. 1) Carmina in codicibus scripta sive poesis Latinae supplementum. Bd. 1: Libri Salmasiani aliorumque carmina, rec. David R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Shackleton Bailey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig u.a. 1982 (Anthologia Latina 1,1), S. 11-13. \endash  (Nr. 2) Publii Vergili Maronis opera, ed. Roger A. B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mynors\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Oxford 1976 (Scriptorum classicorum bibliotheca Oxoniensis), S. 1-28. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Munk Olsen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , L\rquote \u233 \'e9tude 2, S. 740 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 [C. 125]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 (17b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ) Von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand (13. Jh.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Poetice agriculture insudare uolentibus adtendendum exhortamur, quatenus ipsam typicam curam in operibus sapientum huius mundi maledictam et omni uirtute secundum literaturam inanem et uacuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 hoc est gentilem leccionem legere uoluerit, prius typicos pilos mundialis superfluitatis cum secularium operationum unguibus fecerit, et sic eam ducat dicens cum ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Leua eius sub capite meo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  \u8230 \'85 (Ct 2,6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 et tali ordine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Osculetur eam osculo oris sui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  (Ct 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Huius igiur poetice leccionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 . \endash  17b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  leer.}

