\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II (Bl. 18-47)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quintus Horatius Flaccus: Carmina
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Liber Odarum Oracii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Lib. 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [enas] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 attauis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 edite regibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sublimi feriam sidera uertice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I,1-6, 15-21, 23-27, 29-32, 35-36) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et thure et fidibus iuuat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 amalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 novo diuelletur advltero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (XXXVI,1-19.). \endash  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pericvlose plenvm opus ale\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 praeter atrocem animvm Catonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I,6-8, 10-16, 21-24) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non usitata nec tenui ferar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mitte superuacvos honores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (XX,1-7, 9-11, 23f.). \endash  (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Odi profanvm uulgus et arceo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 