\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Vita istius poete talis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Sulmonensis fuit Ouidius, de Peligno oppido oriundus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 , [ubi] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 a parentibus literalibus studiis traditus, Romam ueniens metrica arte studuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 et docere qualiter iuuenes a malo turpissimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ac incesto amore deberet distinere uero a coniuge alterius et ab omni vii ceteros possit peruenire uel aliquid mali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 .
