\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Versus de pedibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 (Z. 5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Vnde pedes docti, quibus extent, qua uice scripti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  (v. 1) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Hunc nimis exosus est per sua membra molosus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  (v. 23); Fortsetzung 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  Z. 27: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Rem tamen hanc monstrat, tribus ex longis quia constat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  (v. 24) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Doctus grecandi quia sit probat anthi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  (v. 48). \endash  109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die \u8218 \'82Ars versificandi et Carminum\lquote  (s.o. 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 497f. \endash  Celtis\rquote  Fassung der \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82Versus de pedibus\lquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 u.d.T. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82De pedibus et eorum sillabis\lquote  in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 GW 6460, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 [3]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -[4]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  Z. 24. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. dazu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 489 Nr. 3. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung (s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wortbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 496f.): St. Florian, StiftsB, Cod. XI 587, 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Cod. 246, 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

