\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Varia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 (Z. 1-24) De pronuntiatione litterarum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Sub hiatu oris congruo solo spiritu memoramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Z\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Uero idcirco Appius Claudius detestatur, quod dentes mortui, dum exprimitur, imitatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 (Z. 25-114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  Z. 27) De nominibus litterarum et numerorum Graecorum: \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 a \u913 \'c1 alfa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ; \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 b \u914 \'c2 beta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ; \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 c \u915 \'c3 gamma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 z \u918 \'c6eta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ; \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 \u919 \'c7 eta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ; \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 th \u920 \'c8 theta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ; (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 i \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 \u921 \'c9ota I mia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ; \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 k \u922 \'ca kappa ii dia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ps \u968 \'f8 psi lxx heptenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ; \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 \u969 \'f9 o longa lxxx ogdenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 dccc ogdacusin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 dcccc niacusin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  Z. 28-114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  Z. 4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 Temporibus Iustiniani Augusti Cassiodorus apud urbem claruit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 apostolorum actus uersibus exarauit. Hec ita in Longobardorum gestis scripta s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf18 [unt].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f5\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Edition: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Martianus Capella, De nuptiis philologiae et Mercurii, ed. Adolf \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dick\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig 1925. Addenda et corrigenda iterum adiecit Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pr\u233 \'e9aux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Editio stereotypa correctior altera \u8230 \'85 Stuttgart 1978 (Graecorum et Romanorum Teubneriana), lib. 3, S. 95f. \endash  (Nr. 3) Paulus Diaconus, Historia Langobardorum, lib. 1, MGH SS rer. Lang., ed. Georg \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Waitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Ludwig \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bethmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 63 Z. 15-22.}

