\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I (Bl. 1-26)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Glossa in Cantica canticorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Prologus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber iste intitulatur Cantica Canticorum, et hec per quandam excellentiam, quia sicut dicuntur sabbata sabbatorum apud iudeos, que excellunt alia sabbata et sic dicuntur sancta sanctorum, que excellunt alia sancta et sicut apud fideles dicitur dies dierum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commentarius: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Osculetur me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ct 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Acsi dicat: O pater ille, quem super omnia diligo, immo solum diligo, quem non est opus nominare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et odore uirtutum longe lateque flagrantes per dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 13-25) Nachtrag von H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Causa, que beatum Iohannem scribere moueat, quia interim ipse dum exul teneretur a Domiciano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et item in presenti etiam multas dignitates, ut a remissione p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 eccatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Glossa ord. ad Apc Prol.8881b:16.1-3).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 RB 6, S. 451 Nr. 9948; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 G\u233 \'e9rard\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Martel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 , Fragment in\u233 \'e9dit d'un commentaire anonyme sur le Cantique, in: Sacris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Erudiri 28 (1985), S. 557-561, diese Hs. S. 560 Anm. 6 genannt; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 Rossana \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 Guglielmetti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 La tradizione manoscritta dei commenti latini al Cantico dei cantici (origini-XII secolo). Repertorio dei codici contenenti testi inediti o editi solo nella Patrologia latina. Florenz 2006 (Millennio medievale. Strumenti e studi. N.S. 14), S. 142 Nr. 564. \endash  Nachtrag: Glossa ord. ad Apc.Prol. = Prologus \u8218 \'82Sicut in saecularibus\lquote  (Nr. 83.8881b), in: Apocalypsis cum glossa ordinaria (Nr. 83), post Argentinam Adolfi Rusch 1481 editionem, aucta et emendata, ed. Martin \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Morard\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , laborantibus Fabio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Gibiino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  / Marie-Ios\u233 \'e9 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Sorbets\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Novissima emendatio. Paris 2014-2023 (Gloss-e = Glossae Scripturae Sacrae-electronicae, online-Ressource: https://gloss-e.irht.cnrs.fr/index.php).}

