\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beda Venerabilis: Super parabolas Salomonis allegorica expositio (Exzerpt)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 28) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Timor domini, principium sapientie. Duo sunt timores domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 primus seruilis, qui principium scientie uocatur. Secundus amicabi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [li]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 s, qui perfectionem sapientie comitatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 exempla illius quantum ualet sequatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: PL 91, 939C-1038C. \endash  Edition: Lib. 1, cap. 1-lib. 3, cap. 31, CCL 119B, ed. David \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hurst\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , S. 25 Z. 91-S. 160 Z. 496\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 .}

