\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de evangeliis dominicalibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 23-26) Sermo 39: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Magna est uirtus pure orationis, que quasi quedam persona ad deum intrat et illic mandata peragit, quo caro uenire nequit. Eccl. xxi\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio humilitatis sepe nubes penetrat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 donec aspiciat eam altissimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Sir 35,21). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 26-34) Sermo 52: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Joh. iii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui facit iusticiam, iustus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Io 3,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Certe ille facit iusticiam, qui reddit unicuique quod suum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et deturpauerunt partes aliorum bene reddiderunt et cum usura. Hanc ergo iusticiam non seruant peccatores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 34-60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 A\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ssidua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Assidua enim debet esse oratio uiri iusti, scilicet ut constans appareat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Matth. ix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hoc genus demonum non eicitur, nisi in oratione et ele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [mosina] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et ieiunio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 17,20). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 1-17) Sermo 54: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Math. v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Beati qui lugent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 5,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Iere. xxxi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Conuertam luctum nostrum in gaudium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Ier 31,13) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Petrus iii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Si quis loquitur, quasi sermones dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (I Pt 4,11). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 18-30) Sermo 55. Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec lo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 cutus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sum u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 obi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 s]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut non scan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 dalizemini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 16,1). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Argumentum habemus hoc, quod excommunicatus iniuste meretur, si seruet sententiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Greg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 orius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad modicum gloriari sinitur, ut in perpetuum atrocius puniatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (expung.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 feriatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 31-60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 26) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Apparuerit apostolis etc. Quo tempore apparuerit? Post pascha, id est post transitum de uiciis ad uirtutes. P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 salmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Declina a malo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 36,27); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isaias ii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quiescite agere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Is 1,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item post ascensionem de bono in melius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad Col\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [olossenses]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Que s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ursum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sunt querite, n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [on]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 uper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 erram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ] (Col 3,1-2); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Math. vi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nolite \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 the\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [saurizare] (Mt 6,19). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nisi quis re\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 natus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 erit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ex \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aqua\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 et spiritu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 3,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod quadruplex est nativitas, que notari potest in hoc ewangelio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prima laboriosa ex matris utero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec habet tres comites se comitantes, scilicet pena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Z. 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secunda gratiosa, scilicet in pabtismo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec similiter tres habet co\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 mites\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scilicet remissionem peccatorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (Z. 7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tertia est lacrimosa, scilicet in penitentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec etiam tres habet comites, scilicet amaritudinem in contricione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (Z. 15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quarta nat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ivitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 est gloriosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 hec etiam habet tres comites, scilicet gaudium sine dolore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 21) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Apc. xxi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et mors ultra non erit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Apc 21,4).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 21-61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 2) Sermo 60. Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Contra diuites\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vsquequo aggrauat contra se densum lutum?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Hab 2,6) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 item eternaliter dampnant, vnde dicitur de illo, quod sepultus est in inferno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. Lc 16,22). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 3-29) Sermo 61: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Factum est autem, ut mor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [eretur] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [endicus] (Lc 16,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nota quod mors bonorum bona est in raptione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 26) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ad calorem nimium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Iob 34,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Gregorius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Puluilli capiti iacentis conficitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quem nulla correctionis asperitas pulsat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Gregorius Magnus, Regula pastoralis, pars secunda, cap. 8, PL 77, 43A). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 29-62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) Sermo 74: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota, quod adulatores sunt diaboli, quia molliunt peccatores in peccatis, sicut mulieres pueros suos dormire faciunt suis adulationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad Eph. v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Que in occultis ab ipsis fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Eph 5,12). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 6-32) Sermo 80: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Videns dominus civitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 19,41), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a Tito et Vesp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 asiano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [non]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 multo post tempore destruendam, fleuit s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 uper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 llam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Math. xiiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ite in ciuitatem et occurret uobis homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mc 14,13); (Z. 32-62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1) mit Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Homo iste est quilibet peccator conuersus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 2-63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De finibus Tyri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exiens Ihesus de fini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 bus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tiri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mc 7,31). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tirus uenacio, Sydon angustia interpretatur. Ad similitudinem ergo Christi exeamus de Tiro et Sidone, id est a uenacione et anxietate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 adeamus ergo cum fiducia ad thronum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Hbr 4,16). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 7-24) Sermo 95: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum querite regnum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 6,33). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod regnum dei a diuersis diuersimode queritur, scilicet a quibusdam non inuenitur. Quidam non querunt, sed fugiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iusticia dei est reddere unicuique quod suum est. Nota, quod debemus tria tribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [reddere]|| Textabbruch; danach L\u252 \'fccke im Umfang von 5 Zeilen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 25-63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 10) Sermo 99 mit Schluss von Sermo 24: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui testa saniem radebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Iob 2,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Peccator sedere debet in sterquilinio, per recordationem penitentie immunditie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 festinemus ingredi in illam re\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 quiem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hbr 4,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vita breuis, via longa. Si uis ergo peruenire, incipe transilire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 11-14) Sermo 89: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beati oculi qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 10,23), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quasi dicat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Be\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sunt, qui uident oculis cordis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut de peccatis nostris confundamur uidentes eum sine peccato crucifixi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte crucifixum).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Nr. 1f., 4f., 8-11, 13-15: Predigtentw\u252 \'fcrfe mit unverkennbaren Parallelen zu den von Hugo de Sancto Caro OP (1200-1263) verfassten Sermones de evangeliis dominicalibus (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rep. 2, S. 758-766; die o.g. Nrn. der sermones entsprechen der Numerierung bei Schneyer); Nr. 3, 6f. und 12 sind nicht bei Hugo nachweisbar. Kritisch ist anzumerken, dass die Lebensdaten des Verfassers nicht mit der Datierung von Fasz. II konform sind. \endash  Edition und Lit.: J\u225 \'e1nos \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bartk\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u243 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Un instrument de travail dominicain pour les pr\u233 \'e9dicateurs du XIIIe si\u232 \'e8cle: Les Sermones de evangeliis dominicalibus de Hugues de Saint-Cher (\u8224 \'861263). Edition et \u233 \'e9tude. Phil. Diss. Univ. Lumi\u232 \'e8re Lyon 2 (Internet-Ressource: http://theses.univ-lyon2.fr/documents/lyon2/2003/bartko_j#p=0&a=top).}

