\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Florilegium sententiarum patristicarum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb240\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 15) \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Greg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [orius]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Si dominus benignus, numquam prelatus austerus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 audiant te homines parua mandantem, et grandia facientem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [videant]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 18) Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Debent superiores inferioribus semper beneficium et auxilium impendere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 societatem atque equalitatem amare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 22) Am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Aug\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ustinus]. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Amore dei nil suauius nil sublimius nil dignius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 tanto eius uisio erit suauior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 35) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Felix paupertas uoluntarie relinquentium omnia et sequentium te, domine Ihesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 in illo tanto discrimine iudiciorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Aufgef\u252 \'fchrt werden die ersten drei Zitate sowie das Schlusszitat Nr. 4. \endash  (Nr. 1) Ps.-Chrysostomus, Opus imperfectum in Matthaeum, hom. 43, PG 56, 878 Z. 13-17. \endash  (Nr. 2) Hugo de Sancto Victore, De institutione novitiorum, cap. 5; Edition: L'oeuvre de Hugues de Saint-Victor. Bd. 1: De institutione novitiorum et al. Texte latin par Hugh Bernard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Feiss\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , traduction fran\u231 \'e7aise par Dominique \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Poirel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Turnhout 1997, S. 30 Z. 181-184. \endash  (Nr. 3) Liber viridarii consolationis, pars 4, cap. 5, in: Bibliotheca Casinensis. Bd. 4: Cod. 172-246, ed. Luigi \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Tosti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Montecassino 1880, S. 263-315, hier S. 285. \endash  (Nr. 4) Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermones super psalmum \u8218 \'82Qui habitat\lquote , sermo 8 \u167 \'a7 12, in: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 4: Sermones 1, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rochais\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Rom 1966, S. 434 Z. 27-S. 435 Z. 4.}

