\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In Auswahl: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 4-67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Expedit uobis ut ego uadam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Io 16,7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ). Duo ponit. Primus est expediens admissionem spiritus sancti, ibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Expedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Expediebat aut corporalis recessus aut discipulis, quia ipsum tamen uero hominem diligebant et in corporali presencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ut proximum et nos edificemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Scias modum sciendi, ut scias quo ordine, quo studio, quo fine scire te oporteat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermones in Cantica canticorum, sermo 36; Ed.: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 2: Sermones super Cantica canticorum 36-86, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  / Charles H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Talbot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  / Henri M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Rochais\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Rom \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 1958, S. 5 Z. 20f\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 30-68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Iustus comparatur palme propter diuersitates ipsius. Palma asperam habet radicem, sic certus asperum habet inicium conuersionis recognando dies suos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sub umbra illius quem desid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [eraueram] \u8230 \'85 (Ct 2,3). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 13-68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 30) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Posuisti, do\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [mine], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 su\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [per] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [put] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ps 20,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Duplici corona decorat dominus s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [anctos] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 suos, gratia in presenti, gloria in futuro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sic tota uita eterna est uidere dominum. Johannes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec est uita eterna, ut te cognoscant, solum deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Io 17,3) (Petrus de Remis, Sermones de communi sanctorum, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Rep. 4, S. 753 Nr. 475; vgl. auch Bd. 8, S. 164 Nr. 399). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 31-69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Quadruplex est uia domini, per quam nos ipsum sequi oportet. Prima de celo in uirginis uterum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 hoc intellige dictum de temptatione, que sit ab hoste aut a carne, que est ueniale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Petrus de Remis, s. Nr. 3, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 S. 754 Nr. 478). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Signa dampnati tria. Primum, qui peccat ex temeritate et malicia cordis et sine ueri timore, secundum prosperitas in peccatis, tertium odium bonorum hominum et contra bonorum opera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Iob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Peccaui, et uere deliqui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (Iob 33,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Eccl.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In humilitate tua patientiam habe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Sir 2,4).}

