\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 III (Bl. 71-135)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bernhardus Claraevallensis: De moribus et officio episcoporum tractatus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domino uenerabili H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [enrico], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Senonensium episcopo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte archiepiscopo), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 frater Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Placuit prestancie uestre nouum aliquid dictatum a nobis requirere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dum morem modumque in scribendo sollempnem seruare nescirem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Epistola Nr. 42. \endash  Druck: PL 182, 809-834; Edition: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 7: Epistolae. Pars 1: Corpus epistolarum 1-180, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Rom 1974, S. 100-131.}

