\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sententiae I
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ter dictum est Petro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pasce o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ves] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [eas] (Io 21,17). \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 Omnis pastor tribus modis debet pascere exemplo scilicet bone uit\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ut dignus sit exaudiri pro subditis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tres sunt gradus in amicis dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cari, cariores, karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 obliti soli deo inherebunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (Fortsetzung Z. 4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ipso pleni et ex ipso et in ipso plene beati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tria sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tabernaculum, atrium, domus. In tabernaculis sunt homines iusti in carne uiuentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tectum consummatio et perfectio ipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (drittletzte Zeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rectores aliorum debent esse tanquam pastores ouium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 baculus est devocio, que facit stare erectum vel eternorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12) \plain \f1\i\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24 CLEMENS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Similis est omnis ecclesie status naui magn\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ita deo precem fundere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [convenit], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut nauigantes mereantur audiri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo obedientia in paradyso fuit data, que non erant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte erat) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 necessaria, non utilis, non onerosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nullum enim bonum sine perseuerantia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit dominus Ihesus discipulis suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ite in castellum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 21,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mundus est castellum, cuius uallis superbia et municiones cetera uicia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Meliora sunt ubera t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ua]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ] (Ct 1,1). \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 Vbera uini scilicet uu\u281 \'ea semel calcat\u281 \'ea siccantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Filius dei apparuit ut nos adiuuaret et erudiret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ut idem securi ab eo speremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ivstus postquam uenit de ignorantia ad ueritatem, de errore ad uiam, de fame sapientie ad uerbum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et carnis affectibus, in quibus deficit et moritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Anima, que semel ueneno terreni amoris infecta est, non leuiter se expedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et pro se ipsis non causa alterius emolumenti quam in diabolo est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 21) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Non est speciosa laus in ore peccatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Sir 15,9), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 non qui fuit, sed qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [est] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 etiam in ore penitentis peccatoris, non uidetur speciosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 tunc est labor speciosus et dulcis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Terra bona fructum per pacientiam reddit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quanto nunc eius rubiginem ignis tribulationis purgat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vrbs fortitudinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Is 26,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec urbs murum habet et antemurale. Ciuitas est anima iusti murus eius propositum continentie et uirtus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vnde dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Non in continentia sed in paciencia uestra p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ossidebitis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [nimas] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 uestras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 21) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Anime impiorum tam laicorum quam clericorum ciuitates munite sunt. Murus est inpudencia, quia non pudet eos facere mala\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 que delectant, etiam pascendo reficiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Tabernaculum et candelabra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Hbr 9,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Non ideo dicit candelabra, ut plura essent, sed pocius erat unum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quia etiam uetus per n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ovum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et nouum per u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [etus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 confirmatur. Vnde dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Abyssus abyssum i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [nvocat] (Ps 41,8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et alibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Omnia poma, n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ova] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [etera] \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ct 7,13).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung der Sentenzensammlung: Clm 23440, 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Z. 7-52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Z. 10 (Nr. 2, 1, 4-14, 3, 15); Heiligenkreuz, StiftsB, Cod. 236, 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Z. 10-142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Z. 18 (Nr. 1-4, 6-9, 13). \endash  Lit.: Bibliographie g\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9rale de l'ordre Cistercien. Bd. 10: Hors s\u233 \'e9rie Saint Bernard, fasc. 1-20, par Henri M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  / Eug\u232 \'e8ne \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Manning\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Rochefort 1982 (La documentation cistercienne 21,10), hier fasc. 10-12 Nr. 4157 (diese Hs.) und Nr. 4181 (= Clm 23440, Prov.: Augustinerchorherrenstift Beuerberg). \endash  Einzelnachweise: (Nr. 3) Bernardus Claraevallensis: De diversis sermo 78, in: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 6.1: Sermones 3, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Rom 1970, S. 318; vgl. auch \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 Henri M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 , Remarques sur les sermons divers et les sentences de Saint Bernard, in: Analecta Cisterciensia 21 (1965), S. 1-34, hier S. 15 (diese Hs. genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \endash  (Nr. 4) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lottin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , in: RThAM 14 (s.u. 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8218 \'82De temptatione\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), S. 169 Nr. 554. \endash  (Nr. 5) Clemens I., papa, Epistola ad Jacobum, Interpretatio Rufini, cap. 14, PG 2, 49f. \endash  (Nr. 7) Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rep. 9, S. 102, Paris, BNF, Lat. 2914, Nr. 10. \endash  (Nr. 8) Bernardus Claraevallensis, De diversis sermo 54, wie S. 279f. Nr. 3. \endash  (Nr. 11) Bernardus Claraevallensis, De diversis sermo 81, wie S. 321 Nr. 3. \endash  (Nr. 12) Gregorius Magnus, Homiliae in evangelia, lib. 1, hom. 15 \u167 \'a7 4, in: CCL 141, ed. Raymond \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u201 \'c9taix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , S. 106 Z. 76-93\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 . \endash  (Nr. 13) Vgl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bernardus Claraevallensis, In dedicatione ecclesiae sermo 3, in: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 5, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Rom 1968, S. 379 Z. 4-15. \endash  (Nr. 15) Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Clm 14506, 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Z. 10-66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Z. 7; vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lottin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , in: RThAM 14 (s.u. 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8218 \'82De temptatione\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), S. 169 Nr. 560.}

