\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anselmus Cantuariensis: Homiliae et exhortationes. Homilia IX
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Intrauit Ihesus quoddam castellum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 10,38). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod ad gloriosam dei genitricem lectio ista pertineat, ut in eius festiuitate legatur, plerique solent querere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec est pars optima, que non a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [uferetur] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ab ea, cuius et nos participes simus, meritis et precibus, per Ihesum Christum, filivm eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 PL 158, 644C-649C).}

