\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo super Mt 11,12
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quidam sunt, qui diripiunt regnum celorum iuxta illud et uiolenti diripiunt illud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Mt 11,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Illi diripiunt, qui se ipsos mortificant et affligunt et carentes possessionibus, quas erogent, se ipsos mactant, frangunt, offerunt ad modum Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hi tales sub preciosa ueste seruant mundicie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Clm 23440: munditiam) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 conscienti\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 23440, 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Z. 6-18.}

