\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24 IERONIMUS AD DAMASVM DE PRODIGO FILIO\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 id est deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 habuit duos filios\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Lc 15,11), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 id est duos populos, ivdeos et gentiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Portionem substantie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (vgl. Lc 15,12), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 substantia est omne, quod uidimus, sapimus, cogitamus, loquimur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in ecclesiasticis rebus non queruntur uerba, sed sensus, id est panibus uita sustentanda est, non siliquis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Gek\u252 \'fcrzte und stark \u252 \'fcberarbeitete Fassung. \endash  Druck: PL 22, 382-394. \endash  Edition: CSEL 54, ed. Isidorus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hilberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , S. 117 Z. 3-S. 142\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 .}

