\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schule des\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Anselmus Laudunensis: Ehetraktat \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8218 \'82Decretum dei fuit\lquote 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24 DE CONIVGIO INCIPIT\plain \f1\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24 DECRETUM\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dei fuit, homines per sacramenta saluari, quorum primum coniugium fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 adulter in hac v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ],\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 id est in hac conuersacione, permanserit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Anhang: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 9-18) \plain \f1\i\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24 BEDA IN OMELIA\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Nupti\u281 \'ea facte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 2,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si thoro immaculato et nuptiis debita castitate celebratis, culpa inesset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 hos su\u281 \'ea presentia uirtutis honorauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Facta lectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 N\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uptie f\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 actae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 unt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 G\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 alilaeae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 18-115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 11) \plain \f1\i\expndtw-15\lang1033\fs24 DE VITA\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Martini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ouem recens tonsam forte beatus Martinus conspexerat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fornicacio deputetur ad penam, nisi satisfactione purgetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Weisweiler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Schrifttum (s.o. 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), S. 361-379. \endash  Lit.: Friedrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Sententiae Berolinenses. Eine neugefundene Sentenzensammlung aus der Schule des Anselm von Laon, in: Recherches de th\u233 \'e9ologie ancienne et m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale 11 (1939), S. 33-61, hier S. 34 Nr. IV (mit weiterer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lottin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , in: RThAM 14 (s.o. 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 \u8218 \'82De temptatione\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ), S. 170 Nr. 567 (diese Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 RS 1, S. 375 Nr. 771. \endash  Anhang: (Nr. 1) Beda Venerabilis, Homeliarum evangelii libri II, lib. 1, hom. 14, CCL 122, ed. David \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hurst\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , S. 95 Z. 6-16. \endash  (Nr. 2) Sulpicius Severus, Dialogus II, cap. 10, PL 20, 208.}

