\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De specialibus antiphonis laudum, que ponuntur ante natiuitatem domini, fiat sicut in subscripta tabula continetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In illo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [anno], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 in quo natiuitas domini in dominica uenerit, secundum sequentem tabulam procedatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ad nonam antiphona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Magnificatus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Cantus 003670).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: EDIT16 CNCE 56761, Bl. ++ v\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -++ \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 [8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . Vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Van Dijk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  2, S. 401-408. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Giacomo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Baroffio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Manoscritti liturgici italiani a San Pietroburgo. Alcune osservazioni in margine al catalogo, in: Aevum 84 (2010), S. 433-438, hier S. 436\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .}

