\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notker Balbulus: De arte rhetorica (Exzerpt)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 DE AGNICIONE GENERUM\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 QUOT MODIS DINOSCUNTUR GENERA? Resp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [onditur]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 IIII. \plain \f1\i\caps\lang1033\fs24 Quibus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ? Ab altitudine, a procreante, a loco, ex genere dialectico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo tercium? Quemadmodum genus dialecticum cui subponitur species, ut animal, quod est genus, cui subponitur species, ut homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed. S. 625 Z. 8-17 mit leichten Abweichungen) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17-157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid est substantia? Substantia est qu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  maxime et proprie et principaliter dicitur, qu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nec in subiecto est neque de subiecto predicatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Unde dicitur substantia? Substantia dicitur a subsistendo, quia unaqu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que natura in sua proprietate consistit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 626 Z. 30-S. 627 Z. 5). \endash  (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 2-4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid est dialectica? Dialectica est rationalis disciplina uera a falsis discernendi potens. Inde di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [a]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lecticus qui de dictis disputat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 624 Z. 27-30).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Die Schriften Notkers und seiner Schule. Bd. 1,2: Schriften philosophischen Inhalts, hrsg. von Paul \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Piper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Freiburg 1882 (Germanischer B\u252 \'fccherschatz 8,2), S. 623-684.}

