\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\caps\lang1033\fs24 De scansionibus sive cesvris \plain \f1\i\caps\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\caps\lang1033\fs24 ersvs heroici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\caps\lang1033\fs24 Scansionvm avtem in versibvs svnt species iiii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Coniuncta, Districta, Mixta, Diuisa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 interpretabatur autem colon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 membrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 comma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 incisio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 periodos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 clausula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 siue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 circuitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Keil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 245 Z. 17-S. 246 Z. 22; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kendall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , cap. 12, S. 116-118 Z. 1-51). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 9) Daran: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Modi declinationum pronominum quattuor sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primus, qui in tribus primitiuorum personis cernitur, quorum genitiuvs singularis in i desinit et accusativus et ablatiuvs in e, ut ego, tui, sui, tibi et sibi, tuorum, suorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quartvs modus est, qui sequitur per omnes casus terci\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  declinationis nomina, ut nostras nostratis, uestras uestratis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Edition: Scriptores de orthographia. Terentius Scaurus, Velius Longus, Caper, Agroecius, Cassiodorius, Martyrius, Beda, Albinus. Audacis excerpta, Dosithei ars grammatica, Arusiani Messii exempla elocutionum, Cornelii Frontonis liber de differentiis, fragmenta grammatica, rec. Heinrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Keil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig 1880. ND Hildesheim 1961 (Grammatici Latini 7), S. 227-260; CCL 123A, ed. Calvin B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kendall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 68 Nr. 52 (diese Hs. genannt). \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Manitius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1, S. 75 (diese Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Laistner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bede Manuscripts, S. 135\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 . \endash  (Nr. 2) Zitat nicht identifiziert; \u228 \'e4hnliche Formulierungen u.a. in: Alcuinus, Ars grammatica, cap. De casibus, in: PL 101, 872CD; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Donatus Ortigraphus, Ars grammatica, cap. De pronomine, in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 : CCCM 40D, ed. John \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 Chittenden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17 , S. 111 Z. 317-S. 119 Z. 521\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 .}

