\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Declinatio pronominis. \endash  De pedibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 INCIPIVNT DECLINATIONES PRONOMINIS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 Qu\u281 \'ea est agnitio prim\u281 \'ea declinationis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 pronominis, cuius genitiuus in i productam, datiuus in i commune, accusatiuus et ablatiuus in e productam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 qu\u281 \'ea est agnitio quint\u281 \'ea declinationis? Quinta declinatio deprehenditur in his, qu\u281 \'ea ad se fem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ina]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 am \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 (?, unleserlich, da verblasst) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 terti\u281 \'ea declinationis declinantur\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  ut cuias cuiatis, nostras nostratis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Z. 14) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 DE DIVITIONIBVS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Que est equa diuisio? Equa diuisio est, quando arsis tot tempora habet, quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (!, recte quot) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 thesis. Quid est arsis? \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 Eleuatio uocis. Quid est thesis? Depositio uocis. Qu\u281 \'ea est dupla diuisio? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dupla diuisio est, quando arsis duplo uincit thesin uel uincitur a thesi\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat8 . Qu\u281 \'ea est tripla diuisio? Tripla diuisio est, quando arsis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 tripliciter uincit thesin uel uincitur a thesi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85; die letzten f\u252 \'fcnf Zeilen verblasst. \endash  198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Orl\u233 \'e9ans, BMun, Ms. 259, S. 281 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Holtz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Donat, s.o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 414).}

