\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si diuersis tribulacionibus et temptacionibus vndique fueris afflictus et a deo derelictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  has decanta psalmos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Ps 21, 54, 11; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si vis agere penitenciam de peccatis tuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septem psalmos penitenciales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si presens vita fuerit tibi fastidiosa et ad celestem  patriam anhelas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Ps 41, 62, 83; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si te a deo derelictum intelligis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dic computo corde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Ps 12, 43, 56, 60, 30 \u8230 \'85; (429\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si vis omnipotentem deum laudare et gracias agere pro vniuersis beneficiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Ps 112, 126, 148, 102, 62.}

