\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones dominicales de tempore et de sanctis I
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Im Fu\u223 \'dfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In parasceve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 111\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 108 = .xvii. Non coques hedum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (Ex 23,19; 34,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In hiis uerbis duo possunt attendi, scilicet mors Christi preciosa et eiusdem annuntiatio gloriosa. Primum est notandum, cum dicitur: Non coques hedum, hoc est igne passionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Christus passus est pro nobis, uobis relinquens exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (I Pt 2,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Reliquit nobis dominus triplex exemplum. \u8479 ? In summa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 112\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 109 = .xviii. Dabo tibi filium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Gn 17,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec uerba dicta sunt de Ysaac et possunt exponi de bono Iohanne allegorice, ad cuius commendationem possumus in hiis uerbis quattuor notare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Primum est eius nativitas miraculosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 qui dicit: Qui uos audit, me audit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Lc 10,16), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 conuertuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 113\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 110 = .xix. Que est ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Ct 8,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Admirantes angeli uirginis gloriose excellentiam, que ad tria, scilicet quantum ad uite ingressum, egressum, progressum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 in hoc loco, qui detur d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [omino]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  iure hereditario, ad quem locutus eleuata stetit coram rege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Rep. 6, S. 472 Nr. 45. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 114\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 111 = .xx\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 115\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 112 = .xxi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Rep. 4, S. 229f. Nr. 12: Nicolaus de Byard. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 116\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 113 = .xxii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Rep. 4, S. 230 Nr. 23: Nicolaus de Byard. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 117\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 114 = .xxiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , Rep. 6, S. 465 Nr. 187. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 118\plain \f