\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel: Sermones de tempore (\u8218 \'82Benedictus-Reihe\lquote )
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Adventus\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questio prima. Questio prima est, quis sit ille benedictus, qui sic venit in nomine domini. Respondetur, quod ipse est dei filius, deus verus, deo patri sanctoque et coeterno spiritui coequalis et consubstantialis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Leo papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salua proprietate utriusque substantie \u8230 \'85 suscipitur a maiestate humilitas, a uirtute infirmitas, ab eternitate mortalitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Druck: Bl. b3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 b4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 19; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 130 Quaestio 2).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secunda questio, ex quo Ihesus Christus ille benedictus, qui venit in nomine domini est verus deus et naturalis dei filius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quomodo conueniebat sibi descendere de celo et venire in hunc mundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 studeamus frequenter et maxime in hoc sacro tempore circa eius passionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. b5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 24-Bl. b5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 24). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questio tercia, quare benedictus ille sic venerit in mundum, id est, quare sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (am Rand eingef\u252 \'fcgt) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 incarnatus sit, siue que sit istius causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et singularissime vnionis factus est homo de nouo et consors nostre nature ymmo frater noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. b8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -c1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  drittletzte Zeile; v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 gl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 131 Quaestio 5). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Directorium f\u252 \'fcr die Passionszeit. \endash  11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14320, 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Druck: GW 26406 = BSB-Ink N-97. \endash  Zitatbeleg: (a) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Leo Magnus, Tractatus septem et nonaginta, tract. 21, CCL 138, ed. Antonius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Chavasse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 87 Z. 43-46. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , S. 130-133 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

