\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de adventu
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Adventus. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [Dominica prima]: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 //\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 damnatis propter quod uocatur vermis consciencie mordens et corrodens continue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Is 66,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vermis eorum non morietur et ignis eorum non extinguetur. De illius eciam terribili aduentu habentur Ysaie ii capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Humilitas domini de celo, superbia dyabolum ad inferos traxit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dominica secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pro primo membro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Circa ewangelium presens talis movetur questio sicut dicitur: Erunt signa in sole et luna et stellis, quod clarius potest Ambrosius d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [icere]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sol obscurabitur et luna non dabit lumen suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. Mt 24,29) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sed etiam habeo thesaurum istum in vasis fictilibus, quibus multa plura quam vitreis videntur imminere pericula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Dominica tertia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ecce ego mitto angelum meum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 11,10; Mc 1,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Johannes merito angelus dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quoniam, ut inquit Maximus in sermone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et qui pax transitoria est quoddam vestigium eterne pacis. Ideo ad hereditatem Christi non poterit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 // Textabbruch.}

