\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tres viae diaboli. \endash  Tres gradus humilitatis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem vias tres ostendit dyabolus homini. Prima est superbia, quam ipse ambulauit, sicut dicit Ysaia 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo cecidisti lucifer de caelo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Is 14,12) \u8230 \'85; (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secunda via dyaboli est inobediencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tercia via dyaboli est via desperacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nemo diffidat, nemo veterum conscius premia peccatorum desperet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vbi superhabundauit delictum, suberhabundare consueuit et gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Triplex est humilitas. Prima sufficiens et est, per quam se homo subdit maiori et non prefert se equali. Et ista humilitas est virtutum genitrix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secunda humilitas est humilitas habundans, qua scilicet homo equali se subdit et prefert se minoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Z. 24) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tercia est humilitas superhabundans, scilicet qua homo eciam subdit se minori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Conclusio. Fratres ergo karissimi, uti audistis, quod non pocior via quam ad patriam pergere possumus, qua eciam aduentus Christi ad nos ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pectare ualemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mereamur intrare adiuuante nos Christi humanitate, quam ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pectamus, quomodo eciam isto tempore cum paruulis ambulat. D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [icit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Mar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [cus] 10: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sinite paruulos ue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 nire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mc 10,14).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbelege: (a) Ambrosius Mediolanensis, Expositio evangelii secundum Lucam, 2.33, CCL 14, ed. Marcus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Adriaen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 45 Z. 469f. \endash  (b) Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermones in dom. 6 post Pentecosten; Edition: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 5: Sermones 2, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Rom 1968, S. 211 Z. 8f.}

