\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vincentius Bellovacensis: De novissimo die
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Iudicium novissimum. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erunt signa in sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 21,25). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione ewangelii occurrit dictum beati Gregorii in omelia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodierna dominus ac redemptor noster paratos nos inuenire \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut nos ab eius amore compescat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Z. 7) Lc 21,25-33. \endash  (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Arescentibus hominibus pre timore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 21,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum, quod in his uerbis notatur uel exprimitur magnitudo timoris. Omnibus enim promptum est, quia, quando homo nimio timore percellitur, ab humore sanguinis euacuatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde psalmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnis iniquitas op\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [p]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ilabit os suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 106,42); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sophonias 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tribulabo homines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (So 1,17). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum ad confirmationem thematis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Iudicium extremum valde est timendum propter plura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Primo propter signorum preambulacionem. Unde dicit ewangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Erunt signa in sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Secundo timendum est propter generalem et peremptoriam citacionem, quoniam dominus ipse in jussu et in uoce archangeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (I Thess 4,16) \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Spec. mor. Sp. 781CD) \u8230 \'85 \endash  26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer. \endash  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Tercio timendum est propter iudicis qualitatem seu condicionem, quia fortissimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Spec. mor. Sp. 782CD). \endash  (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quarto timendum est propter assessorum siue ministrorum qualitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quinto timendum est propter exhibicionem insignium passionis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Spec. mor. Sp. 800). \endash  (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sexto timendum est propter diuersitatem accusatorum et testimoniorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Spec. mor. Sp. 795CD). \endash  (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Septimo timendum est propter considerationem reddende racionis et hoc multipliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 I\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tem memoria iudicii conseruat hominem in penitentia et corroborat hominem, ne cadat. De abbate Sysoi, qui, cum instaret migratio eius, conuenerunt ad eum patres et subito facies eius quodam fulgore radians\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic timor dei est, qui nocentes corrigit, fugat crimina, innocentiam struat, perpetem tribuit facultatem, quam nobis concedat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Druck: Vincentius Bellovacensis, Speculum morale. Douai 1624, Sp. 781CD. \endash  Zitatbeleg: (a) Gregorius Magnus, Homiliae in evangelia, lib. 1, homilia 1, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 CCL 141, ed. Raymond \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Etaix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 , \u167 \'a7 1, S. 5 Z. 1-3.}

