\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in Lc 2,21
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Neujahr (Circumcisio). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Uocatum est nomen eius Ihesus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 2,21\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ). Pro introductione sciendum, quod ante incarnationem Christi nomen dei erat ignotum. Iuxta illud psalmus 45\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vere tu es deus absconditus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Is 45,15), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed hodie manifestatum est nobis nomen illud benedictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa presentem exhortatiunculam notandum, quod illud nomen dulcissimum Ihesus a tribus spiritualiter commendatur, vt recitat Holkot super libro sapientie. Primo quare nomen honoris et excellencie, nomen amoris et beneuolencie, nomen valoris et omnipotencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec est enim aliud nomen sub celo datum hominibus, in quo oporteat nos saluos fieri. Hec Holkot super libro sapientie capitulo 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro nouo faustoque anno assigno omnibus nobis hoc mellifluum nomen Ihesus ad iugiter memorandum, quia, qui hoc fecerit penitenciam, Ihesum acquiret, ut patet Ex 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In omni loco, ubi fuerit memoria nominis mei, veniam ad te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ex 20,24) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si ergo saluari cupimus, ipsum dulciter invocemus, ipsum in memoria retineamus, ut per unctionem suam hoc, quod in futura vita exhibeat, ad quam idem ipse nos perducat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbeleg: (a) Robertus Holkot, Super sapientiam Salomonis, cap. 11, lectio 134, verglichen mit GW 12889 = BSB-Ink H-316, Bl. z5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 7-Bl. z5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

