\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Christianus Stabulensis: Expositio super Librum generationis\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Expositio in evangelium Matthaei)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Iudicium novissimum. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundum Matheum 25 capitulo: In illo tempore cvm venerit filius hominis in sede maiestatis sue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 25,31). \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Multa dixit dominus que in die iudicii fienda sunt, sed quando ipsa dies aut hora esse debeat, non dicit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hoc retinendum, quod is, qui iudicaturus dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 filius hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vocatur, ut sciamus, quia, qui iudicatus est, ipse idem erit iudicaturus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In illo tempore cum intrasset Ihesus Iherosolimam, commota est vniuersa ciuitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 21,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Introitus in Ierusalem quinta die ante pascha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et exspectauit per ipsos dies quousque comprehenderetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 // Textabbruch. \endash  Rest der Seite und 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: (a) CCCM 224, ed. Robert B. C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Huygens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , cap. 25, S. 464 Z. 337-S. 468 Z. 450. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1  (b) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 CCCM 224, cap. 21, S. 386 Z. 182-188.}

