\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Iordanus de Quedlinburgo: Sermo primus in Quadragesima
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Quadragesima. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 18\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ductus est Ihesus in desertum a spiritu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 4,1-2). \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Solent pugnaturi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [s]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 famosorum exempla proponi victorum, ut ex hoc ad pugnam forcius animentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 et sic Christi victoria impedita fuisset. Si enim ille non certasset, iste non vicisset. Deinde de prima parte Ewangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et accedens temptator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 4,3-9). (78 Z. 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec est secunda pars ewangelii, in qua describitur, qualiter temptator est Christum aggressus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde sciendum, quod tria sunt genera temptationum, scilicet concupiscentia carnis, oculorum et superbia vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si tem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tat de appetitu deliciarum carnalium, respondeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Caro et sanguis regnum dei non possidebunt. I Cor 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. I Cor 15,50). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 25) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur tertia pars ewangelii in hiis verbis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tunc reliquit eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 4,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In quibus uerbis duo tanguntur. Primum pertinet ad fugam hostis, secundum ad gloriam triumphantis. Quantum ad primum dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Tunc reliquit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 usque ad tempus secundum Lucam, postea per iudeos eum impugnaturus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sicut ergo Christus ieiunauit et orauit in deserto, sic et nos, si eum recte sequi volumus in desertum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et tunc dyabolum superare poterimus in eius virtute, qui eum vicit et regnat in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW M15120 = BSB-Ink I-610 (online: https://archive.org/details/A335120/mode/2up) (a) Nr. CXLVI \u167 \'a7\u167 \'a7 A-G. \endash  (b) Nr. CXLVII \u167 \'a7\u167 \'a7 A-O. \endash  (c) Nr. CXLVIII \u167 \'a7 A. \endash  (d) Nr. CXLIX \u167 \'a7\u167 \'a7 K-L.}

