\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in passionem domini Iesu Christi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Passio Christi. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 19\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Egressus Ihesus cum discipulis suis trans torrentem Cedron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 18,1).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audistis, karisisimi, in hesterna collacioni, quomodo dominus noster Ihesus Christus cum suis discipulis cenauit, pedes illorum lauit, corpore et sanguine eos pauit, omnium eorum fugam et Petri negacionem eis intimauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde consuetudo erat antiquorum, quoniam non habebant sufficiens testimonium ad condemnandum aliquem, tunc adiurauerunt eum ad dicendum veritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 // Wohl Textabbruch. \endash  87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

