\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in vigilia nativitatis domini Iesu Christi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Vigilia nativitatis. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 20\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Natus est Ihesus, qui vocatur Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 1,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ita scribitur Mathei primo capitulo originaliter, assumitur uero in laudem dominice nativitatis, in presentis collacionis exordio thematisaliter. Venerabiles patres et domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Celebraturi dominice natiuitatis ineffabile sacramentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dominus deus vester\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lv 19,2); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 9) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nimirum siquidem ipse est, qui hodie factus est nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et efficiamur sicut paruulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Merito proinde in testimonium fidei nostre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 interiora autem eius plena sunt dolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 19,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Uerba sunt Bernhardi in sermone in vigilia natiuitatis dominice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Z. 22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De hac vero precipua solennitate dominice vigilie nativitatis contionaturus virisque patres honorandi bibulis auribus qualibuscumque preconiis installaturus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Natus est Iesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Preconia laudesque hodierne festiuitatis dominice videlicet natiuitatis tractaturus melliflui doctoris Bernhardi uerba quasi fundamentum ponendo assumere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa primum, cum dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 natus Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 triplex nobis nostri saluatoris natiuitas consideranda est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85; (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  drittletzte Zeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Circa secundam vero Christi natiuitatem, que facta est ex iure sine patre pertinens ad festum hodiernum considerare possumus infallibilem veritatem dominice incarnacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85; (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Conclusio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ex quo igitur hodie votiuis gaudiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ad Christi germanam societatem pervenire valeamus. Ipso prestante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbelege: Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermones in vigilia nativitatis, sermo 5-6: (a) Sermo 5 \u167 \'a7 1; Edition: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 4: Sermones 1, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Rom 1966, S. 228 Z. 14-17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 . \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (b) Sermo 5 \u167 \'a7 3; Edition: ebd. S. 231 Z. 3-7. \endash  (c) Sermo 6 \u167 \'a7 5; Edition: ebd. S. 238 Z. 1-9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .}

