\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in Mt 15,28
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Quadragesima. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 21\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica reminiscere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mulier, magna est fides tua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 15,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Verba ista Mathei xv\u176 \'b0 capitulo originaliter sunt scripta et in hodierna dominica in officio missali ad laudem et gloriam omnipotentis dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (verblasst) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sunt recitata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Venerabilis Ysidorus libro secundo capitulo secundo de fide ad propositum nostrum sic loquitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sine fide nemo potest placere deo; omne enim quod non est ex fide, peccatum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Secundo notandum, quod fides per dilectionem operam caritatis triplex genus hominum saluum facit, primo videlicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ingredientes aqua baptismali, progredientes gratia penitentiali, egredientes perseuerantia finali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 14) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 dixi tertio, quod fides saluuat egredientes perseuerancia finali, ut homo usque in finem perseueret in fide, unde Mathei 24 scribitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Qui autem perseuerauerit usque in finem, hic saluus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (bis!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 erit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 24,13), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 talis ergo in angustia mortis positus debet clamare ad modum mulieris Chananee ad sanctam dei genitricem, ad populos, ad matres et ad ceteros sanctos ut intercessores habeant, in cuius figura Hester 4a legitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : (in kleinerem Schriftgrad) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In diebus illis dixit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85// wohl Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Zitatbeleg: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Isidorus Hispalensis, Sententiae, lib. 2, cap. 2, sent. 3, in: CCL 111, ed. Pierre \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cazier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 94 Z. 9f.}

