\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pennae probationes
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Nachtrag von N\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Peniteas cito peccato, cum sit miserato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Judex et sunt hec quinque tenendi tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Spes venie cor contritum confessio culpe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non enim in iustificationibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Dn 9,18); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non enim in arcu meo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ps 43,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In similitudinationibus suis omnipotens deus, qui ubi vis spiras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbeleg: (a) Exzerpt aus der Bu\u223 \'dfsumme \u8218 \'82Paeniteas cito\lquote  mit Wortfolgeziffern und Interlinearglossen. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, Nr. 13564; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (mit Supplement) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 3812; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bonaventurae scripta, S. 199 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 223.}

