\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nicolaus de Lyra: Dominica IV in Quadragesima. Sermo 4
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Quadragesima. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ewangelium s. Johanni, vi ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 pitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ].\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica letare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iterum sciendum, quod, postquam Christus pro salute iudeorum et peccatorum multa locutus fuisset de uita spirituali, propter quod iudei multi mutati fuerant contra eum uolentes eum occidere. Et quia adhuc venerat non eius tempus passionis, ideo Christus recessit ad tempus a Iudea et Ierusalem et intrauit terram propriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abiit Ihesus trans mare Gallilee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 6,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hoc eciam exemplum cedendi humane malicie dedit ostendens, quod esset aliquando licitum Christi fidelibus fugere in persecucione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia hic est uerus propheta, qui uenturus est in mundum ad ipsum saluandum sic autem non venerunt alii prophete, sed solum ad ostendendum ipsius aduentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Nicolaus de Lyra, Postilla super epistolas et evangelia quadragesimalia, Dom. 4 in Quadragesima. Expositio litteralis; verglichen mit GW M26580 = BSB-Ink N-108, Bl. n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 [8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -o[3]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

