\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jacobus de Voragine: Dominica III in Quadragesima. Sermo 2
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Quadragesima. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 28\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erat Ihesus eiciens demonium, et illud erat mutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 11,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ita scribitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [Lucae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xi capitulo et leguntur verba proposita in instantis dominice ewangelio. Ecclesia sancta in tribus dominicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 extremissime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 loquitur de dyabolo et de eius temptacionibus. In prima dominica ostenditur, quomodo impugnet sanctos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In tercia vero, que est hodie, ostendit primo, si ab eius domino non fuerint misericordia Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (expung.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 partibusque sanctorum liberati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod spiritus bonus daretur orantibus et hoc quod dixerat sub sequenti miraculo voluit demonstrare, vnde dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erat Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erat Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 loco et capitulo ut supra preallegatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro primo queritur, vtrum demon in uirtute principis demoniorum possit ab aliquo expelli. Vnde sciendum, quod quamdiu mundus stat, semper angeli angelis et demones demonibus presunt, quia cum angeli sint confirmati in bono et demones in malo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de quorum potentatibus et officiis in eodem libro sigillatim dicitur, sed quia non sunt ad propositum causa breuitatis dimittuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 26-132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed tamen mystice per dictos quattuor reges intelligere possumus quattuor demones principales, qui quadruplici vicio totum mundum tenere videntur. Primus demon est Lucifer, qui preest orienti et ipse preest superbie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde incantatores dei sunt ipsi sacerdotes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 confessores,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui serpentem infernalem incantant, quando videlicet super caput peccatoris absolucionem et benediccionem dant et sic patet modus expellendi illos demones et tantum de secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Z. 18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tertium principale est, vtrum recidiuacio in peccatum plus grauet hominem quam peccatum prius commissum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tertio, quia aliquando homo prius peccauit per ignoranciam, sed in recidiuacione non peccavit ignoranter, scilicet scienter et ideo grauius peccavit quam prius et tantum de tercio principali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: (a) Jacobus de Voragine, Sermones in dominicas et ferias Quadragesimae (s.o. 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 73b Z. 9-S. 75a Z. 20; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rep. 3, S. 241 Nr. 232\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

