\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta varia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In Auswahl: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Elemosina secundum Augustinum est res sancta, auget penitenciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ed.: presentia), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 minuit peccata, multiplicat annos, mundat multum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: omnia), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 liberat a pena, iungitur angelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Humilitas non laudibus extollitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non poteris resilire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Volumus esse humiles, sed sine despectu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sine maceracione carnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus de superbia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnia vitia in malefactis tantum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ualent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sola superbia eciam in recte factis cauenda est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 19-22) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde Chrysostomus super Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non propter hoc diuicias accepisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 possessor factus es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vorletzte Zeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nil preciosius tempore, et heu! nichil eo hodie vilius invenitur; transeunt dies salutis, et nemo recogitat de hiis, qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 numquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 redituri sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 f\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et quia dyabolus in isto tempore quadragesimali magis exerce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [a]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t conatus sue temptacionis contra fideles, quam alio tempore adeo supplicandum et orandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Von der Hand des Fridericus Amann wohl auf dem urspr\u252 \'fcnglich frei gebliebenem Bl. nachgetragene Exzerpte. \endash  (a) Sedulius Scotus, Collectaneum miscellaneum, divisio 13, subdivisio 35 (de eleemosyna), excerptum 15, ed. CCCM 67, ed. Dean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Simpson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 121 Z. 30-34. \endash  (b) Liber viridarii consolationis, pars 4, cap. 1, in: Bibliotheca Casinensis. Bd. 4: Cod. 172-246, ed. Luigi \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tosti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Montecassino 1880, S. 263-315, hier S. 282b Z. 18-24. \endash  (c) Prosper Aquitanus, Liber sententiarum, cap. 48, CCL 68A, ed. Massimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ceresa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gastaldo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 269\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1 . \endash  (d) Pharetra, lib. 1, cap. 43, in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Bonaventura, Opera omnia 7, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peltier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 3-231, hier S. 58a Z. 27-34. \endash  (e) Godefridus Altissiodorensis, Declamationes de colloquio Simonis cum Jesu, cap. 44, PL 184, 465C. \endash  (f) Anfang wie Jacobus de Voragine, Dom. 3 in Quadragesima, Sermo 1, in: Sermones in dominicas et ferias Quadragesimae (s.o. 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 71a.}

