\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Conradus de Saxonia (Ps.-Bonaventura): Speculum BMV (lectio 3)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Marienpredigt. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 30\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Orietur stella ex Iacob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Nm 24,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Virga ista est filius dei, qui est stelle matris Marie radius, de quo beatus Bernhardus ayt: Sicut nec siderii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (! recte sideri) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 radius suam minuit claritatem, sicut filius virginis suam minuit integritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: virginitatem) \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Orietur stella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sciendum est, quod virgo Maria stelle comparatur propter tria: primo propter puritatem, secundo propter radiositatem, tertio propter utiltatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed. S. 238b Z. 43-45) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maria illuminatrix, adiuua nos, ut in gloria eterna eternaliter illuminemur, quod omnibus nobis prestare dignetur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Bonaventura, Opera omnia 14, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peltier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 232-292, hier S. 239a Z. 22-S. 241b (Reihenfolge vertauscht).}

