\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in Lc 17,16
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Dom. 13 post trinitatem. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica xiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cecidit in faciem suam ante pedes eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 17,16). \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit Beda in quadam omelia: Timendum est ualde, ne culpa quam in nobis extinctam credimus, per incuriam nos uacantes opprimat. Et ideo semper studendum est nobis bonis uirtutibus, ut nos diabolus non uiciosos scilicet occupatos inueniat, ut dicit Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Semper aliquid facito, ut te dyabolus inueniat occupatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et nos humiliemus et de uirtute in uirtutem eamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Ps 83,8), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut in eterna beatitudine exaltemur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbelege: (a) Beda Venerabilis, In Lucae evangelium expositio, CCL 120, ed. David \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hurst\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , lib. 4 ad Lc 11,24, S. 235 Z. 165-167. \endash  (b) Hieronymus, ep. 125 \u167 \'a7 11, PL 22, 1078.}

