\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in Gal 4,26
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Iudicium novissimum. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 32\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Illa, que sursum est Ierusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gal 4,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit beatus Bernhardus, quod totum tempus presentis uite est nobis concessum ad meritum siue ad merendum, quia nunc tempus misericordie et clemencie, post istud tempus equitatis est et iusticie, quia in futura vita non ualent uobis divicie et honestatis secularitati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte honestates seculares?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sed pura consciencia atque uirtutes, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia dicit beatus Bernhardus, quod ueniet dies illa in extremo examine, in qua plus nobis valent pura corda et corpora quam astuta verba atque facta mala, et conscientia pura et uirtutibus plena quam plena marsupia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  drittletzte Zeile-145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Caueat penitens ne uerecundia ductus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et semper venia carere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 // Wohl Textabbruch. \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbelege: (a) Bernardus Claraevallensis, ep. 1 \u167 \'a7 7, in: Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 7: Epistolae 1: Corpus epistolarum 1-180, rec. Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Rom \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 1974,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 S. 6 Z. 8f. \endash  (b) Ps.-Augustinus, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 De vera et falsa poenitentia ad Christi devotam, cap. 15,31, PL 40, 1125f.}

