\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in Mt 21
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Passio Christi. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 35\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exierunt obuiam ei cum ramis palmarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Cantus 001983). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec dominica dicitur dominica palmarum siue sanctorum, quia in ea recolitur processio, in qua fauemus hebreorum virentibus ramis palmarum Christo venienti Ierusolimam obuiam processerunt vna tunc consuetudo erat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et hec sunt uerba thematis. Exierunt obuiam ut supra. Tria sunt dicenda in hoc sermone. Primo quare obuiare debemus Christo, secundo quid agere et quibus insistere debeamus, tercio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (fehlt) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et uo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [catum est] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 nomen eius Ihesus, quod interpretatur saluator, ipse enim saluum faciet populum suum a peccatis eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 1,21). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Mt 21,1-9.}

