\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jacobus de Voragine: In die sancto Paschae. Sermo secundus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Pascha. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 38\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ihesum queritis Nazarenum, crucifixum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mc 16,6-7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus in hac uita habuit notabilem societatem, scilicet apostolos et quasdam sanctas mulieres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 subiunxit de senibus d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [icens]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aruit tamquam testa virtus mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 21,16)// Textabbruch. \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Jacobus de Voragine, Sermones in dominicas et ferias Quadragesimae (s.o. 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 198b-199b Z. 4; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rep. 3, S. 244 Nr. 288\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

