\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Conradus de Saxonia (Ps.-Bonaventura): Speculum BMV (lectiones 4 et 6)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Marienpredigt. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 39\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Lectio 4 (Paraphrase): \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aue Maria, gracia plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 1,28,42). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad declaracionem huius angelice salutacionis nota primo primum verbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod dicitur quasi sine ve, id est macula, et hoc conuenienter dix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [it]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 virgini gloriose, que totam uitam suam sine macula duxit, ita quod nec corde, ore, opere peccati maculam contraxit, et fuit enim immunis a superbia, quia humilima quia quantumcumque donis celestibus honoraretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 videant ociosi, quorum nec mens nec lingua non magis aliquid boni operantur quam longe fuit a meritis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lectio 6: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundum verbum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 gratia plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quia autem plena gratia fuerit virgo beatissima patet ex priuilegiis sibi specialiter concessis et nulli alteri. Primum quia super omnes homines ab omni peccato fuit purissima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ut insuper propter talem sororem pater et filius et spiritus sanctus nostri in perpetuum miserea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [n]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 tur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Bonaventura, Opera omnia 14, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peltier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : (a) vgl. S. 241b-243b Z. 3. \endash  (b) S. 249b Z. 15-S. 250b Z. 27.}

