\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Marienpredigt. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 41\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sit nomen Ihesus ex quinque litteris componitur ex maximo misterio, sic et nomen dulcissimum Maria. Habet igitur Maria quinque litteras, vt quinque virtutes Marie precipue ostendantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quantum ad secundam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [veritatem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 dico, quod nullum est nomen in creaturis puris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [excellentius].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Ambrosius Spiera, Sermones quadragesimales de floribus sapientiae. Basel 1516 (VD16 A 2218), sermo 39, Bl. CCLXXXI F-CCLXXXII B (Anfang).}

