\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Corona BMV (cap. 2)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Marienpredigt. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 42\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mulier amicta sole, et luna sub hec mulier \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. Apc 12,1), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt iam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (? Papier besch\u228 \'e4digt) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tactum est, est virgo Maria. Modo de hoc nomine Maria, de quo Luce primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [capitulo dicitur]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et nomen virginis Maria erit dicendum, pro quo sciendum, quod quinque mala incurrit genus humanum per lapsum primi hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et auxiliatricem habere mereamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 19) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Istud nomen Maria eciam componitur ex quinque litteris, quia ipsa figurata est per quinque dominas veteris testamenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecclesia\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sticus xxiiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 I\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n habitatione sancta co\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ram]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ipso ministraui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 24,14). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde Albertus Magnus dicit, quod Maria nomen Eue mutauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic patet, qualiter mutauit nomen Eue et merito vocata est Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Istud nomen Maria eciam componitur ex quinque litteris designantibus in beata virgine virtutes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 perfecciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et sic in teipso experieris quam merito dictum sit nomen eius Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Verglichen mit GW 7574 = BSB-Ink C-540: (a) fol. I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 9. \endash  (b) fol. II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 10-45. \endash  (c) fol. III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 4-25. \endash  (d) fol. II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  letzte Zeile-III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 4.}

