\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 Tier- und Steinallegorie auf die Kloster\u228 \'e4mter
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Neujahr (Circumcisio). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 44\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pro fausto felicique anno distribuendo nota sequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  De praelato. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Primo prelato do arietem, qui est dux gregis et ouium. Sic prelatus debet esse dux nostrum, qui eius subditi sumus attendendo, presidendo et bone uite exemplo precedendo. Iterum natura fecit arietem fortissimum secundum Ysidorum, vnde dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ueruex a viribus eo, quod ipse tamquam vir ouium, sit ceteris bidentibus virtuosior, uel dicitur ueruex sicut idem dicit eo, quod vermem portat in capite, cuius pruritu sepe fortissime caput mouet. Dicitur autem aries, quia hoc animal ym\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [m]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 olatur, sicut presens in lege Moysi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  Rest der Seite leer. \endash  (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) De abbate. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Cetus suos catulos miro modo dicitur fauere nam miro modo eos diligit et in pelago longo tempore circumducit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quos serenitate facta sine aliqua lesione emittit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . (Z. 11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sic prelatus debet habere subditos in corde siue intra viscera eos diligendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) De priore. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Domino priore do ceruam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) De sacerdote. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sacerdotibus do carbunculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Juuenibus in sacris do lapidem magnetem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) De novitio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nouiciis do camelum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) De converso. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Conuersis do dromedarium, quia veloces sunt ad currendum, ideo eciam castrantur in juuentute, ut aptiores sunt ad currendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 hoc est obsequia, labores, seruicia, alia nichilominus caritatis officia, si a nobis uoluntarie fuerunt inpensa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Zitatbelege: (a)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Isidorus Hispalensis, Etymologiarum libri XX, lib. 12, cap. 1 \u167 \'a7 10, PL 82, Sp. 425C-426A. \endash  (b) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Bartholomaeus Anglicus, De proprietatibus rerum, lib. 13, cap. 26; Druck: N\u252 \'fcrnberg: Johann Koberger, 1519 = VD16 B 523, Bl. [o vi]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  letzte Zeile-p i\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8  Z. 9.}

