\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in Lc 1,28
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Marienpredigt. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 48\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ave gratia plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 1,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reverende pater ceterique domini me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  preelecti. Uerba proposita vestris diuinacionibus scribuntur Luce primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [capitulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et leguntur in officio misse hodierno. Beatus Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Super missus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodie reuelatum est consilium, quo mors occideretur, quo originale peccatum tolleretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec est principium et causa aliarum festiuitatum, in qua exordium nostre redempcionis sumpsit inicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 19-221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde dicit Fulgencius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Attendite, fratres, medicinalis gracie lineas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut uitam reddendam hominibus nunciaretur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aue gratia plena. Capitulo et loco preallegato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte praeallegatis). \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hac dulcissima salutacione tres dulcissime sententie ordinantur, in quibus laudes dulcissime virginis insinuantur, scilicet quam purissima fuerit beata virgo Maria propter culpe carenciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnesque oremus, ut ipsa propter suum dulcissimum aue nos liberare dignetur ab omni ve. Et tantum de primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quantum ad secundum videlicet de eius gratie plenitudine. Notandum, quod virgo benedicta tripliciter fuit plena gratie, scilicet gratia virtutis et sanctitatis, gratia salutis et dignitatis et plena effluencia omnis pietatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et subdit tecum, manet tecum, perseuerat in te, numquam recedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 // Wohl Textabbruch. \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbelege: (a) Bruno Signiensis, Sententiae, lib. 5, cap. 4, PL 165, 1029AB. \endash  (b) Fulgentius Ruspensis, Sermo 2 \u167 \'a7 7, PL 65, 728D. \endash  (c) Conradus de Saxonia: Speculum BMV, lectio 1-2, in: Bonaventura, Opera omnia 14, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peltier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 234a Z. 12-237b. \endash  (d) Nicht identifiziert.}

