\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in I Cor 11,28
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Eucharistia. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 49\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Probet autem se ipsum homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Cor 11,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Verba hec proposita perorauit sancta mater ecclesia in epistola officii misse festiuitatis hodierne et habuntur originaliter prima ad Corinthios xi. Reuerende pater uenerabiles quoque patres et domini sinceriter diligendi. Transiturus de mundo ad patrem salvator noster, dominus Ihesus Christus, tempore passionis sue instante, sumpta hac sacratissima cena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 10-15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De quo beatus Augustinus ait hec verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O misterium ineffabile et pre ceteris intellectui difficile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 neque siciant in eternum. In hoc eciam magnifico sacramento dominus et saluator velamen atque figuram veteris testamenti reuelando transitorium vetus testamentum in nouum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad quam post transitum maris rubri, hoc est huius seculi, nos omnes perducat hospes huius cene dominus noster Ihesus Christus in secula seculorum benedictus Amen. Anno l\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 mo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (quinquagesimo) cas (?). \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbeleg: (a) Ps.-Augustinus, Speculum, cap. 19, PL 40, 977.}

