\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jordanus de Quedlinburgo: Meditationes de passione Christi. Prologus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Eucharistia. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 50\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inspice et fac secundum exemplar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ex 25,40). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Venerande pater ceterique domini et mei dilectissimi. Si Christus vbique in scriptura mons dicatur\plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ratione summitatis sue excellentissime perfeccionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nam sicut dicit Jeronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Singula ea, que circa dominum in passione sua gesta sunt, nobis mistica offerunt sacramenta. Hec enim sunt, que inspicere debemus et secundum exemplar eorum facere. Inspice igitur et fac secundum exemplar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ex 25,40), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que sunt uerba uestris reuerenciis a principio preposita et uerba nostri saluatoris, qui est benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. Anno li in cena domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: verglichen mit GW M15902 = BSB-Ink I-609, Bl. a i\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -a iii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  drittletzte Zeile. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\u252 \'fcller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 3, Nr. 5141\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Nr. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 646\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . 293-298\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Distelbrink, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bonaventurae scripta Nr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . 229 S. 204; Thomas H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bestul\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Texts of the passion. Latin devotional literature and Medieval society. Philadelphia 1996 (University of Pennsylvania Press middle ages series), S. 191 Nr. 31.}

