\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Bibeltext Io 14,1-14. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 51\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alchuinus super Iohannem. Ne mortem tamquam homines timerent et ideo turbarentur, consolatur eciam eos, deum se esse contestans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non credis, quia ego in patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 1,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cur inseparabiles separatatim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte separatim) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 desideras nosse? Deinde non ad solum Phi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 lippum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]// Textabbruch. \endash  234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 100, 932A-933C.}

