\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in III Rg 6,23,27
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In die Philippi et Iacobi apostolorum (1.5.) \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 52\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fecit Salomon duos angelos, id est Cherubim de lignis oliuarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. III Rg 6,23,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tercii regum sexto capitulo originaliter, recitative in presentis sermonis exordio thematisaliter et ad laudem omnipotentis dei sanctissimorumque apostolorum Philippi et Jacobi commendacionem nostram, deinde instructionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 7-15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione thematis occurrit in presenti scriptura Rabani sicud premissa uerba dicens, quod Cherubim sicut propheta Ezechiel aperte declarat, angelice dignitatis uocabulum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 ne umquam ab amore dei arescant, uncte sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Z. 28) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Karissimi, in deductione thematis audistis, quod sancti apostoli angelis sanctis componuntur in quattuor, de quibus in presenti dicam, ne vestras suspendam caritates breuiter. Primo ratione officii, nam sicut per angelos diuina omnipotentia tam in celo quam in terra et in purgatorio operatur sue beneplacita uoluntatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 credibile est quousque videatur oculis ad oculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 // Textabbruch. \endash  237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbeleg: (a) Beda Venerabilis, De templo Salomonis, cap. 13, PL 91, 764A.}

