\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo in Mt 18,28 (Predigtfragment)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Dom. 22 post pentecosten. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 54\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Redde quod debes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 18,28). \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hoc euangelio duo possunt notari. Primo dei magna misericordia, quam deus habet super peccatores vsque ad diem judicii, secundo eius iustitia post diem judicii bonis et malis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo eius misericordia patet in seruo illo nequam ostenso tria inclinant deum ad misericordiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tertius. Diabolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [obieciens nobis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quecumque fecimus, recitans et in qua hora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [et in q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 uo loco peccavimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]. \endash  244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 M\u246 \'f6glicherweise Predigt des Peregrinus de Oppeln. \endash  Zitatbelege: (a) Anfang wie \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Rep. 4, S. 556 Nr. 101 = Peregrinus de Oppeln, Sermo in dominicam 22 post pentecosten (Druck: GW M30913 = BSB-Ink P-186, Bl. P2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -P2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 4). \endash  (b) Parallelen zu Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, StiftsB, CC 70, 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , dort ebenfalls Peregrinus zugewiesen.}

