\pard\fi0\li0\qc\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II (Bl. 245-319)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis I
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prepositus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [in] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 visitatione b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [eate]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \endash  Factum est ut audivit salutationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 1,41). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hystorialiter, ut dicit Hugo de Sancto Vic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [tore]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 In diebus illis, quando angelus Gabriel peracto dei nuntio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ut probatur prouerbia 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Apprehenderunt fusum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Prv 31,19). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica 18 prepositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diliges dominum deum tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 22,37). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sicut dicit magister in historia scolastica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tunc Ihesus, cum intrauit Iherusalem in die palmarum, querebant eum interficere nec enim potuerunt eum in aliqua reprehendere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nisi verbali dileccione diligat proximum, quicquam verbalem dileccionem dicit Gregorius in epistola, que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (unleserlich). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In dedicatione ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 doct\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [oris] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Preslau\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ensis] (Breslau).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Terribilis est locus iste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 28,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quadruplex est domus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 corporalis, scilicet corpus beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spiritualis, scilicet anima cuiuslibet fidelis uel hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 materialis, quasi dominus inhabitat per sacramenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eternalis, quasi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [dominus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inhabitat per eternam gloriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De prima domo canit ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domus pudici pectoris templum repente sit dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut debemus recolere extremum iudicium quasi sicut fulgur ab oriente in occidentem dicitur descendere sic veniet filius hominis in oriente iudicare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!, recte iudicaturus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Bartolomeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erat tota die docens in templo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 19,47). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione nota exposicionem g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [lossae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 super i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [llud]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 canticorum 4 in capitulo 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi ecclesia dicit ad deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Trahe me post te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ct 1,3) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et cum pecoribus septem mensibus manducaretur fenum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [tholomeus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 conuertit, regit palmum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (?). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Assumptio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego mater pulchre dilectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 24,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amor quadruplex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 corporalis inter virum et uxorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 filialis inter patrem et filium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 socialis inter socium et socium, quandoque sunt mali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spiritualis inter deum et animam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quattuor proprietates matris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 generantes, curantes, nutrientes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vigilate, quia nescitis qua hora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 24,42). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione nota quamuis hec verba in generali dicit ad omnes homines, ut custodiant eorum vitam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia tua bona falsificantur, aurum tuum falsum venum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Clm 14127, 311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6: vinum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mixtum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hystoriam uide etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pie etiam tradit et tenet sancta mater ecclesia eam cum corpore et anima fore assumptam propter nonnullas beati Augustini et aliorum doctorum probabiles raciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 post ipsius felicem resolucionem statim uel paulo post integre premiacionis brauio in celestibus coronari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Multiplicate sunt aque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b (Gn 7,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Venerabilis in Christo pater ac domine gratiose ceterique domini mei predilecti. Quoniam circa presentis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sacratissimi temporis solennitatem ad perficiendum pietatis exercicia et salutis opera nos hortatur deuotissimus Bernhardus in hec uerba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vigilate, fratres, vigilate, ne uos infructuose pertranseat huius temporis solennitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermo in feria quarta hebdomadae sanctae, PL 183, 263A) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et semper virginem Mariam recurramus eam salutando et dicendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Aue Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Multiplicate sunt aque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Gn 7,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Loco et capitulo prealligato. Reuerendissimi in Christo patres ac domini merito venerandi, quia gloriose virginis assumpcio, quo admodum et gloriam nobis extitit sic incomprehensibilis, sic admirabilis et sic inexplicabili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 s \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et ideo merito fuit in altissimis sublimata et ad dexteram filii sui in vita eterna collocata, ad quam nos perducat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 1444\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , durchgestrichen, dar\u252 \'fcber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 56\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 de assumptione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 56\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: (Nr. 3) vgl. Clm 14127, 313\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -314\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ; (Nr. 4) Clm 14127, 309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -310\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ; (Nr. 6) Clm 14127, 310\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 -311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .}

