\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones in assumptione BMV
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de assumptione Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regina Saba ingressa est Ierusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (III Rg 10,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Venerabiles patres et domini, nectarea suauitate gloriose virginis iocundati, quia hodie sacrosancta mater ecclesia preclara recolit ac veneratur festiuitatem, in qua domina mundi, regina celi ac genitricis vite a regionibus huius lacrimose vallis ad aulam etheream gloria cum ineffabili sublimatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 informet ipsam eandem virginem cum tota mentis fiducia pro impetranda gratia angelico oraculo, supliciter salutemus voce pia mente serena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [aria] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ratia] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [lena]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Regina Saba ingressa est Ierusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (III Rg 10,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Loco et capitulo quibus supra. Venerabiles in Christo p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [atres] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et domini et cetera, licet verbum istud pro themate assumptum litteraliter de regina Saba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (durchgestrichen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 austri dictum sit, terrestrem ianuam introeunte, mistice tamen et conuenientissime transsumitur hodie de regina glorie celeste Ierusalem ingrediente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 11-267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  Z. 4) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Richardus de Furnivalle, De vetula:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 O virgo felix, o virgo significata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Grata sit nobis et mete nescia vita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Chevalier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  31147); (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 huius sancti cenobii prelatum dignissimum una cum omni congregatione in obsequium dei inibi ag\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8\cf1 [g]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 regatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitatbeleg: (a) Pseudo-Ovidius De vetula. Untersuchungen und Text, ed. Paul \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klopsch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leiden u.a. 1967 (Mittellateinische Studien und Texte 2), S. 277f. v. 772-805, 809-811.}

