\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 269\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis II
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (269\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Veni de Libano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ct 4,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ita scribitur Cantico 4 et assummuntur verba ista pro themate ad laudem et gloriam omnipotentis dei et sue dulcissime genitricis, cuius hodie assumpcionem celebramus. Ayt utiqe beatus Jeronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nulli dubium est, quin \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (am Rand eingef\u252 \'fcgt)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  totum ad gloriam et laudem dei pertineat, quitquid \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!, recte quicquid) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 digne genitrici sue impensum fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Paschasius Radbertus, De assumptione sanctae Mariae virginis, CCCM 56C, ed. Albert \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ripberger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 119 Z. 200-202\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 introduciturque collocatur ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ext\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [e]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ram eique, ubi interpellat pro peccantibus et omnibus eam deuote inuocantibus, quod etiam nobis prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beato Sancto Laurencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dispersit, dedit pauperibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II Cor 9,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica die lectum est in ewangelio, quomodo dominus loquebatur de arboribus prauis atque bonis, qualiter arbor mala fructus bonos facere non posset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic coram regi per martirii palmas et ipse adeptus, ad quam nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nachtrag von N\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -274a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 16 = Schaltzettel Nr. 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die palmarum. Secundum Lucam 19 capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [llo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [empore]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum appropinquasset Ihesus Ierusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 19,41-47). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sex ponuntur aduersitates in hoc ewangelio. Prima obsessio ciuitatis per Titum et Vespasianum facta, quia Romani neque pacem habere uolebant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia credentes fideles ante obsidionem monitu, an Ierusalem exierunt ad regnum Herodis Agrippe, qui fuit confederatus romanis, ibi saluati fuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Von N\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (274a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17-20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In templo vendit, qui hoc, quod iure tenetur, pro premio largitur. Iusticiam vendit, qui hanc per premii acceptationem obseruat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Von N\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (274b) Schaltzettel 9: (274b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gregorius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8278 ? (Verweisungszeichen?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia vero redemptor noster predicacionis verba nec indignis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nam subditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et erat quotidie docens in templo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  (Lc 19,47) (Thomas de Aquino, Catena aurea in Lc 19, lectio 6). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Von N\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (274b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Karissimi, cum aliter membra Christi fieri non possumus, nisi inherendo deo et compaciendo proximo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicebat eciam se nullum pondus sensisse nec mirum, quia ipsum portabat, a quo portabatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Gregorius Magnus, Homiliae in evangelia, lib. 2, hom. 39, CCL 141, ed. Raymond \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u201 \'c9taix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 390f. Z. 267-300). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic patet quantum fraterna compassio valeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica decem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum appropinquaret Ihesus Ierusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 19,41). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit beatus Augustinus in libro de doctrina christiana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si sciemus et perpendemus, per quam paruum peccatum anima nostra tam grauiter vulneretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 superans me semper habiturum et numquam moriturum et hec dicere miseriabiliter exspirauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica undecim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus propicius esto mihi peccatori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 18,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit Ysidorus in libro de summo bono, quod ipsa penitentia est medicina vulneris et spes salutis, per quam ipse anime a peccatis sanantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Isidorus Hispalensis, De ecclesiasticis officiis, lib. 2, cap. 17, CCL 113, ed. Clare \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lawson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 80 Z. 12-15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 tunc deus vult te exaudire et donare gratiam suam in sempiternum, quod et nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.}

