\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -291\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Sermones de sanctis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die nativitatis Marie per doctorem minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecclesiasticus 43\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vas admirabile est opus excelsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 43,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In quibus uerbis designatur virgo gloriosa. In quibus notandum est, ut satis canit ecclesia in libro genesis primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 (Bibelvers stark gek\u252 \'fcrzt und unleserlich), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi tractat de creacione rerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 postquam deus creavit omnia, dixit dominus, vidit deus cuncta que fecerat, et erant u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [alde]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 1,32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ideo bona creata sunt, ne erit defectus in creacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Predicator de t\u1249 ?u\u7749 ?ka\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Decem uiri leprosi occurrerunt ad Ihesum dicentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Preceptor, miserere nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 17,12-13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In quibus verbis duo inmittuntur. Primum id est ipsius peccatoris proclamacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 significata per lepre fetitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte foeditatem), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum culpe detestacionis humilis resignacio per diuinam pietatem, id est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ihesu preceptor, miserere nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Michaelis prepositus Mt 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Angeli eorum semper vident faciem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 18,10) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione Hugo de s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [tore] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 in suo Didas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [calicon], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 li. 5, c. 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 I\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n diuinis eloquiis non solum voces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed res habent etiam aliqa significare, nam philosophus per voces solam aliquam significat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. PL 176, 790C) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica 17 per doctorem minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Accesserunt pharisei ad Ihesum et interrogant eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Mt 16,1; 19,3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ntroductione?],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod in ve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [tere] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 le\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ge] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 erant tres secte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 una pharisei, secunda zaducei, tertia esai\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?, dt. Essener, Essaier), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quelibet societas habebat specialem regulam. Primi erant separati in vita ab aliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica 18 prepositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diliges dominum deum tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 22,37). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione illorum verborum Augustinus in libro de penitentia et in decretali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (unleserlich) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec est flebile, quia si totam legem seruat et unam soluit, totam soluit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Decretum Gratiani, De poen. D.2 c.40 \u167 \'a7 4, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sp. 1205 Z. 4f., ferner D.5 c.8, ed. ebd. Sp. 1242 Z. 10f.; vgl. auch Iac 2,10) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Multi sunt vocati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 22,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prepositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \endash  Pro introductione illorum verborum assumo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 doctrinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ethii] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 in quarto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [libro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 de con\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [solatione philosophiae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 et de malo homine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nullus bonus dubitat, quisquis habeat retribucionem. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sicut igitur probis probitas, premium i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 psa] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fit ita improbis malicia sua premium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte supplicium) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Boethius, Philosophiae consolatio, lib. 4, prosa 3 \u167 \'a7 12, CCL 94, ed. Ludwig \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bieler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 71 Z. 31-33\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Multi sunt vocati, ubi supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 22,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In his\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [verbis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 duo inmittuntur breuissime. Primo premittitur diuini amoris plenitudo, invitatorum copiositate per verbum patenter predicatum, ut audiatur a multis, id est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 multi vocati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die omnium sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [manos] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 8. Prepositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scimus quoniam diligentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rm 8,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione aliquorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [verborum]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad Ro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [manos]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 L\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 berabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 servitute\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ruptionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ] (Rm 8,21) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 christianos liberari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (unleserlich). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 S\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i deus pro nobis, quis contra nos?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rm 8,31), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominus pro nobis existat, ubi uerbis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Filio suo non pepercit et nobis omnia donauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rm 8,32) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scimus ut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [supra] (Rm 8,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Primo premittitur profectum magnifice caritatis, que est indicium seu materia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 virtuosa pro eorum transformacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Schwer lesbare Predigten (ohne Angabe des Textschlusses) von der Hand des Hermann P\u246 \'f6tzlinger.}

