\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas Ebendorfer: Sermones in nativitate BMV
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beati qui custodiunt vias meas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 8,32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Venerabilis pater ac ceteri domini mei amantissimi. Ex quo nobis adhuc in ista via peregrinantibus precipit dominus per prophetam, quod ipsum laudemus in sanctis suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 peto angelica implorare salutacione dicentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aue gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beati qui custodiunt vias meas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 8,32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Loco et capitulo preallegatis. Et quia vie alicuius conuenienter vocantur eius conuersacio et vita et habitudo ad se et ad alios\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed a periculis cunctis liberat, ut sibi semper deuote seruientes eam collaudare mereamur cum filio suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1454 de nativitate Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: Alois \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haidinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Franz \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lackner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Thomas Ebendorfer \endash  Predigtzyklen. Sermones de evangeliis de sanctis. Wien 1991, Nr. SAEV 035 (online-Ressource: https://manuscripta.at/serm/th_eb/saev.htm). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rep. 1350-1500, Nr. 367\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .}

