\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -313\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermones de sanctis tempore hiemali
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta Katherina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Egredietur puella decora nimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 24,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione nota, quamuis laus virginis ex pluribus trahitur, tamen specialiter Tho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [mas] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 laudem Katharine ex nativitate et condicione nominis, Remigius nomen a notamine dicitu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 nomen significat proprietatem rei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \lquote  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 illud spiritus sanctus formauit, et dixit ad dictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Quia ex sapientia a domino deo est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. Sir 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Legendam vide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (298\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Relictis retibus secuti sunt eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 4,20, 22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro introductione Matheus describit in presenti historia vocacionem quattuor apostolorum, Petri, Andree, fratrum Johannis, et Jacobi maioris etiam fratrum, et tangit preparacionem animi conuertendi ad deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 ut veram veritatem inferret et iusticiam mundi confunderet. Legendam vide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ancto] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Nicolao\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Euge, serue bone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Lc 19,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pro introductione nota doctrinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Augustini in libro de vita communi clericorum et in c. nolo 12 qu. 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vere sit, inquit, nolo, fratres, ut aliquis occasionem malefaciendi a nobis sumat. Juxta illud Pauli ad Romanos xii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Non solum prouidentes de fama\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. Rm 12,17) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Seneca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Eque turpe est et laudari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ob] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 turpia et laudari a turpibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hic laudat eum in potestate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sermonis sermone primo de sancto Nicolao\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 (302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 De concepcione Sancte Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ascendit fons in terram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Gn 2,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hic terra sumitur pro homine, non pro elemento. In uerbis istis duo tanguntur. Primo virginis Marie primordialis originacio admiranda, qua demonstratur super cursum nature generalis propagata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 sed in contraria sanctificacione essentia fomitis est ablata originale et omnia mala\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (306\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die nativitatis domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Impleti sunt dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 2,6-7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et legitur hodie in prima missa. Pro introductione nota lectio prima in sermone hodierne festiuitatis dicit: Hodie natalis dies est redemptoris, gaudeamus, non est hodie locus tristicie, ex quo nata est leticia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ex quo illa nativitas perpetualiter nos est facta, ideo ipsius non obliuiscamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [ancti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Steffani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Volui congregare filios tuos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (Mt 23,37). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Pro introductione nota historiam Euag\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [r]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ii. In uerbis istis doctrinaliter expositis ad laudem verbi incarnati tam innuuntur. Primo quidem saluatoris verbi incarnati beneficium et benignitas involui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8230 \'85 et illud invidebant pagani, qui cogitabant eum interficere cum disponentibus, quia timuerunt, quod plures conuertentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u220 \'dcberschrift in der Kopfzeile unleserlich. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnes sunt administratorii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hbr 1,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In quibus uerbis Paulus pro commendacione dei largitatis diuine tantum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (unleserlich durch Wasserschaden) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 immensam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dei largitatem et sanctos angelos in nostrum ministerium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 ibidem: Mors illius mors nequissima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 28,25), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vide ibidem Salomonem in prouerbiis 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui custodit os suum, custodit etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Prv 13,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 mas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 2 2e, q 73 ar 1, 2, 3 et 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec Preslauenses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (Nr. 1a) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Thomas von Erfurt, Abhandlung \u252 \'fcber die bedeutsamen Verhaltensweisen der Sprache. Tractatus de modis significandi. Aus dem Lat. \u252 \'fcbers. und eingeleitet von Stephan \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grotz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Amsterdam 1998 (Bochumer Studien zur Philosophie 27), s. cap. I, lb; vgl. cap. III, 3a und IV, 3b f. \endash  (Nr. 3a)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  De vita et moribus clericorum suorum I-II = Sermones 355-356 (s.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Kurz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus, S. 255\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), hier sermo 355, cap. 1; Edition: Sancti Aurelii Augustini Sermones selecti duodeviginti, ed. Cyrille \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lambot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Utrecht u.a. 1950 (Stromata Patristica et Mediaevalia 1), S. 124 Z. 8f.; Druck: PL 39, 1569 Z. 5f.; (Nr. 3b) Vgl. Martinus Bracarensis, Formula vitae honestae, in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Martini episcopi Bracarensis opera omnia. Ed. Claude W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Barlow\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . New Haven 1950 (Papers and monographs of the American Academy in Rome 12), hier S. 244 Z. 36f.; (Nr. 3c) Petrus Lombardus, Commentarium in psalmos, psamus 44, v. 4, ed. PL 191, 439D.}

