\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer au\u223 \'dfer Signatur und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kraus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -Nummer (Bleistift) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 541\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Regula sancti Benedicti
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit proemium in regulam beatissimi patris nostri Benedicti abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Versus Simplicii: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui leui iugo Cristi colla submittere cupis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 manet in eternum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit prologus Sancte regule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [usculta, radiert] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o fili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 precepta magistri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mereamur esse consortes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. Incipiunt capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Capitulatio c. 1-73. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt capitula. Incipit argumentum. R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 egula appellatur ob hoc quod ad obediendum dirigat mores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finit argumentum. Incipit textus \u8230 \'85 Monachorum quatuor esse genera manifestum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 deo protegente peruenies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Regula Sancti Benedicti Abbatis et facienti haec uita erit aeterna. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  Rest der Seite und 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: CSEL 75, ed. Rudolf \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hanslik \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 1977), S. XIX (Eingangsverse), S. 1-181 (Haupttext).}

