\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Hieronymus: Regula monachorum ad Eustochium sacram deo virginem
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Distinctio capitulorum Regule beati Jeronimi prespiteri ad sacras virgines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Kapitelverzeichnis: 1-41: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De caritate et unitate seruanda \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 De auctoritate episcopi et prepositi circa obseruationem ordinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ordo viuendi deo eximii doctoris Jeronimi prespiteri ad Eustochium sacratam virginem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 centum eam virginibus ibidem prefecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Praefatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tepescens in membris procliuum corpus ad terram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 penitere non possit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit prologus. De caritate et vnitate seruanda ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [pitulum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quis autem in monasterio constitutis sororibus primus sit arripiendus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 senectutem deuoti uestri Jeronimi sanctis vestris iuuate oracionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit Regula beati Jeronimi presbyteri ad Eustochium virginem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 30, 391-426. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lambert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , BHM 3B, 560; CPPM 2B, 3663. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung aus St. Emmeram: Clm 14578.}

