\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt viginti passus sancti Bonauenture de informatione spiritualis vite ac virtute et profectu religiosorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si uis in spiritu proficere et hoc esse propter quod ut hoc fieres ad scholam virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nec ullam ei reuerenciam exhiberi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finiunt viginti passus de virtutibus bonorum religiosorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Werk hier Bonaventura zugeschrieben. Ed.: David ab Augusta, De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione secundum triplicem statum incipientium, proficientium et perfectorum libri tres. Quaracchi 1899, Lib. I pars II, S. 36-57; zur handschriftlichen \u220 \'dcberlieferung ebd. S. XX-XXXIV. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventurae scripta, S. 211, Nr. 238; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire Bd. 2, S. 48\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 305cu. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 5676; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Supplement), Nr. 5676.}

