\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dcberschrift: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dns P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [aulus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de lizariis de elec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tione]\u8249 \'8b Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini Amen. Vacante ecclesia. Primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 capitulum constituat procuratorem uel sindicum et iurisdicionem exerceat. de ma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ioritate]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et ob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oedientia] (VI. 1.17)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Item provideat de castris et municionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia raro occuerit et raro fit in concordia. Deo gracias. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus Paulus de Lizariis decretorum doctor eximius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
