\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Anicius Manlius Severinus Boethius: De consolatione philosophiae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titelblatt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 BOETII VIRI CELEBERRIMI DE CONSOLATIONE PHILOSOPHIAE LIBRI QVINQVE. Ne excordem uiuas vitam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anicii Manlii Torquati Seuerini Boetii Ordinarii Patricii uiri ex consulis de Consolatione philosophie liber primus incipit. Metrum primum heroicum elegiacum. Carmina qui quondam studio florente peregi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prosa prima primi libri. Haec dum mecum tacitus ipse reputarem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (prosa sexta quinti libri) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cuncta cernentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Librorum quinque Boetii de consolatione Philosophiae. Finis. Laus Deo opt. Max.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Text der Hs. mit den Zwischen\u252 \'fcberschriften zu den Prosae (wie u.a. in der K\u246 \'f6lner Ausgabe GW 4556= BSB-Ink B-608 ). Ed.: CSEL 67.}

