\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Regulae collegii Germanici et Ungarici Romae fundati
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titelblatt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regvlae collegii Germanici et Vngarici Romae fundati a Gregorio XIII felicis recordationis sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mi] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pont\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ificis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nunc vero descriptae ad instantiam R.P. Ignatii Trauner Ordinis S. Benedicti ad S. Emmeranum [!] Ratisbonae professi et pro tempore Novitiorum Magistri a D. Bernardo Heidenrico Wendt Monasteriensi eiusdem Collegii Alumno ad perpetuam sui memoriam Anno 1662 1 Augusti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Via mandatorum Dei facilis ex consideratione praemiorum caelestium. Pensa fili bonum fructum laborum celerem finem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non habetis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Regeln 1-31: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regvlae commvnes collegii germanici. Principio intelligant omnes Collegium in eum finem erectum esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut Curiae praxin \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 addiscat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen: (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Formula promissionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Causae ob quas aliquis dimitti debet ex Collegio Germanico iuxta Bullam Gregorii XIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in collegio non tollat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Abdruck (ohne die Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ): Literaturzeitung f\u252 \'fcr die katholische Geistlichkeit 39 (1827), S. 193-202.}

