\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Praecepta de moribus et pietate
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et bene morati, et veri Christiani hominis est mane simul experrectus sit in Deum se animo et cogitatione convertere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diligenter vobis ministravi, amabo, ignoscite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Kapitelfolge: (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De gestu motuque corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de vestitu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de incessu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de colloquiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de sumendo cibo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Verhaltensregeln im Alltag f\u252 \'fcr die Alumni des Collegium Germanicum.}

