\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes de Friburgo: Manuale super Summam Confessorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Prologus super \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tabulam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si complete non inueneris omnia in manuali, que tanguntur in hac tabula, aduerte illa complecius posita in summa confessorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abbas. Vtrum vnus abbas possit presidere in diuersis monasteriis, li. i, ti. vii. De apostatis, q. xxv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Explicit Tabula super Manuale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cvm Summa confessorum penitentiarios specialiter dirigens ob sui magnitudinem notabiles in comparando requirat expensas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Rubrikenverzeichnis B\u252 \'fccher 1-4. \endash  (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus fratris Johannis lectoris in summa confessorum. Saluti animarum et proximorum vtilitati secundum ordinis mei professionem fraterna caritate semper proficere cupiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubricellas, que adiuncte sunt, suis principalibus titulis subponendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. [a2]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -[a3]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 9) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus fratris Johannis lectoris in priorem libellum questionum casualium. Quoniam dubiorum noua cottidie difficultas emergit casuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de hiis vera leccione libelli melius quam uerbis lector poterit informari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. [a2]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Rest der Seite leer. \endash  (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 1: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipit Manuale collectum breuiter de Summa Confessorum. \u182 \'b6De Symonia. Titulus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sy\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 monia secundum theologos et juristas diffinitur, quod est studiosa voluntas emendi vel vendendi aliquid spirituale vel annexum spirituali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 2: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Explicit prima pars. Incipit secunda pars huius opusculi. \u182 \'b6De homicidio. Titulus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dictum est in prima parte de quibusdam criminibus que principaliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 3: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Explicit secunda pars. Incipit tercia pars de qualitate ordinandorum. Titulus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In ista tercia parte agitur de clericis et ordinacionibus et quales debeant esse ordinandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 4: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipit tractatus de matrimonio. Quarta pars huius summe. Capitulum de sponsalibus. Titulus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa materiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (expungiert) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tractatum de matrimonio primo uidendum est de sponsalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec pro memoriali ad presens sufficiant de matrimonio. Cetera vide in Summa Confessorum et alibi, prout secundum casus propositos vtile vel necessarium iudicabis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De regulis iuris: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Propter materie generalitatem et vtilitatem et cetera. Eciam hic in fine iudicaui de sexto totum titulum de regulis iuris annectendum. \u182 \'b6Bonifatius viii. \u182 \'b6Beneficium ecclesiasticum non potest licite sine institucione canonica obtineri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 certum est, quod is committit in legem, qui legis verba complectens, contra legis nititur voluntatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Spalte sowie 302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: (Prolog) verglichen mit GW \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 M13587 = BSB-Ink I-565; Confessionale ungedruckt. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schulte, GQ\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1  2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , S. 422, Nr. 7 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dietterle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Summae confessorum (wie oben), zum Text S. 258, Nr. VI; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes, S. 49f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores Nr. 2343 (Prolog \u8218 \'82Quoniam dubiorum\lquote ), 2344 (Prolog \u8218 \'82Saluti animarum\lquote ), jeweils ohne diese Hs.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  1245, 4938, 5256 (jeweils ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hamm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Entstehungsgeschichte (wie oben), hier S. 41f. Nr. 5 sowie Anm. 25 (handschriftl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung, ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., in: \u178 \'b2VL 4 (1983), Sp. 605-611, hier Sp. 607f. Nr. II c), Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge \u178 \'b2VL 11 (2004), Sp. 771; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (Supplement), Nr. 5256 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

