\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Titelblatt
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tabula super Raymundum. Incipit tabula super summam Raymundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Fragmente
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gregorius decimus in generali concilio Lugdunensi de usuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quamquam usurarii manifesti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI. 5.5.2). \endash  (II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Casus reservati. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isti casus de iure pertinent ad episcopum vel maiorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primus est de sollempni penitencia imponenda vel absoluenda, is habetur di. l\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , In capite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Decretum Gratiani, D. 50, c. 64). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundus est de excommunicacione a canone, Extra De sentencia excommunicationis, c. Peruenit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.39.17) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de aliquo enormi re intercederet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

