\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas de Aquino: Utrum quilibet sacerdos possit subditum suum ab excommunicatione absolvere
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg ausradierter Besitzeintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber est ordinis fratrum predicatorum concessus fratri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Name unleserlich) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eiusdem ordinis ad usum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Queritur, utrum quilibet sacerdos possit subditum suum ab excommunicacione absoluere. Dicendum, quod a minori excommunicatione quilibet potest absolvere, qui potest absoluere a peccato participationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 septimus, si transfert se clericus ad actum penitus contrarium, ut si fiat miles uel ad bigamiam transeat. Thomas in quarto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
