\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Johanne ewangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Origines dicit: Tantum de illo hausta facto de peccatore saluatoris, nobis tradidit quantum humana natura capere poterit cum tanta secreta et profunditate intelligencie atque altissima nostre fidei misteria et multa in tam breui uoce complexus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hoc est deum filium in deo patre pronuncciat inquiens: In principio erat verbum et verbum erat apud deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 1,1). \endash  199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus dicit: Crede in expertus loquor multos sub peste nimie familiaritatis mulierum cecidisse repperi, de quorum casu non magis suspicabar, quam Ambrosii, Jeronimi impudica turpitudine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. PL 49, 1147B). \endash  Rest der Seite leer.}

