\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes de Turrecremata: Expositio in regulam sancti Benedicti
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini nostri Ihesu Christi sequitur regula beatissimi patris nostri Benedicti vna cum explanacione domini Iohannis cardinalis sancti Sixti pape de Turre Cremata ordinis predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus in regulam sancti Benedicti abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ausculta, o filj, precepta magistri etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Commentarius: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctus pater Benedictus premittit hunc prologum tamquam clauem tocius operis, in quo hortatur discipulum ad audiendum doctrinam suam. Est enim auditus potissima via ad disciplinam spiritualem, ut dicit Bernardus in libro de amore dei: Inter omnes sensus auditus maxime euocat animam ad opus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non autem omnia, que continentur in regula, cadunt sub precepto, ut supra dictum est, sed sunt quedam admoniciones siue consilia, quedam constituciones siue statua, ut post completorium nemo loquatur, huiusmodi non vim precepti, sed est veniale et finit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Druck: S. 38a-52a, Z. 22). \endash  (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [pitulu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 m 1. De generibus monachorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Monachorum quattuor esse genera manifestum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Commentarius: (ebd., letzte Zeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Completo prologo sequitur tractatus, in quo sanctus pater Benedictus describit genera monachorum, dicit ergo quatuor esse genera monachorum, quorum duo optima sunt, duo vero pessima sunt. Primum ergo genus est cenobitale, hoc est monasteriale. Cenon enim grece, commune dicitur latine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl Druck, Bl. 54a). \endash  (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cap. 2; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 3; (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 4; (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 5; (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 6; (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 7; (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 8; (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 9; (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 10; (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 11; (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 12; (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 13; (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 14; (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 15; (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 16; (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 17; (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 18; (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 19; (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 20; (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 21; (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 22; (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 23; (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 24; (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 25; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 26; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 27; (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 28; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 29; (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 30; (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 31; (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 32; (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 33; (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 34; (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 35; (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 36; (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 37; (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 38; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 39; (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 40; (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 41; (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 42; (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 43; (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 44; (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 45; cap. 46; (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 47; (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 48; (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 49; (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 50; cap. 51; (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 52; (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 53; (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 54; (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 55; (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 56; (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 57; (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 58; (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 59; (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 60; (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 61; (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 62; (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 63; (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 64; (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 65; (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 66; (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 67; (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 68; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 69; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 70; (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 71; (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 72. \endash  (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [pitulu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 m vltimum seu lxxiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. Quod) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non omnis obseruacio iusticie sit in hac regula constituta. Descripta iam regula sancte religionis, ne discipulus putaret tantam perfectionem in ea consistere, ut ad perfectionem iusticie et virtutum culmina consequenda nichil amplius esset querendum, curauit sanctus pater Benedictus in hoc capitulo tocius operis hanc opinionem tollere et remouere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 unde sanctus pater Benedictus in principio regule sue dixit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ausculta, o filii, precepta magistri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8219 '\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et admonicionem pii patris libenter excipe et efficaciter comple, ut ad eum per obediencie laborem redeas, a quo per inobediencie desidiam recesseras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit regula sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Druck: S. 288b-290a, Z. 18).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Der in kleinerem Schriftgrad geschriebene Kommentar ist eine gek\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung des Regelkommentars. \endash  Druck: BSB-Ink R-126 = GW M37614; verglichen mit VD16 B 1708. \endash  Lit.: Chrysostomus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gremper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Des Kardinals Johann von Turrecremata Kommentar zur Regel des heiligen Benedikt, in: Studien und Mitteilungen zur Geschichte des Benediktiner-Ordens 45 (1927), S. 223-283, zur handschriftl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung S. 278-282 (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 3, 2723 (Hs. S. 35 genannt); Horacio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Santiago-Otero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Juan de Torquemada. Manuscritos de algunas de sus obras en la Staatsbibliothek de Munich, in: Revista espa\u241 \'f1ola de teologia 32 (1972), S. 453-469, hier S. 459f. Nr. 8.}

