\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De regula sancti Basilii
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regula sancti Basilii patri nostri continet nonaginta quattuor capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Basileus Caesariensis, Epistola de forma honestae vitae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sub illa militant omnes monachi orientales et in eius regula sic legitur, quot panis satisfaciet necessitati, et aqua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [eius quidem]\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui sanus est, siti moderabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut modestia ac sancta continencia seruetur. Electus domini meruit, ut sibi dominus cum apostolis appareret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ebd. Z. 13) De vita, sanctitate atque doctrina Basilii: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic est ille Basilius episcopus Cesariensis, quem ille magnus Ephren lingua ignea disputantem vidit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sicut beatissimus Benedictus occidentalium monachorum est pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1). Druck: BSB-Ink R-126 = GW M37614, Bl. E3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 19-27; VD16 B 1708, S. 586, Z. 1-5. \endash  (Nr. 2) Druck: BSB-Ink R-126 = GW M37614, Bl. A1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 31-40; VD16 B 1708, S. 536, Z. 34-45.}

