\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quidam homo religiosus desiderauit a deo scire, quidquid esset ei beneplacitum in omnibus operibus suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 septimo deus semper manere in pace et amore vero ab intrinseco motu et vexacione Ihesu Christi, domini nostri. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 52a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -52f\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
