\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bonaventura: Lignum vitae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fasciculus mirre beati Bernhardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Uerus dei cultor Christi discipulus, qui saluatori omnium pro se crucifixo perfecte configurari desiderat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec et nunc per crucem tuam petimus obtinere ad laudem sanctissimi nominis tui, cui cum patre et spiritu sancto sit omnis gracia, honor, gloria, decus et imperium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch u.d.T.: Fasciculus myrrhe. \endash  Edition: Sancti Bonaventurae opera omnia. Ed. studio et cura PP. Collegii a Sancta Bonaventura. Bd. 8: Opuscula varia ad theologiam mysticam et res Ordinis Fratrum Minorum spectantia. Quaracchi 1898, S. CXVIII (diese Hs. mit Sigle Q bezeichnet), S. 68-86. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 2, S. 37-51, bes. S. 42, Nr. 305ak; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventurae scripta, S. 26f. Nr. 21; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mohan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, S. 277; Lidia \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lanza\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Stefano \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Brufani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: CALMA 2 (2008), S. 451-466, hier S. 456 Nr. 41.}

