\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Forma Marie et etas eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beata virgo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [didicit]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ebraice literas adhuc patre eius Yoachim viuente et erat docilis, id est amans doctrinam, laborans, perseuerabat circa sacras scripturas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et post ascensionem domini fuit in domo Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [annis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ewangeliste xxiiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  annis, qui simul computati erunt septuaginta duo anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: VD16 A 2906, Bd. 3, S. 226b, Z. 12-38).}

