\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Augustini de contemptu mundi ad clericos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Audite, fratres karissimi, salutiferam patris nostri doctrinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sibi perhennes reddamus gracias Ihesu Christo domino nostro, qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in secula seculorum. Amen. Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 40, 1215-1218).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 30 Nr. 40;\plain \f3\lang1033\fs20\cf17  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kurz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5/2, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 363 (Hs. genannt).}

