\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod homo debet compati pauperibus. Ad mensam sedes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (expungiert)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  resides sumens epulas pociores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (AH 33, Nr. 227). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Monachus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miles strenuus in omni temptatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 11015; Hs. genannt). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Canonicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Caritatem amans, nulli omnino nocens, iniuriam calcans, veritatem seruans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De senio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnibus horrori sum plus michi seniori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 13304; Hs. genannt). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De duodecim speciebus ebrietatum: Bis sex credatis sunt species ebrietatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 2197; Hs. genannt). \endash  151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -151c\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

