\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De propria voluntate et eius conditionibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capitula in sequentem tractatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de propria voluntate et eius condicionibus ac accionibus et quomodo sit radix tocius moralis materie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De uoluntatis potencia, quam sit liberrima, et de actibus eius ac motu, a quo uel a quibus mouetur et de triplici eius appetitu. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ut autem omnia predicta ad vnum dicta et in hunc paruulum tractatulum sub breuiloquio quantum ad salutis fundamentum requiritur et sufficit, perstringare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tunc scire debet, quiuis precipue, qui vitam emendare cupit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et spiritu sancto vnus est dominus deus, vltima nostra habitudo Ihesus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatulus de propria voluntate et eius condicionibus et quomodo sit radix moralis materie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ungedruckt.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx2700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De gratia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eo, quod sola gracia sufficit ad omnia peccata expellenda et ad uirtutes omnes simul infundendas cum ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego vir, sed puerili sensu, volui, sed non plena et perfecta voluntate emendare enormem ac prope consumptam vitam meam in parte aut et in toto mihi, ut ex me secundum me penitus in emendabilem irrecupabilemque cogitaui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quare conuerte te uero corde ad eam et conuertetur ad te, quod nobis prestare dignetur ipse dominus deus noster Ihesus Christus, dei et Marie virginis filius. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ungedruckt.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De poenitentia et conversione peccatoris
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De penitencia et conuersione peccatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tu dicis intuitu mee fragilitatis et enormitatis ac ad malum prauitatis, per que a sanctorum patrum vita et conuersione inaniter exorbitam innocenciam tempus et vires turpiter viciose perdendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut sic semper inuenitur conuersa ad fontem vitam gracie influentem eterne beatitudinis et auersa sint a termino, a quo a qualibus ei contrario et peccato. Amen Ihesu Christe, domine deus meus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ungedruckt.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quid sit peccatum et quid sit gratia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eo quid sit peccatum et quid sit gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Avdiente necnon et legente me nonnumquam, sed utinam adhuc ad vngwem intelligente a nonnullis peccatum dici nihil esse et secundum alios esse actum debito ordine priuatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deuocio sincera puraque, affeccio, compunccio, contricio, prompta hylaris, quam malorum satisfaccio ac omnium virtutum studiosa exercitacio. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  Kolophon: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scriptum per manus Conradi Awrsperger sub anno domini Millesimo Quadragentesimo vicesimo Sexto et finitum est in vigilia Sancte Margarethe virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (12. Juli 1426). \endash  134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ungedruckt.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ars moriendi (CP-Ars)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prohemium de arte moriendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine sancte et indiuidue trinitatis. Amen. Cum de presentis exilii miseria mortis transitus propter moriendi impericiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vorletzte Zeile) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item sequitur prima particula de laude mortis et sciencia bene moriendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cvm omnium terribilium mors corporis sit terribilissima sicut philosophus in tertio ethicorum ait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 adiuuent te oraciones omnium sacerdotum et leuitarum et omnium ecclesie katholice graduum, ut in pace sit locus et habitatio tua in Ierusalem celesti per eundem Christum dominum nostrum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 2597-261405N; verglichen mit GW 2598 = BSB-Ink A-762, Bl. [a1]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -[a7]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 32. \endash  Lit.: Mary Catharine \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 O'Connor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Art of Dying Well. New York 1942, ND 1966 (Columbia University Studies in English and Comparative Literature 156), S. 11-17, 41-44, 48-60 (zur Verfasserfrage), 72 (Hs. genannt); Rainer\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Rudolf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ars Moriendi. Von der Kunst des heilsamen Lebens und Sterbens. K\u246 \'f6ln u.a. 1957 (Forschungen zur Volkskunde 39), S. 75-78 (Zuweisung an Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel), 135 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , S. 292-295 (h\u228 \'e4lt die Zuweisung an Dinkelspuhel f\u252 \'fcr zweifelhaft)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Jerzy \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wolny\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20  / Mieczys\u322 \'b3aw \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Markowski\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20  / Zdzis\u322 \'b3aw \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kuksewicz,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 Polonica w \u347 \'9credniowiecznych r\u281 \'eakopisach bibliotek monachijskich. Breslau u.a. 1969, S. 105 (diese Hs. mit Zuweisung an \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nicolaus Magni de Iawor); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Scriptores 1, 965\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  1076 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Werner \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Williams\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Krapp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 5 (1985), Sp. 1237-1239, bes. Sp. 1239; Alois \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 6 (1987), Sp. 1048-1059, bes. Sp. 1056; Nigel F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Palmer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ars moriendi und Totentanz: Zur Verbildlichung des Todes im Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalter. Mit einer Bibliographie zur \u8218 \'82Ars moriendi\lquote , in: Tod im Mittelalter, hrsg. von Arno \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Borst\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Konstanz 1993 (Konstanzer Bibliothek 20), S. 313-334, bes. S. 317-321; Karin \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneider\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 9 (1995), Sp. 40-49, bes. Sp. 40f.; Matthias \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Nuding\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Matth\u228 \'e4us von Krakau. Theologe, Politiker, Kirchenreformer in Krakau, Prag und Heidelberg zur Zeit des gro\u223 \'dfen abendl\u228 \'e4ndischen Schismas. T\u252 \'fcbingen 2007 (Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalter und Reformation 38), S. 260; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (Supplement) 1076 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

