\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Besitzeintrag, 14. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Attinet s. Emmerami cenobio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Rest der Seite leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Commentarius in Prisciani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 institutiones grammaticas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (lib. 17-18)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam in ante expositis libris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II.107.23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In superioribus libris docuit primam partem artis grammatice, hoc est scienciam cognoscendi ea, que sunt necessaria ad loquendum grammatice. In hiis libris duobus ultimis intendit docere de secunda parte eiusdem partis. Est igitur intencio partis in hoc opere docere scienciam loquendi grammatice, que secunda pars huius artis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt raciones primi minoris. Incipiunt raciones secundi minoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In superiori libro articularium diccionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (II.210.2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Determinauit superioris partis in libro precedenti de constructione articularium dictionum et pronominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum eciam Attici tam in eis quam in aliis plerisque constructionibus idem seruent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: II.278.9). \endash  Kolophon: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt partis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [secundi] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 minoris raciones. Scriptor letetur hic, in celoque beetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Presto dei palma quoque non degat sine palma. Hoc precor optari mecum semperque rogari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iste raciones sunt magistri Ambrosii quo ad compilacionem.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Bisher nicht identifizierter Kommentar zu Priscians Institutiones grammaticae, lib. 17 und 18, der laut Kolophon von einem \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 magister Ambrosius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  verfasst wurde; kommentierte Textstellen jeweils rot unterstrichen. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bursill-Hall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 154 Nr. 176.142.4; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Medieval Priscian Commentaries (wie oben), S. 123 Nr. 180.}

