\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Rotula de memoria defunctorum monachorum S. Emmerami (a. 1436): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Venerabili in Christo patribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wolffhardus dei et apostolice sedis gratia abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum affectuosis in Christo precibus post huius calamitose uite stadium eterne pacis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Datum quinto kl. Aprilis anno domini millesimo quadringentisimo trigesimo sexto etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (= 28. M\u228 \'e4rz 1436); (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Littera confraternitatis ad monasterium S. Petri in Salzburg (a. 1436): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad. S. Petrum Saltzpurge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wolffhardus diuina miseracione abbas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oraciones in Christo deuotas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam saluatoris omnium clemencia uberius tunc redundat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Datum Ratispone quarto Non. Aprilis anno domini MCCCCXXXVI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= 2. April 1436), darunter Adresse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerendo in Christo patri et domino abbati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Littera confraternitatis ad monasterium in Fulda: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In Fuld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oraciones in Christo deuotas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam saluatoris omnium clemencia uberius tunc redundat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Datum Ratispone kl. Marcij anno etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , darunter Adresse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerendo in Christo patri et domino domino abbati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 monasterii in Fuld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; folgen 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 nachgetragen drei weitere Adressen an den Abt von Ellwangen, den Dekan des Salzburger Domkapitels und den Probst von St. Peter in Berchtesgaden (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wertersgadem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schedula de memoria defunctorum monasterii S. Emmerami et dioecesis Ratisponensis: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cetule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Obierunt in monasterio sancti Emmerami Ratispone ordinis sancti Benedicti et Ratisponensis dyocesis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fideliter petitur intimari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

