\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Leer. II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Leer, bis auf  Titel des 14. Jh.s (Strecker, Handschrift, S. 182): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vita Sancti Christoferi metrice et prosayce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Stark abgeriebener Titel in roter Capitalis rustica.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gualterus Spirensis: Vita et Passio metrica S. Christophori
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Epistola UUaltheri subdiaconi ad collegas Urbis Salinarum directa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (von einer Hand des 19. Jh.s dupliziert:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Titulus hic pene deletus ita erat (?) Epistola Waltheri Subdiaconis ad Collegas urbis Salinarum directa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Inc. epist.: \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Dominis Liutfredo Benzoni et Fridericho una cum c\u281 \'eateris date ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Libellum nostrae modulationis, quem uisendi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aegritudo et infirmitas informavit literas.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Titulum uero libri Scolasticum propter principia placuit uocari. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit p\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 rologus in scolasticum UUaltheri Spirensis aecclesi\u281 \'ea subdiaconi< Soluere nos typic\u281 \'ea scelus est signacula legis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Praefacio ad inuitandum lectorem idonea<. Qu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 id referam, qu\u281 \'ea nemo legit, ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  ... (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ante fauos nostri centauria pasce laboris. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Vita\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : >Incipit primus libellus de studio P\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 oet\u281 \'ea qui et scholasticus< Postquam maternas infantia prima papillas ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit liber VI< At tenebris uelata suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Succinat omnis AMEN. quoniam subit ostia CARMEN\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 abgesetzt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 H\u281 \'eac ypol\u281 \'eauita Uualtherus ab urbe Nemeta pro vice Christophori metrica depinxit amussi cum primum regno successit Tercius \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Otto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Epistola ad Hazecham sanctimonialem urbis Quidilinae simili archen< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Domn\u281 \'ea Hazech\u281 \'ea. Meritorum et generis speculo non obscur\u281 \'ea ... Quia sicut \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nostis, Mater sanctissima, ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod tui magistri gratia extremi pollicis ungue limabat. VALE.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: MGH Poetae 5,1, ed. Karl \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Strecker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1937), S. 1-79, Hs. genannt (Sigle E); BHL 1776.}

