\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de ratione nummorum et ponderum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si uis inuestigare quod \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nummos. libras. solidos. uncias habeat ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et quod (!) centum supererunt, tot erunt.
