\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio (Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung links in r\u246 \'f6mischen, rechts in arabischen Ziffern); \u220 \'dcberschrift (stark verblasst): \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula decretalium de sacramentis ecclesie per totum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hoc opusculum in tres partes diuiditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et primo de decimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Decime ut ait decretum sunt tributa egentium animarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ententia] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 exco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mmunication]is \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum illorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
