\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Notae et quaestiones de iure canonico
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de reconciliatione, (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de virtutibus naturalibus et consuetudinalibus, (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De indulgentiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Casus de pluribus beneficiis, (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Quaestio de esu carnium \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum monachis ex precepto unius superioris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  est interdictus esus carnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Utrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 papa possit dispensare ut religiosus absolvetur a regula per translacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 An papa possit dispensare ut monachus absolvetur a voto per translacionem ad secularem ecclesiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Quaestio de tria substantialia \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [? an] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 persone monastice professe sub pena peccati mortalis tenentur ad tria substantialia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 An clerici seculares teneantur ad officium Marie. Respondetur quod non \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ..., (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod necessarius sit ad salutem restituere alterius famam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anno domini 78\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) De excommunicatione, (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quod illa que continentur in regula non sunt omnia vota vel precepta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De potestate pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Papa habet omnem potestatem secularem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) De appellatione. (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de natura demonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de simonia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de oboedientia, (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de oblationibus, (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de usura, (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de peccato mortale, (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de celebrando, de diabolo, de humilitate, (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de ignorantia, (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de oboedientia, de concubinatu, (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de theophania, (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) de vitiis et virtutibus. \endash  112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer (au\u223 \'dfer Schriftprobe 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u220 \'dcberwiegend kurze Ausz\u252 \'fcge zum kanonischen Recht, nach der sehr nachl\u228 \'e4ssigen Schrift handelt es sich vermutlich um Lesefr\u252 \'fcchte oder Mitschriften aus Unterricht bzw. Studium. Zitiert werden neben Decretum und Dekretalen insbesondere Thomas de Aquino, daneben auch Augustinus, Hostiensis, Hieronymus, Hugo, Regulae ordinum.}

