\f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, quadraginta dies abstinenciam habens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, dormisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, lapides persequentum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fugisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, cum discipulis cenasti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, pedes lauasti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, inter uerba orationis effundens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, irrisus a iudeis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, sputatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, alapis dans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, flagellatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (10\plain \f1\s