n \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, mecum piscari dignare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, concede mihi tecum manducare piscem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, concede mihi tecum gustare mellis saporem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, intra fixam cordis mei ianuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, sero die una Thomas non affuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, ne longa animum eius inmergeret hesitatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine, numquam me sinas dubitare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quia uere empticia sum ancil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 la tua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 is mystice patratis, ascendisti \u8230 \'85;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rahe me, domine, trahe me\u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  domine,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mittens munus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  rex glorie. Domine uirtutum, mitte \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aspersione fe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cvndet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Gebete / Meditation, in denen die weibliche Perspektive besonders deutlich hervortritt; Gebete ohne bekannte Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lutter\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (wie oben)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  S. 167f.}

