\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domine Ihesu Christe \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 adoro te ab angelo annunciatum, deprecor te ut mittere digneris sanctum angelum tuum Michaelem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...,  (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C, adoro te ex spiritu sancto in utero uirginis conceptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 adoro te natum de uirgine, circumcisum sub lege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C, adoro te a Iohanne in Iordane baptizatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C, adoro te a diabolo temptatum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C, adoro te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 spineam coronam ferentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C, uexillum crucis sancte prostrata, adoro, deprecor te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C, adoro te uenturum et iudicaturum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ..., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C, deprecor te ut cum dies exitus anime mee de corpore euenerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D I C, te deprecor ut uultum tuum sanctum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 redemptore mundi.}

