\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In purif\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [icatione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [anctae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ave maria gratia plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... CAO 2217; (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sanctissima corpore castissima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... Anselm v. Canterbury, Oratio LIX, PL 158 Sp. 964B-965A; (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In assumpt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ione]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aue Maria ... per merita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... wie oben, oratio LX, PL 158 Sp. 965A-966B; (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nativitate s. M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ariae]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ave Maria ... dignare me \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... wie oben, oratio LVI, mit Varianten), (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sancta dei genitrix, succurre meis criminibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 speranda prece tue ad eum pro me intercessionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
