\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cantus et orationes (Eucharistie-, Bu\u223 \'df- und Sterbegebete)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad accip\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [iendam]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  euch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [aristiam]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Summe sacerdos et uere pontifex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... (Anselmus Cantuariensis, Oratio XXIX facienda a sacerdote ante missam PL 158, Sp. 921A-925A, stark bearbeitet f\u252 \'fcr weibliche Betende, u.a. (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 non sum digna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 peccatrici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ). (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Conserva; Dixi c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ustodiam]; (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominus illuminatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Miserere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Veni creator.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In ascensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Supplicatio mea ascendat ad te, deus. Intret oratio mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Livres d\rquote heures 1, S. 2. (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oro, domine, per trinam orationem quam in monte oliueti orabas \u8230 \'85 ut exaudias preces quas ego peccatrix effundere presumo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85. \endash  (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Rogo patrem per filium et spiritum sanctum, rogo filium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut fide recta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Respice me, domine, et suscipe sacrificium contriti cordis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Anrufung von Petrus, Paulus, (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Matthaeus, Maria Magdalena, (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Pelagia, Thais); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Da mihi, domine, digne plangere quod erraui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Da mihi in mansuetudine honestvm sermonem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Da mihi, domine, assiduam recordationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Da mihi, domine, considerationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Externi huc aduenimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 AH 51 Nr. 73 Str. 5 (Var.); CAO 7209 (Var.), (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aufer a me, domine, omnem illicitum et incestum amorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Protege me, domine, ab omnibus qui mihi dictis, factis vel consiliis uolunt nocere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Da mihi, domine, in ultima hora exitus mei rectum sensum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oro, domine, pro uniuersa ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oro pro omnibus sub iugo iniquorum laborantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...; (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oro, domine, pro famulabus S::ph\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Sophia]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 H:.lt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Hilt\u8230 \'85] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et pro omnibus familiaritate fraternitate et consanguinitate mihi coniunctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et pro omnibus uiuis et defunctis. Laus patri glorie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 AH 8 Nr. 4 (= PL 131 1009C); (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) CAO 8414a (?); Cantus g00523; (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Te ego, indigna et peccatrix, laudo et adoro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Ps 140,3-4.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;\red146\green208\blue80;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Orationes ad Mariam et Deum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Per triumphum sancte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et per intercessionem tuam sanctam, dei genitrix MARIA, custodiat dominus uenas istas, dentes, maxillas, fauces ab omni dolore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 S. MARIA, ora pro me, ut misericors deus \u8230 \'85 det mihi salutem anime et corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sancta MARIA, mater domini, ora pro nobis ut omnipotens deus det nobis hanc gratiam, ut illum timeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Adtende, domine, et miserere quia peccavi tibi et in hora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sancta MARIA, ora pro domino apostolico et pro pace et unitate ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et specialiter pro ista congregatione et uniuersis ecclesie ordinibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ora, domina, pro regibus, ducibus et comitibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inter hec, dulcissima domina, genitrix dei MARIA, ad te supplex confugio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tu nefandissime et iniquissime confusus recede, ut famula mea que mihi seruiuit et firmam spem in me habuit, me intercedente possit ante faciem dei secura peruenire. Per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

