\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Thomas de Aquino: Orationes
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oracio prima beati Thome de Aquino quasi incipiencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ad te fontem misericordie deus accedo peccator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oracio secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O deus omnipotens omnia sciens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oracio tercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quasi perfectorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Concede michi misericors deus omnia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oracio quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Laudo, glorifico ac benedico te, deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oracio quinta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Te, deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tocius consolacionis inuoco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Zur f\u252 \'fcnfteiligen Sammlung \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 VL 9 Sp. 835. \endash  Druck (1-5): Opera omnia 32, Paris 1879 S. 819. Oratio tertia mit Abweichungen gegen\u252 \'fcber Ystoria sancti Thome de Aquino de Guillaume de Tocco (1323). ed. Claire \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Le\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Brun-Gouanvic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , \u201 \'c9dition critique, introduction et notes. Toronto 1996 (Studies and Texts 127), cap. 29, S. 156, 56-86.}

