\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Speculum amatorum mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Videte quomodo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Eph. 5,15-16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si debite et bene ut oportet miserabilem, flebilem ac dampnabilem cursum sew statum mundi presentis temporis consideremus ... \endash  ... vitam emendando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Wohl eine stark verk\u252 \'fcrzende Bearbeitung des Tractatus de speculo peccatorum, de contemptu mundi.  Druck: Sancti Bernardini Senensis Ordinis Seraphici Minorum Opera Omnia. Venedig 1745, S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . 437- 439.}

