\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 O bone iuuenis, reuolue in animo tuo diligenter quam vana sunt mundi huius delectabilia, quam breues et instabiles sunt excellencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quid prodest tibi alta de trinitate disputare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Enth\u228 \'e4lt u.a. Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus Thomas a Kempis (L.1 c.1, Ed. S. 181 Z. 13-182 Z. 8) und den Meditationes de cognitione humanae conditionis [Bernardi abbatis Claraevallensis?] c. 15, c. 5 PL 184 Sp. 506A, 495A.}

