\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Missae speciales. Formae (lat. u. mittelbairisch)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro suscipiendis hospitibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85 O: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Deus humilium visitator qui nos fraterna visitacione consolaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro exeuntibus per campos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro redeuntibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De coquina egredientibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro ingredientibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b; (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictio prioris uel cellerarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictio absolucionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro minucione fratrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b, (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum aliquis in fraternitate recipitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictio pro itinerantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [quod] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 monachus apostata habitum deponens si reuersus fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ...\u8249 \'8b \endash  (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma professionis hospitum. Ego frater N veniens de alieno monasterio in hoc monasterium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, (238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma conuersorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ich bruder N gelob stetickait vnd bekerung meinemer syten vnd gehorsam nach der regel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Versus Suscipe me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ephach mich herre nach deinem ansprechen vnd ich wirt leben\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 von meiner wartung etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Einige St\u252 \'fccke wiederzufinden bei: Eusebius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Amort\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hrsg.), Vetus disciplina canonicorum regularium et saecularium, Venedig 1747, S. 1072 f.}

