\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  s.o. Einband.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Isidorus Hispalensis: Synonyma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isidorus lectori salutem. Venit nuper ad manus meas quaedam scedula ciceronis quam sinonimam dicunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [an]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [t]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isidori qui nuncupatur Synonima. Anima mea in angustiis est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85-... (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber primus : synonyma : In Christi nomine incipit liber [secundus] soliloquiorum Ysidori spanensis episcopi : :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tu mihi super uita mea ampliaris ad ipsum peruenire mereamur qui uiuit et regit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ds[?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer (Schrift von der Rectoseite durchscheinend). \endash  Die \u220 \'dcberschrift zum Text steht am Schluss des Bandes (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit synonyma beati Isidori episcopi spaniensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 PL 83, 825C-868C; CCSL 111B, 1-147. }

