\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hvmana Gloria est fugienda propter 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sicut in cruce materiali 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Plura sunt vestigia Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quidam seruiunt mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 animalia tantum de aere uiuunt. Sermo de dedicacione: Venit enim filius hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 18,11).
