\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus: Caro mea de luto est, ideo lutosas cogitaciones ab ea habeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps.-Bernhardus Claraevallensis, Meditationes piissimae de cognitione humanae conditionis; Druck: PL 184, 504C); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wersus: Nos vexant triplici certamine tres inimici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 18807); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De confessione nota bene: Sit simplex, humilis, confessio pura, fidelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 29832); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum bonum de confessione: Magister Thomas, cum iam deberet mori, vidit dyabolum stantem ante se \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (Caesarius Heisterbacensis, Dialogus miraculorum, dist. 11, cap. 38; Druck: Caesarii Heisterbacensis Monachi ordinis Cisterciensis Dialogus, Bde. 1-2, ed. Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Strange\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , hier Bd. 2, S. 299f.); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota bene: Melius esset quod triginta viri, qui conspirassent omnes in necem tuam, starent super te eductis cultris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wersus: Hec sunt sanctorum pia nomina munere quorum | Mens afflictorum letatur fine laborum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

