\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Silencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 letifficat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hominem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Psalmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [106,30] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Letati sunt, quia siluerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wersus: Ora, scribe, stude, dormi, lege uel meditare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 20336); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Considera \endash  beneficia dei ut deuotus et gratus \endash  septem lucerne candelabri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (298\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jeronimus: Siue legis siue scribis siue dormis siue vigiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hieronymus, ep. 61 ad Pammachium; Druck: PL 22, 644f.); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gregorius: Quamuis delectatio siue cogitacio quantumlibet immunda mentem non coinquinat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (Ps.-Bernhardus, Vitis mystica; Druck: PL 184, Sp. 674B); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jhesus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Opifex sapientissimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jhesus docet nos cum \endash  leccionis \endash  exercicio \endash  abstinenciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In contemplacione mens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 delectatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jhesus fuit fortis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in adgrediendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jhesus factus est nobis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sapiencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wersus: Sic transformatur cor amantis, in id quod amatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 29553).}

