\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Benedictus de Nursia: Regula
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Registrum super capitula regule sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (querst\u228 \'e4ndig links und rechts) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ordo capitulorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ordo foliorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prefacio in regulam s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qvi leni iugo Cristi colla submittere cupis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Avsculta, o fili, precepta magistri et inclina aurem cordis tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cap. 1-73: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De generibus vel vita monachorum capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Monachorum quatuor esse genera, manifestum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 doctrine virtutumque culmina deo protegente pervenies. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit regula sancti Benedicti legislatoris nostri. Laus deo omnipotenti et gloriosissime matri eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: (Praefatio) Heinrich Suso \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Brechter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Versus Simplicii Casinensis abbatis. Ihre Stellung in der Textgeschichte der Regula Benedicti, in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Revue b\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 50 (1938), S. 89-135, hier S. 91; (Regula) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Benedicti regula, rec. Rudolphus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hanslik\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Wien 1960, Ed. altera emendata 1977 (CSEL 75, 75a).}

