\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas a Kempis: De imitatione Christi (Exz. I)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Lib. 1, cap. 9.1-11: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt quedam excerpta sacre theologie pro informacione obediencie et subieccione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ualde magnum est stare in obediencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et consilium accipere quam dare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 26f.); (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  letzte Zeile) lib. 1, cap. 11.1-22: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De pace acquirenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 30-33); (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1, cap. 12.1-9: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De vtilitate adversitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 34f.); (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1, cap. 13.1-32: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De temptacionibus, qualiter sit resistendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 36-40); (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1, cap. 15.3-14: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De operibus ex caritate factis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 43f.); (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1, cap. 16.1-15: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sufferencia defectuum aliorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 45f.); (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1, cap. 17.1-12: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De monastica vita notabilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 47f.); (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1, cap. 20.6-47: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De amore solitudinis et silencii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; explicit: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 oportet te exinde tribulacionem cordis tollerare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 57-62). \endash  74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Interpolationen, u.a. 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Z. 6-69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  letzte Zeile: lib. 2, cap. 12.54.28-31.68.55.57.59-67.69-70; 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , letzte Zeile-70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 14: lib. 3, cap. 24.2-8. \endash  Edition: De imitatione Christi libri quatuor, ed. Tiburzio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vatikanstadt 1982 (Storia e attualit\u224 \'e0 6).}

