\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Schlitpacher: Summula de continentia regulari
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Summula de continencia regulari magistri Iohannis Schiltpacher\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 monachi ordinis sancti Benedicti. Discerne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [re] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ac noscere, quid in regula s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicti vim habeat precepti et statuti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De prologo. Prologus regule s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicti exhortatorius est sermo multis sacre scripture auctoribus refertus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non semper de singulis sentenciis causa breuitatis particularem faciendo mencionem cuiuslibet reccius sencientis saluo semper iudicio saniori, ne quis mee insultet imperfeccioni. Deo laus et honor in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Melk, StiftsB, Cod. 673, 278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Cod. 959, 182\plain \f1\b\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Cod. 1396, 237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Cod. 1835, p. 7-24.}

