\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bernardus Casinensis: Speculum monachorum (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Pars 1, cap. 10: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questio, vtrum omnia, que continentur in regula sancti Benedicti, sint precepta. Qveritur, an omnia sint precepta, que in beati patris Benedicti regula continentur. Vtrumve nihil in ea precipiatur aut vtrum aliqua sint monita vel consilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 excepto cum per contemptum vertuntur in vsum et consuetudinem. Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 98, Z. 3-122). \endash  (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pars 2, cap. 1-2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item tractatus de reprehensione temere profitencium et male in monasterio viuencium. Nunc pertractanda aggredior, que temere profitentes redarguit et vtilia profitentibus inseruit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde psalmista: Sacrificium laudis honorificabit me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 49,23) (Ed.: S. 123, Z. 9-148). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Extracta sunt hec ex speculo monachorum venerabilis Bernhardi Cassinensis, qui tractatus habetur in Tegernsee. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Clm 18561, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; s.o. Herkunft).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Bernardi I. abbatis Casinensis Speculum monachorum seu quaestio de his, ad quae in professione obligatur monachus, et quae sint in regula, quae habeant vim praecepti, quae mandati et quae consilii, denuo ed. P. Hilarius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Freiburg (Br.) 1901. \endash  Lit.: Hilarius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das speculum monachorum des Abtes Bernhard I. von Cassino, in: Studien und Mitteilungen zur Geschichte des Benediktiner-Ordens und seiner Zweige 22 (1901), S. 32-48, zur handschriftlichen \u220 \'dcberlieferung, S. 32-34 (Hs. genannt S. 33, Anm. 9).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Schlitpacher: Explanatio officii capitularis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit explanacio officii capitularis. Officium capitulare, quod in monasteriis bene institutis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cottidie] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 celebratur, ex antiqua consuetudine beati Benedicti temporibus videtur obseruatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde non leuiter est, negligerent. Hec pauca rogatus memorialiter de officio capitulari annotaui. Ex quibus studiosus poterit occasione accepta plura invenire et meliora cogitare. Sic laus deo et eius genetrici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 18606, 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Melk, StiftsB, Cod. 1396, 278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Cod. 91, 74b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: Franz. Josef \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 8 (1992), Sp. 727-748, hier Sp. 734 (Nr. III), und \u178 \'b2VL 11 (2004), Sp. 1382f. (ohne diese Hs.).}

