\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De quattuor novissimis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit breuis tractatulus de quattuor nouissimis. Scriptum est Ecclesiastici 7\u176 \'b0 capitulo: In omnibus operibus tuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Sir 7,40). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vbi diligenter est notandum, quod sunt quattuor futura, que homo debet meditari, vt non peccet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et peccata vitemus ac bona opera impleamus et tandem perpetuum premium attingamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 463, Nr. 24c; Melk, StiftsB, Cod. 1553, p. 298.}

