\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Martin Str\u246 \'f6ulin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (?): Modus disponendi se ad mortem
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini. Amen. Ego frater N. confiteor tibi, clementissime deus pater, multitudinem, magnitudinem et enormitatem vniuersorum scelerum et peccatorum meorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 vt eam ostendas altissimo deo tempore necessitatis mee vel in futuro iudicio. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kurzfassung des in zwei Rezensionen \u252 \'fcberlieferten Traktats. Verfasser ist vermutlich Martin Str\u246 \'f6ulin (1429-um 1500), seit 1455/56 Kart\u228 \'e4user in St. Margarethental zu (Klein)Basel, 1458-1484 Schaffer, sp\u228 \'e4ter Prokurator (Vikar) ebenda; neben seiner Predigtt\u228 \'e4tigkeit im Basler Konvent kopierte und \u252 \'fcberarbeitete er die von Heinrich Arnoldi von Alfeld (1407-1487) verfasste und von Georg Carpentarii von Brugg (\u8224 \'86 1531) fortgesetzte \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Chronica fundationis domus Cartusiensis in Basilea minori. Zu Str\u246 \'f6ulin vgl. \plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vischer\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stern\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 , S. 305, Anm. 3, 314-316, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 513. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung (Auswahl, Schluss abweichend): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 462, Nr. 18a-b; Augsburg, SuStB, 8\u176 \'b0 Cod. 15, 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; 8\u176 \'b0 Cod. 21, 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 8\u176 \'b0 Cod. ms. 213, 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Cod. 3650, 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck: GW M24927. \endash  Edition: Basler Chroniken 1, hrsg. von der Historischen Gesellschaft in Basel durch Wilhelm \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vischer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Alfred \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stern\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  unter Mitwirkung von Mori[t]z \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Heyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig 1872, S. 510-517, hier S. 514f. (mit dt. \u220 \'dcbersetzung). \endash  Lit.: Rainer\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Rudolf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ars Moriendi. Von der Kunst des heilsamen Lebens und Sterbens. K\u246 \'f6ln u.a. 1957 (Forschungen zur Volkskunde 39), S. 84f. mit Anm. 10 (ohne diese Hs.).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Orationes in hora mortis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Vbi es, o custos hominum? Vbi es, o animarum redemptor? Vbi es, pastor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  [bonus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 parce antequam egrediar, munda me antequam e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [xe]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 am. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  (vgl. PL 83, 843A-844C, Nr. 69-74). \endash  (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec sequens oratio cuilibet christiano, est necessaria in extrema hora mortis. Deus meus, deus meus, misericordia mea, refugium meum, desidero te, ad te confugio, ad te venire festino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  2, S. 463, Nr. 24a; PL 40, 1152). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Alia oratio delicata pro peccatis et in extremis. O domine, pater tocius miseracionis, non possum tibi satisfacere de malis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que coram te miserabiliter perpetraui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2, S. 463, Nr. 24b; vgl. PL 83, 840C-841A, Nr. 58-59).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ars moriendi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sex condiciones considerande cuilibet volenti bene mori. Prima est, quod infirmus moriturus se ab omnibus terrenis auertat et auide se conuertat ad terram promissionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pretactis igitur sex articulis seruatis homo securius de hac lacrimarum valle migrabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2, S. 462, Nr. 18c).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Meditatio cotidiana
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cottidie metitare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 debemus cum affectu et effectu, debemus hec sequencia. Primo passionem Christi vsque ad compassionem. Secundo peccata propria vsque ad contricionem vel dolorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sexto mortem propriam, iudicium extremum penasque inferni. Hec diligenter cogitata et meditata disponunt hominem ad bene moriendum. Wersus: Causa salutis erit iugis meditacio mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicatio vestimentorum liturgicorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exposicio quorundam indumentorum seu vestium, que pertinent ad missam vnacum signis seu caracteribus in canone. Humerale representat pannum, quomodo coram Caypha facies eius fuit velata et eum percutiebant dicentes: Quis est, qui te percussit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ista debet legens missam et audiens eam diligenter perpendere cum deuocione, ideo dicit sacerdos et omnium circumstancium, quorum tibi fides cognita est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Nider: Formicarius (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota religiosus in monasterio reformato constitutus est in statu salutis, si obseruat regulas infra scriptas. Prima si seruat ea, que eciam a seculari homine sub precepto seruanda sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 intendit cooperari fideliter pro loco et tempore. Hec Iohannes Nider in formicario libro primo capitulo tertio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Formicarius de visionibus ac revelationibus rec. Hermannus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 von der Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Helmstedt 1692, lib. 1, cap. 3, S. 55-57.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De passione domini
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum, quod hec decem documenta sequencia sunt vtilia cuilibet homini pro sui ipsius erudicione. Sciendum, quod quilibet Christi fidelis et maxime religiosus precioso Christi sangwine redemptus debet cum minus decem documenta ex passione domini elicere pro sui informacione ac ymitacione Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tamquam tuus verus ymitator quatinus ad tue resurreccionis gaudia feliciter merear pervenire. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Wolfenb\u252 \'fcttel, HAB, Cod. Guelf. 269 Extrav., 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (dort Johannes Gerson zugewiesen).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Anselmus Cantuariensis: Planctus Mariae et Anselmi de passione Christi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur passio d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ostri] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [esu] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hristi], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam beata virgo Maria reuelauit beato Anselmo et de eius compassione, quam habuit tempore passionis filii tui. Prolog: Ascendam in palmam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cantica septimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ct 7,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec verba poterat dicere beatus Anshelmus, qui desiderio magno desiderabat consequi fructus, id est scienciam de Christo passo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatus Anshelmus: Dic mihi, carissima domina, qualiter passio filii tui est incohata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et triginta iudeos pro vno denario vendiderunt, sicut ipsi emerant Cristum pro triginta. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 159, 271D-285B. \endash  Lit.: Hans \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Eggers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 1 (1978), Sp. 374f.; \u178 \'b2VL 12 (2004), Sp. 245f.; Carmen\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Cardelle de Hartmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Lateinische Dialoge. 1200-1400. Literaturhistorische Studie und Repertorium. Leiden/Boston 2007 (Mittellateinische Studien und Texte 37), Kap. 4.5, bes. S. 202-204, R21, S. 369-377 (zu Verfasser und Werk, ohne diese Hs.).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Oratio ad vulnera Christi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus dicit: Quicumque ex toto corde passionem domini meditatur, exinde tres recipiet vtilitates. Prima, quod talis purgatur ab omnibus peccatis suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ac si semper vixisset secundum eius voluntatem et prolongare eius vitam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , letzte Zeile) Gebetsanweisung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Legitur eciam, quod Christus pro redempcione nostra perceperit vulnera quinque milia quadraginta et nonaginta. Quicumque ergo complet omni die quindecim Pater noster et Aue Maria, talis in fine anni sciat se dixisse cuilibet vulneri vnum Pater noster cum salutacione angelica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung der Gebetsanweisung: Clm 20122, Bl. 88 mit kolorierter Druckgraphik (Prov.: Tegernsee); s. Die Anf\u228 \'e4nge der europ\u228 \'e4ischen Druckgraphik. Holzschnitte des 15. Jahrhunderts und ihr Gebrauch = Origins of European Printmaking \u8230 \'85 Katalog zur Ausstellung National Gallery of Art, Washington, 4. September-27. November 2005; Germanisches Nationalmuseum, N\u252 \'fcrnberg, 15. Dezember 2005-19. M\u228 \'e4rz 2006, hrsg. von Peter \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Parshall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Rainer \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schoch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  mit David S. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Areford\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  u.a. N\u252 \'fcrnberg 2005, S. 181f. \endash  Zum fr\u246 \'f6mmigkeitsgeschichtlichen Hintergrund vgl. Thomas \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gez\u228 \'e4hlte Fr\u246 \'f6mmigkeit im sp\u228 \'e4ten Mittelalter, in: Fr\u252 \'fchmittelalterliche Studien 29 (1995), S. 40-71, hier S. 45f.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Birgitta Suecica: Quindecim orationes de passione domini
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oraciones sancte Brigite. Hec infra collecta oraciones et meditaciones sunt sancte Brigite, quas ante crucem et ymaginem Christi cottidie deuote orabat, que ymago adhuc haberetur Rome ad sanctum Paulum et haberetur in magna reuerencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quarto si quis quadraginta annis in peccatis fuisset, dominus vix ei omnia peccata propter hoc wult indulgere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item quocienscumque aliquis dixerit, tociens habet quadraginta dies indulgenciarum: O domine Jhesu Christe, eterna dulcedo te amancium, iubilus excedens omne gaudium et omne desiderium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt post huius vite mee terminum te laudare merear cum omnibus sanctis tuis in eternum. Amen. Pater noster. Aue Maria. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: verglichen mit BSB-Ink B-533 = GW 4363; Revelationes caelestes Seraphicae Matris S. Birgittae Suecae, Sponsae Christi Praeelectae, Ordinis Sponsi Sui SS. Salvatoris Fundatricis, ed. Simon \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\u246 \'f6rmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . M\u252 \'fcnchen 1680, S. 748-750. \endash  Edition: Claes \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gejrot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Fifteen Oes: Latin and Vernacular Versions. With an Edition of the Latin Text, in: The Translation of the Works of St Birgitta of Sweden into the Medieval European Vernaculars, hrsg. von Bridget \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Morris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Veronica \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 O\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \rquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Turnholt 2000 (The Medieval Translator 7), S. 213-238, Edition S. 223-229. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Livres d\rquote heures \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 2, S. 98f. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Haimerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Fr\u246 \'f6mmigkeit, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 74, Anm. 413. \endash  Ulrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Montag\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das Werk der heiligen Birgitta von Schweden in oberdeutscher \u220 \'dcberlieferung. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1968 (MTU 18), S. 25-34.}

