\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schemata et Notae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bonum est nos hic esse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Mt 17,4; Mc 9,4; Lc 9,33), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia homo in religione \endash  Viuit purius, \endash  Quiescit securius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fundamentum religionis sunt hec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Caritas dei et proximi, \endash  Paupertas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 voluntaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus: O qualis est hec vita, in qua nihil sit, quod [timeas] et quod imiteris plurimum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PL 16, 1211B). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Experto crede: quia vita regularis quanto arcior, quanto molestior esse videtur in ingressu, tanto iucundior tantoque lecior in progressu. Wersus: Sit claustralis inops, castus, sobriusque benignus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Melk, StiftsB, Cod. 1917/1, 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 18200). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Martirium sine sangwinis effusione, castitas in iuuentute, hilarius in senectute, abstinencia in habundancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Innsbruck, UuLB, Cod. 541, 150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Weitere Zitate, darunter: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hugo de claustro anime. Secura est assiduitas claustri, quam cura familiaris rei non perturbat, quam non sollicitat accessus hominum. Ibi inter fratres alterius ad alterum diligens habetur custodia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: (Nr. 3) Sancti Bernardi opera ad fidem codicum recensuit Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 8: Epistolae 181-547\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , hier ep. 462, S. 443, Z. 15f.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash  (Nr. 5) Hugo de Folieto, De claustro animae, lib. 1, cap. 4; Druck: PL 176, 1027D.}

