\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De vita, consuetudinibus et officiis in monasterio
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) von Hand des 18. oder fr\u252 \'fchen 19. Jh.s: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex Libris Decretalium, idem circiter quod cod. g. 4. continetur sub tit. Innoc. III de statu Monachorum, III libro X\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex dictis Innocencii pape tercii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum ad monasterium Sublacense et infra. Firmiter inhibuimus, ne quis de cetero monachorum lineis utatur camiseis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 possit licenciam indulgere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Innocentius III. papa, Epistolae, lib. 5, ep. 82; PL 214, 1064D-1066C; X 3.35.6). \endash  (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De prelatis et curam animarum habentibus dicit sanctus Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quis mihi dabit vnum de numero prelatorum, qui non magis evigilet pro euacuendis subditorum suorum mancipiis quam in extirpandis eorum viciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; weitere Zitate: Hugo; (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gregorius; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Magister Heinricus de Gandauo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod isti curati sunt in statu dampnacionis, qui predicare nesciunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam a magis ydoneo posset habere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Henricus Gandavensis, Quodlibeta 13, qu. 14; vgl. Quodlibeta, ed. Alfonsus de Villa Sancta. Paris: Jodocus Badius Ascensius, 1518, Bl. 545\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  G).}

