\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De statu monachali et tribus votivis monasticis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid sit monachus et vnde dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Monachus est persona obedienciam, paupertatem et castitatem sub obseruancia regulari professa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sic ergo nomen monachi solitarius interpretatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 3579, 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Clm 14610, 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De condicione veri monachi dicit Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ille est vere monachus, qui deuocionem tenet in choro, pacienciam in capitulo, disciplinam in omni loco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 humilitate in prosperitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) weitere Zitate: Gregor, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abbas pastor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, Bernardus, Augustinus; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De obediencia non quid sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; Hieronymus. \endash  (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum, quod duodecim sunt abvsiones claustri, quibus tota religio corrumpitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prelatus negligens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 14414). \endash  (ebd. Z. 15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anshelmus in quadam auctoritate sic tangit dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sunt quidam in congregacione fratrum, qui faciunt ad oculum seruicium, quibus claustrum carcer est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 desideria carnis adhuc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [su]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spirant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hermannus de Runa, Sermones festivales, sermo 49, ed. Edmundus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mikkers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , CCL 64, S. 220f., Z. 99-111 (mit Abweichungen und Zus\u228 \'e4tzen).}

