\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Varia nota ad diversa themata spectantia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De discussione sui ipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quisquis desiderat ad cognicionem sui ipsius pervenire, tria debet attendere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; daran zwei Zitate: (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hugo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De humilitate. Bernardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O felix humilitas, que dei ad se trahit clemenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; weiteres Zitat von Augustinus. \endash  (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iterum aliqua de triplici oracione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum, quod sunt quidam, qui orant nullo corde, quidam vero medio corde, quidam vero toto corde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde fieri non potest, vt cum deo aliquando loquatur, qui tacens cum toto mundo fabulatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Malogranatum, cap. 3.3.3, Abschnitt AD. Druck: verglichen mit GW M01844 = BSB-Ink G-15, Bl. R ii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -Riii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota aliqua de morte, ad quam omnes obligamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notandum, quod quadruplex est mors. Est namque mors anime, quam ipsa meruit per peccatum mortale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; daran weitere Zitate: Beda; (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Bernardus; (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ambrosius; Hieronymus; (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Haimo; Augustinus.}

