\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas a Kempis: De imitatione Christi (Exz. II)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Lib. 1, cap. 24: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De iudicio et penis peccatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In omnibus rebus respice finem et qualiter ante destrictum iudicem stabis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed dyaboli laqueos cito incurrit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed. wie oben 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 75-79).}

