\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Guilelmus Peraldus: Summa virtutum ac vitiorum (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Pars 2, tract. 3 (de spe), cap. 5: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De gaudio electorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item notandum, quod gaudium electorum proveniet quasi ex sex partibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o quam gloriosa dicta sunt de te ciuitas dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Guilielmi Peraldi \u8230 \'85 Summae virtutum ac vitiorum tomus I et II. Hac postrema editione \u8230 \'85 studio et opera Rodolphi \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Clutii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . K\u246 \'f6ln 1614, hier Bd. 1, S. 115-117.}

