\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas a Kempis: De imitatione Christi (Exz. III)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Lib. 1, cap. 22: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De consideracione humane miserie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miser es, vbicumque fueris et quocumque te verteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et maiori spirituali profectu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed. wie oben 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 66-69); (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1, cap. 23.4-47: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De meditacione mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O ebetudo et duricia cordis humani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 post mortem feliciter transire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 70-74); (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1, cap. 25: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De feruenti emendacione vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Esto vigilans in dei seruicio ac diligens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quantum tibi ipsi vim intuleris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 80-86); (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 2, cap. 1.1-32: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De interna conuersacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regnum dei intra nos est, dicit dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hominem se ipsum contempnere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lupo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 89-92).}

