\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Bernardus-Claraevallensis: Recordatio
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Recordemur, fratres carissimi, quod solum pro eterna vita seculum relinquimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tanto lacior et iocundior invenitur in progressu, quod nobis prestare dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Bernardus Claraevallensis zugeschrieben. \endash  Augsburg, SuStB, 8\u176 \'b0 Cod. 87, 420\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Berlin, SBB-PK, Theol. lat. qu. 165, 140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Weimar, Herzogin Anna Amalia B, Oct. 52, 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

