\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Johannes de Castello: Spiritualis philosophia (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Cap. 14: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De feruenti emendacione vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Proinde prospiciat eciam homo ipse insimul vnacum hiis in antea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [dictis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et futura sibi pericula imminencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Fortsetzung cap. 14: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De meditacione mortis et contemptu mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dum toto corde circa interiorem molestiam operaris sicque temetipsum lamentaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cap. 15: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De hac, quod vnusquisque respicit se ipsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deinde circumspiciat homo ipse eciam ea, que sibi ad dextrum prosperitatis et a sinistris aduersitatis occurrant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 felix igitur quem bene paratum hora mortis inuenerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch \u252 \'fcberliefert in: Clm 18195, 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Prov. Tegernsee). \endash  Edition: Clemems \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stroick\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Unpublished Theological Writings of Johannes Castellensis. Ottawa 1964 (Publications s\u233 \'e9ri\u233 \'e9es de l'Universit\u233 \'e9 d'Ottawa 73), S. 147-194, hier S. 173-177.}

