\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bonaventura: De profectu religiosorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Lib. 2, cap. 5-7: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qualiter temptacionibus sit resistendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnibus temptacionibus hiis quinque modis resistendum sit. Primus est cogitacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, recte cogitaciones) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inde auertere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt animi sanitatis statum perveniatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 371b-372b, Z. 5); (250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Temptacionibus, in quibus delectacio consisit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 licet tamen plene non consenciamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 370b, Z. 24-S. 371b). \endash  (252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib.1, cap. 2: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De his, qui seipsos involunt in temptaciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Svnt tamen quidam, qui sibimet texunt laqueos temptacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad odium contra proximum et fratrem prouocantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 332a, Z. 32-S. 332b). \endash  (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 1, cap. 4: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De tribus statibus religiosorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatus Bernardus in epistola ad fratres de Monte dei describit tres status religiosorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et per illud ad tercium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 335a-ebd., Z. 37). \endash  (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 1, cap. 37: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De vtilitate aduersitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Instante vero iam tribulacione vel aduersitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vbique et in omnibus institutus sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ed.: S. 356b, Z. 7-357a).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: S. R. E. Cardinalis S. Bonaventurae ex ordine minorum episcopi Albanensis eximii ecclesiae doctoris opera omnia \u8230 \'85 cura et studio Adolphe Charles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peltier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bd. 12. Paris 1868, S. 327-442.}

