\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De septem sacramentis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid sit sacramentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sacramentum est invisibilis gratia et visibilis forma vel est facie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [i] (wohl f\u252 \'fcr speciei),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rei, signi. Et sunt septem sacramenta, scilicet baptismus, confirmacio, penitencia, eukaristia, extrema unccio, ordo et matrimonium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et non ad secundum istum, que volebat, sedem suam locari in sinistra parte celi. Ideo legitur ewangelium in sinistra parte altaris, et non in dextera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

