\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Henricus de Frimaria: De passione domini
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo passionis domini compendiose et lucide compositus per magistrum Heinricum de s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancta] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per vi puncta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [distinctus]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qvia memoria mortis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [in]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cepit in dominica in passione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iuxta illud Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannis]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nemo venit ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Io 14,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod nobis prestare dignetur Ihesus Cristus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14776, 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. 320 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schneyer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rep. 2, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 672 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Nr. 451\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hs. genannt).}

