\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Calendarium ecclesiasticum monasterii S. Emmerami
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Mit den Heiligenfesten: 8.1. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erhardi episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; 28.1. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Karoli imperatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 25.2. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Balpurge virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 21.3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicti abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 9.4. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Marie egipciace\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 22.4. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inuencio corporis s. Dyonysii Parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  6.7. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Goaris confessoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 7.7. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Wilibaldi episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; 11.7. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Memoria s. Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In summis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; 12.7. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Margarete virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b; 13.7. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Heinrici imperatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  22.9. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Emmerami martiris. In summis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; 23.9. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dedicacio ecclesie s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Emmerammi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In summis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; 24.9. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ruperti episcopi et c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [onfessoris]; 7.10. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Translacio b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [eati] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wolfgangi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 13.10. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Colomanni martiris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 31.10. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wolfgangi episcopi. In summis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; 5.11. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Translacio b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [eati] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Emmerammi in Ratisbonam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 7.11. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Octava b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [eati] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wolfgangi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 4.12.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Translacio Dyonysii in Ratisbonam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Eintragungen des Erstbesitzers: 2.3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic sum professus dominica Reminiscere anno 1488\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 6.3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Intraui ordinem feria iii post Inuocauit 1487\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic intraui religionem 1487\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

