\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Bonaventura: Psalterium maius BMV
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit psalterium beatissimi Marie virginis compilatum per seraphicum doctorem sanctum Bonauenturam episcopum Albanensem necnon sancte Romane ecclesie presbyterum cardinalem in specialem honorem eiusdem gloriosissime genitricis saluatoris nostri Ihesu Christi sacrosancte Marie et aduocate nostre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eatus vir, qui diligit nomen tuum Maria virgo, gratia tua animam eius confortabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam nisi quisque fideliter firmiterque crediderit salus esse non poterit. Gloria patri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einschub: [Ps.-Bonaventura: Laus BMV] \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 e matrem dei laudamus. Te Mariam virginem profitemur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Chevalier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Nr. 20157)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Letania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 K\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 irie eleison. Christe eleison. Christe audi nos. Saluator. Pater de celis, deus Marie conditor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nos quoque fragiles ab omnibus instantibus defende periculis. Per Christum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 4648, Bd. 2, Bl. LXXXIIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -XCII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: S. Bonaventurae Opera omnia 10, iussu et auctoritate David\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Fleming\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ed. studio et cura PP. Collegii a s. Bonaventura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Quaracchi 1902, S. 24 Nr. 36; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Distelbrink, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bonaventurae scripta, S. 172 Nr. 185\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

