\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Gerson: Tractatus pro devotis simplicibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus eiusdem venerabilis doctoris Johannis de Gerson cancellarii Parisiensis pro deuotis simplicibus, qualiter se in suis exerciciis discrete et caute habere debent. De gallico in latinum translatus per quendam non quidem de uerbo ad uerbum propter rusticitatem tollendam, sed magis de sensu in sensum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lt ut sit racionabile obsequium nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dummodo nos noluerimus sponte declinare extra eius confidenciam et caritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 DuPin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie unten) 3, Sp. 605-618; Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 7,1, S. 140-142 Nr. 306 (frz.). \u196 \'c4hnliche Titel\u252 \'fcberschrift in BSB-Ink G-184, Teil 3, Bl. tt2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

