\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Excerpta ex secunda parte christianissimi doctoris Johannis de Gerson cancellarii Parisiensis de attencione oracionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De modo psallendi vel orandi beatus Bernhardus talem sentenciam infert: Moneo vos, dilectissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dum non fecit, quod in se est, neque facit vt vitetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 9, S. 451-455 Nr. 455.}

