\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De varia attencione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Est itaque multiplex attencio siue intencionis cordialis direccio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod passionibus sit alienus, qui de moribus iudicat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 2, S. 184-191 Nr. 38.}

