\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex tractatu eiusdem doctoris Johannis de Gerson de mendicitate spirituali, quibus de causis aliquando orationes non exaudiuntur, cuius tractatus compilatus est ab eo per modum dyalogi. Et sunt interlocutores Anima et Homo. Et incipit ipsa dolorose conqueri ac dicere Anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 epe per desiderium magnum clamo ad dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quas perpendis adesse, dum huiusmodi oraciones deuote dicuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 DuPin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie unten) 3, Sp. 495A-503C.}

