\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Excerpta eiusdem doctoris christianissimi Johannis der Gerson de deuocione, quid sit et de pluribus circa eam notabilibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  [Johannes Gerson, Collectorium super Magnificat]: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 euocio est eleuacio mentis in deum per pium et humilem affectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro actibus accipimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 8, S. 301 Z. 28-302 Z. 21 Nr. 418. \endash  (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17) [Thomas de Aquino, Sum. theol.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  II-II\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a], qu. 82 art. 1 co.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et dicitur devocio a deuouendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que pertinent ad dei famulatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  letzte Zeile) [Sum. theol\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 . II-II\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a], qu. 82 art. 3 co., art. 4 co.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De causa autem deuocionis dicit Thomas 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  q. lxxxii ar iii in corpore articuli, quod duplex est causa eius. Vna est intrinseca et principalis et ista est deus, qui quem w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 religiosum facit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per spem diuine subvencionis et auxilii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 3) [Antoninus Florentinus, Summa theologica], lib. 3 tit. 13 cap. 6 \u167 \'a7 10: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Requiritur eciam conuenienter ad ydoneam celebracionem vel communionem eukaristie actualis deuocio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et bibendo sanguinem esse debemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pierozzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie unten) 3, Sp. 620AC; (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 5) tit. 13 cap. 6 \u167 \'a7 11: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Post communionem autem vel missam oportet eciam gracias agere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ne subito diuertat ad fabulas et vanitates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pierozzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie unten) 3, Sp. 621E; (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 13) tit. 13 cap. 4 \u167 \'a7 7: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vtrum autem attencio in horis dicendis sit necessaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que exercentur per actus exteriores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pierozzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie unten) 3, Sp. 583AC; (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 11) tit. 13, cap. 4 \u167 \'a7 8: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De attencione autem orationis dicit Petrus de Pa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lude] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in iiii, dis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tinctione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xv, quod ad oracionem sicut et ad quodlibet aliud opus bonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 circa aliquid incompassibile attencioni oracionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pierozzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie unten) 3, Sp. 584A-585C.}

