\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex titulo xvi tercie partis summe venerabilis Antonini archiepiscopi Florentini de tribus votis essencialibus religionis. Et primo de obediencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 L\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ib. 3 tit. 16 cap. 1 \u167 \'a7 9-11: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rimum votum essenciale religionis est obediencia, cuius transgressio est mortale \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prohibetur autem religiosis viuere seculariter, Extra De reg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ularibus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et tran\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [seuntibus ad religionem] (!, vielm. Ne clerici vel monachi saecularibus negotiis se immisceant), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c. Relatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 3.50.7). Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pierozzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie unten) 3, Sp. 860E-869D. \endash  [Nicolaus de Tudeschis, Lectura in Decretales] (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) X 3.35.6 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus abbas de statu monachorum super C. Cum ad monasterium de proprietate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnc quero pro declaracione littere circa primam partem, quando dicitur monachus habere proprium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nam predicta non sunt de iure approbata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: EDIT16: CNCE 48051, S. 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u167 \'a7 8; (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) X 3.31.5 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem. Quero hic, quia reprobatur peculium in monacho, quid dicatur peculium quo ad hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si habet administracionem alicuius peculii permittente superiore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: ebd. S. 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u167 \'a7 6. \endash  191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

