\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pulcra notabilia ex quarta parte summe venerabilis Antonini de oracione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Lib. 4 tit. 5 cap. 8: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 irca oracionem nota secundum Thomam 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  q. lxxxiii, quod triplex fuit error antiquorum circa oracionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vel incantacionibus vel in breuibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pierozzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie unten) 4, Sp. 198C-208E.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Joannis Gersonii Opera omnia, opera et studio Ludovico Ellies \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 DuPin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Tomus 3. Antwerpen 1706. \endash  Antoninus Florentinus, Summa theologica in quattuor partes distributa, ed. Antonio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pierozzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bde. 1-4. Verona 1740; Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 1, 239 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Fundstellennachweis der Exzerpte aus Thomas de Aquino, Summa theologiae richten sich nach dem Corpus Thomisticum (http://www.corpusthomisticum.org/).}

