\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Virgo verbo concepit, virgo permansit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., CAO 5456; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 W\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ersus]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Post partum virgo inviolata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus, qui per beate Marie virginis partum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., Corpus orationum Nr. 1964.}

