\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anno domini ab incarnacione domini m\u176 \'b0 cc\u176 \'b0 lxviii inuenta sunt hec priuilegia in Bibliotheca seorsum posita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [1.]\plain \f4\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8\cf17  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Privilegium cum sigillo Arnolfi super monarchiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. marcham) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in Schonnawe, quam et contulit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  [2.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item super Vfhusen unum Ludwici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 [83.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item priuilegium Ludwici Pirichinwanch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  [84.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item priuilegium Ludwici super Schoninawa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
