\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Breviarium de dictamine (cap. 1-6)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit Albericus de dictamine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Prolog: \u8250 \'9bA\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 LBERICUS KARISSIMIS IN CHRISTO FRATRIBUS NN, beniuolentie magis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tralis amorem. Quanto cupidinis igne, fratres amantissi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. amantissimi),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  exarserim, quanto desiderio ut cupido uestri desiderii suppleretur exoptauerim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 5) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In presentis igitur participii nominativum commutatio fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 postremo totum illum sibi auri cupido illexit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , s.o. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u167 \'a7\u167 \'a7 I-V, S. 29-33; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bognini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , I.1-VI.68, S. 3-29).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haskins\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Early \u8218 \'82Artes dictandi\u8219 ' (s.o. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Nr. 1, S. 171-173 (Hs. genannt); Repertorium der Artes dictandi 1 (s. Lit.), Nr. 2a, S. 12f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Turcan-Verkerk,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Le \u8218 \'82Prosimetrum\u8219 ' (s. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 161f.; Filippo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bognini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Un\rquote ipotesi per la cronologia del \u8218 \'82Breviarium\u8219 ' di Alberico di Montecassino, in: Filologia mediolatina 11 (2004), S. 265-280 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Turcan-Verkerk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire chronologique (s. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Nr. 6, S. 197f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Felisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Turcan-Verkerk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les \u8218 \'82Artes dictandi\u8219 ' latines (s. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Nr. 3.3, S. 426f.}

