\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 6-92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 25) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Anh\u228 \'e4nge zum \u8218 \'82Breviarium\lquote  (cap. 11-13)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Inusitatae orationes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inusitate orationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [non]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 numquam una uel due nostris inferentur communibus orationibus, quotiens uolemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u167 \'a7 X, S. 41-46; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bognini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , XI.1-52, S. 46-51); (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 21) Vitia orationis (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u167 \'a7 XI, S. 46; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bognini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , XII.1-16, S. 51-53); (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 6) Exhortationes (!, vielm. Exornationes) (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bognini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , XIII.1-12, S. 53-55); (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miramur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bognini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , XIII.14-98, S. 55-66).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: Paul F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gehl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Vat. Ottobonianus lat. 1354. Apropos of Catalogue Notices and the History of Grammatical Pedagogy, in: Revue d'histoire des textes 8 (1978), S. 303-307, hier S. 306f., Anm. 7 (zu 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 18); Repertorium der Artes dictandi 1 (s. Lit.), Nr. 2c, S. 14f.}

