\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 3-98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ars dictandi (cap. 17-21)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Petro et Gregorio reuerendis fratribus Martham et Mariam. Quoniam, dilectissimi fratres, blandis et assiduis precibus me sollicita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [vi]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 stis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 18) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed quoniam de prosa sumus acturi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnes prope alie indifferenter preponi et subponi ualent,vt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8219 '\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 atque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que autem endetice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. autentice) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 postponuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bognini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , XVII.1-XXI.7, S. 77-85).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Weitere Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Anf\u228 \'e4nge (s. 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Anhang I, S. 33-37. \endash  Lit.: Repertorium der Artes dictandi 1 (s. Lit.), Nr. 2f, S. 15f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Felisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Turcan-Verkerk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les \u8218 \'82Artes dictandi\u8219 ' latines (s. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Nr. 3.4, S. 427.}

