\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo passionis dominice compendiose et lucide compositus per magistrum Hainricum de S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancta] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korr. aus: Vrimaria) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per vi puncta distinctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia memoria mortis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [in]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cepit in dominica in passione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iuxta illud Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannis]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nemo venit ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Io 14,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod nobis prestare dignetur Ihesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
