\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de vitiis et virtutibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugo Argentinensis: Compendium theologicae veritatis (Exzerpt)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de viciis et virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tria sunt in anima, scilicet potencie, que sunt innate, habitus acquisiti uel infusi, passiones illate vel innate. Potencia est proximum principium operacionis anime et est subiectum habitus tam boni quam mali \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Cap. II 42, S. 68). \endash  (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De quatuor anime potenciis. Preterea animaduertendum, quod solum in quatuor potenciis seu viribus anime sunt habitus boni vel mali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Cap. II 41, 43, S. 67-69). \endash  (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod sit actus elicitiuus et quod imperativus. Rursus interior actus voluntatis dicitur elicitiuus, exterior autem imperativus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Mit den Abschnitten (jeweils im Seitensteg): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid malum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diffinitio peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 2), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid sit peccatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 3), (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Differentia est inter habitum et actum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De generacione peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 5), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De causa peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De diuisione peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 6), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De affectu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. effectu) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 7), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De penitencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De peccato originali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 8), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De primis motibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 10), (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De peccato veniali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 12), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De peccatis capitalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 14); (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) explicit: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item corrupcio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. privatio) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ordinis est auersio diuine voluntatis a deo et econuersio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. conversio) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ipsum ad creaturam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 7, S. 98a, Z. 3). \endash  (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 9) Johannes Nider, Manuale confessorum, pars 1, cap. 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit dominus Albertus super quarto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [libro],\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [stinctione]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Albertus Magnus, Comm. in IV Sent., dist. 17, art. 60)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod quedam sunt ad bene esse condiciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 confessorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et que mortalia communia et que venialia ex genere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: GW 26879 = BSB-Ink N-158, Bl. aiii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -aiv\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 7).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Wortlaut und \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Reihenfolge der Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften stimmen mit vorliegender Hs. \u252 \'fcberein, w\u228 \'e4hrend die Textabschnitte paraphrasierend wiedergegeben werden. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Edition: Alberti Magni opera omnia. Bd. 34: Compendium theologicae veritatis in septem libros digestum, ed. Auguste \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Borgnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Paris 1895, S. 67b-105a.}

