\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Nider: Consolatorium timoratae conscientiae (Exzerpt)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod duplex est excommunicacio. Notandum vero est, quod duplex est excommunicacio, scilicet a iure et ab homine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De tribus signis optimis bone consciencie. Sunt preterea secundum omnes doctores consolatoria consciencie bone tria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut ex sancto Thoma patuit capitulo precedenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. I 8, Bl. b4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -[b6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota de septem gradibus consciencie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Cap. I 6, Bl. b2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -b3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Signa bone consciencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. I 7, Bl. b4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 4-b5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 24). \endash  (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quinque sunt cause erronee consciencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. II 7, Bl. c5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -[c7]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secuntur quatuor remedia, ne quis per ignoranciam dampnetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. II 8, Bl. [c7]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 14-[c8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einschub: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 J\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ohannes Geiler von Kaysersberg, Sermo de pusillanimitate. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota septem reperiuntur differentes consciencie. Prima consciencia dicitur cauteriata, id est corrupta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec tedium convictus illius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: VD16 G 796, Bl. 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 44-132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Consciencia vergenda est ad similitudinem. Domus materialis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. I 4, Bl. [a9]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -[a10]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tria sunt genera hominum habencium malam conscientiam et quomodo facere possunt, quod in se est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. II 9, Bl. [c8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 25-[c9]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 11). \endash  (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Probatur racionibus quod homini facienti, quod in se est sine negacione, datur omnino gracia a deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. II 10, Bl. [c10]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -d2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota differenciam inter scienciam et conscienciam, opinionem et crudelitatem et scrupulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 1, Bl. d2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 13-d3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 6); (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 18) weitere Exzerpte aus Cap. III 2 (Bl. d3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 7-10), Cap. III 4 (Bl. d5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , letzte Zeile-[d6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 3), Cap. III 6 (Bl. [d9]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 5-[d9]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 14). \endash  (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De singularitate deponenda et quantum absit et noceat impersuasibilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 9, Bl. e5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10-[e6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10). \endash  (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota septem regulas, quas habere debet volentes deponere scrupulosas consciencias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 10, Bl. [e6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 22-[e6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 19); (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 19) weitere Exzerpte aus Cap. III 11 (Bl. [e8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 1f.), (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 3) Cap. III 17 (Bl. [f9]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 13-22), (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 13) Cap. III 18 (Bl. [f10]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10-23), (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 23) Cap. III 20 (Bl. g3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10-21). \endash  (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid dispensacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 22, Bl. [g7]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 32-[g8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 2). \endash  (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 21) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diffinicio et differencia peccati mortalis et venialis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 23, Bl. [g8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , letzte Zeile-[g9]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 9) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quando peccatum sit mortale, ponit Cancellarius 17 regulas. Nota hec est de illis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. III 25, Bl. h2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 30-h3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota in libro, quod dicitur consolatorium timorate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 consciencie fratris Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [annis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nider, sacre theologie professoris, ordinis Predicatorum, ponitur primo istud capitulum de septem fructibus bone consciencie. Primum capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. I 1, Bl. a4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -a5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 24) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod malam conscienciam habenti septem mala ingerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cap. I 2, Bl. a5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -a6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De cognicione proprie fragilitatis, ex qua nascitur domini timor sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; explicit: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vetus est sancti Anthonii sentencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch (Cap. III 3, Bl. d5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 15-d5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10). \endash  177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die Stellenangaben richten sich nach dem Druck GW M26809 = BSB-Ink N-141.}

