\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Centum meditationes dominicae passionis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus in centum meditaciones dominice passionis. Amatorie passionis domini nostri Iesu Christi memoriam agere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Centum meditaciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt centum meditaciones passionis domini nostri Ihesu Christi, quas quilibet deuotus Christi discipulus quottidie aut ad minus qualibet hebdomada debet deuota mente persoluere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Articulus primus. Eja, dei sapiencia, domine Ihesu Christe, in qualemcumque vicissitudinem tue benedictissime passionis meditacio cordis mei representat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eorumque pie compassionis deuocionisque redolencia, Ihesu piissime, delecteris. Amen. Finiunt centum meditaciones dominice passionis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14785, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck: verglichen mit GW M33148 = BSB-Ink P-462, Bl. n6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -p4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

