\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aliae meditationes
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus in sequentes meditaciones. Sequentes meditaciones cum quibusdam internis oraciunculis in fine horarum dicendas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Meditatio post matutinas aut conclusio matutinarum. Domine Ihesu Christe, fili dei viui, qui hora matutina a Iuda tradi et osculari te permisisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jesu passo, Marie quoque sibi compasse, conregnare faciat perenniter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb240\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: verglichen mit GW M33148 = BSB-Ink P-462, Bl. p5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -p8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

