\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Gerson: Opusculum tripartitum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Einleitungsbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola domini Johannis de Gerson ad quendam episcopum super opusculo tripertito plebibus publicando. Reuerende in Christo pater ac domine metuende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 breuitatis moderne amica desidie sec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [t]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ata est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Opusculum tripertitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eiusdem de preceptis decalogi, de confessione et de arte moriendi. Christianitati suus qualiscumque zelator prosperum ad virtutes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum Capitulum: Affirmat mundum a deo fuisse creatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Firmissime credendum est et nullatenus dubitandum, quod solum vnus est deus omnipotens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secunda pars huius opusculi. De confessione. Quisquis a morte peccati ad salutis et gracie statum volet resurgere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 addiciones quedam alie condicionales aut inuolute tucius dimittuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Teil 3 fehlt. \endash  Edition Einleitungsbrief: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 2, S. 72f. Nr. 17; Druck Opuscula: Ioannis Gersonii Opera omnia, ed. Ludovicus Ellies \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 DuPin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 1. Den Haag 1728, S. 425-447; Praefatio auch ediert in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 2, S. 74f. Nr. 18. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\u252 \'fcller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB #, 4491;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  734, 4851; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Supplement) 734.}

