\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bonaventura: Epistola continens viginti quinque memorabilia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Memorabilia generalia sancti Bonauenture. Sunt ergo quedam virtutes probate in iuuenibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod te gracia sua dignum faciet in presenti, secumque potiris gloria in futuro, quod ipse tibi concedat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Daran drei Zitate: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus. Legi et relegi scripturam sacram et non inveni in quinque milibus annorum saluatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod quilibet deberet habere aliquam certam horam et determinatam adorandum siue in die siue in nocte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus. Oracio est coniuncta spiritui sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Sancti Bonaventurae opera omnia. Ed. studio et cura PP. Collegii a Sancta Bonaventura. Bd. 8: Opuscula varia ad theologiam mysticam et res Ordinis Fratrum Minorum spectantia. Quaracchi 1898, S. 493-497. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 2, S. 42, Nr. 305 ac; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventurae scripta, S. 42f. Nr. 42.}

