\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nostra conuersacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Phil 3,20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam qui de terra est, de terra loquitur, ex habundancia enim cordis os loquitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 protinus emisit spiritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 5, S. 383 Nr. 127; GW 4812 = BSB-Ink S-361, Bl. [N2]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -[N3]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).}

