\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Arta est via\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 7,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatus Matheus videns beatum N hodie intrasse ad vitam eternam, ostendit nobis viam, per quam intrauit, vt sequamur vestigia eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt sequamur vestigia eius, vnde beatus N, cuius hodie festa colimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 8, S. 797 Nr. 41; 9, S. 410 Nr. 71; 9, S. 895 Nr. 131).}

