\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Sermo 73B: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eccle 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [0]\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miserere anime tue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 30,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde sciendum, quod sex opera misericordie debemus exhibere anime nostre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item nostra conuersacio in celis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: BSB-Ink H-195, Bl. [q2]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 24-[q2]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10); (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  letzte Zeile) dt. Zitat: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erparm dich deiner sel, da\u223 \'df sie geual got. Eccl. xxx\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 30,24). \endash  (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 12) Sermo 75R: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quamuis deus sit sapientissimus, tantum scienter permittit se decipi in vendicione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .. .\endash  ... vt habetur in Mt 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. 19): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Centuplum accipietis et vitam eternam possidebitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: BSB-Ink H-195, Bl. [q6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 43-[q6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 15).}

