\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo de nativitate BMV
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De virgine gloriosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Descendi in domum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ier 18,3-4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iste figulus deum significat, qui omnes finxit. Ps\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [almus]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui finxit singillatim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 32,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundo hic notatur, scilicet corrupcio Eue et hic ibi \u8218 \'82Et dissipatum est uas\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ier 18,4) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ergo per deuotas oraciones et effundetur tibi gracia quam nobis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 9, S. 489 Nr. 13).}

