\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta ex sermonibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 11) Guilelmus Arvernus, Sermones in epistolas et evangelia. Pars secunda, sermo 94: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tria fercula delicatissima in regno celorum sunt diuinitas et humanitas Christi et societas Marie omniumque sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in malogranato ordinata societas sanctorum. In domo patris mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Io 14,2) (Druck: Guilielmi Alverni episcopi Parisiensis [...] opera omnia. Bd. 2,1. Paris 1674, S. 290b, Z. 64-72). \endash  (Z. 20) Bernardinus Senensis, Commentarius in Apocalypsim s. Joannis, cap. 22: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Apocalipsis vltimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lectura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vltimo describitur superna Jerusalem, quantum ad refeccionem ciuium, que non intelligitur a nobis nisi per similitudinem corporalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia semper manet in sua duracione et nouitate, mensis enim nouitatem designat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Opera omnia. Bd. 5, ed. Joannes \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 De La Haye\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Venedig 1745, S. 114a, Z. 25-114b, Z. 42).}

