\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alius angelus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Apc 14,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Angeli secundum doctrinam sancti Dionysii sunt lumina clarissima specula pura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et post multa mala peccatoribus inflicta, sic vnus angelus clamat: Apoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lypsis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XIX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (V. 17f.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Venite et congregamini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1, S. 656 Nr. 979; Druck: VD16 B 6566, Bl. M i\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 30-Miii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 34).}

