\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas Gallus: De septem gradibus contemplationis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus sancti Bonauenture de septem gradibus contemplacionis. Contemplatiuorum aquilinos obtutus acui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 castissimo amplexu complexa est, dominum nostrum Iesum Christum, qui est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Bonaventura, Opera omnia 12, ed. Adolphe Charles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peltier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Paris 1868, S. 183-186.}

