\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Servasanctus Tuscus de Faenza: Sermo in dominica sexta post Pentecostes (Sermo 92F)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sunt quidam qui viuunt Christo per graciam, sicut membrum viuit in corpore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui contrarium facit filius mortis existit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 5, S. 381 Nr. 92; Druck: GW 4812 = BSB-Ink S-361, Bl. [C7]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 11-30).}

