\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Hieronymus: Sermones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jeronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De natiuitate dominica. Hodie verus sol ortus est mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus factus est homo, vt homo deus fieret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 30, 220B-221B). \endash  (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De epiphania domini: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dies epiphaniorum greco nomine sic vocatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 30, 221C-222D). \endash  (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Quadragesima mos. Qvomodo miles semper exercetur ad prelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 30, 223A-224A). \endash  (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In uigilia pasce mos. Hodie, fratres karissimi, populus Israel et vere homo videns deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 40, 1201f.). \endash  (1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De dominica pasce. Non queo, fratres charissimi, quem mente concepi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 30, 224B-226A).}

