\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Augustinus: Sermones ad fratres in eremo
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 48: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anima humana, fratres charissimi, omnium creaturarum participat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 40, 1328-1330). \endash  (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 50: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De salute anime. Quantum ad anime nostre desiderium pertinet, fratres charissimi, voluntatis nostre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 40, 1334-1336). \endash  (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 2: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De pace. Fratres karissimi, o si sciretis quanta sit virtus pacis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 40, 1237-1239). \endash  (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De silencio. Silencium, fratres charissimi, inter cetera vobis in heremo summe necessarium est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 40, 1239f.). \endash  (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 30: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De confessione. Dicere solent homines, fratres charissimi, deus cuncta nouit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 40, 1288-1290). \endash  (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus. De prudencia. Fratres charissimi, non solum silencium tenere debetis in heremo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (PL 40, 1240-1242).}

