\pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Carmina
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sunt quidam peruersi homines, qui de omni re mundi, quam vident, male judicant. Si quis vacat humilitati, ypocrita est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Bernardinus Senensis, Sermo 24, art. 2, cap. 3; Edition: Opera omnia, ed. Pacificus M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Perantoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Bd. 4. Quaracchi 1956, S. 68, Z. 27-S. 69, Z. 1, mit Abweichungen). \endash  Schlussverse des Gedichts \u8218 \'82Tot video gentes\lquote  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 19326): \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pauper vel diu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [e]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s numquam sine crimine viues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ludolphus de Saxonia: De resurrectione Domini
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exhortacio de die pascali et penthecoste et communiter de omnibus diebus dominicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Psalmus: Hec est dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 124,117). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Magna est solempnitas valde paschalis et ceteras omnes precellit. Vnde omnes dies dominici octaue sunt huius festi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ymmo inter creaturas omnes post filii sui humanitatem. Ita et inter ceteras dies hec omnium mater est. Hec sufficiunt pro presenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vorletzte Zeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hoc tamen dico, quod scient homines negligentes per totum annum dei laudem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gaudebimus et letabimur pariter vna voce cantemus: Hec est dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 124,117). \endash  Daran: [Flaccus Alcuinus, Quaestiones de trinitate et de Genesi, qu. 29] \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo conuenit, quod in Genesi legitur: Requieuit deus septimo die ab omnium operum patrarat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 2,2) \u8230 \'85 (PL 42, 1176).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Exzerpte aus: Vita Christi, Teil 2, cap. 69, teils mit abweichender Reihenfolge. \endash  Druck: verglichen mit GW M1919 = BSB-Ink L-266, Bl. mm 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 17-mm 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 45 (letztes nachweisbares Zitat).}

