\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exempla ex diversis collectionibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum de auaro et invido. Legitur, quod quidem rex concessit cuidam auaro et cuidam invido munus quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ipsi] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eligerent, ita quod prior peteret, altero duplicaretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3983; Edition u.a. VD17 12:135421H, S. 281, Z. 8-12). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum de confessione. Dixit, quod quidam vidit sompnium, quomodo quidam niger quasi Ethiops perforasset cor suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Druck: Paulus Wann, Sermo LX, in: Panarium pastorale, VD16 W 1185, Bl. E[i]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 40-E[i]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 7). \endash  (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum de beata virgine et Salue regina. In Langobardia fratres primitiui circa beatam virginem mira deuocione feruebant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4169; Edition: Heribert Christian \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Scheeben\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Handschriften II, in: Archiv der deutschen Dominikaner 2 (1939), S. 134-221, hier S. 204f.; Jos\u233 \'e9 Mar\u237 \'eda\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Canal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Salve regina misericordiae. Historia y leyendas en torno a esta ant\u237 \'edfona. Rom 1963, S. 313f.). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dyabolus diuersis modis impugnat homines. Quidam, dum iret per viam ad predicandum, occurrit ei dyabolus portans multas pixides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4249; vgl. auch Der gro\u223 \'dfe Seelentrost. Ein niederdeutsches Erbauungsbuch des 14. Jahrhunderts, hrsg. von Margarete \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schmitt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . K\u246 \'f6ln u.a. 1959, S. 76, Nr. 13). \endash  (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum de beata virgine. Quidam frater ordinis Cisterciensis, qui probatus phisicus et nominatus fuerat in seculo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Edition: The Historia occidentalis of Jacques de Vitry. A Critical Edition by John Frederick \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hinnebusch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Freiburg (Schweiz) 1972 (Spicilegium Friburgense 17), S. 114, Z. 21-S. 115, Z. 8). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Igitur quod quidam solitarius cogitabat intra se, vnde esset quod boni tot aduersa paterentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Michaelbeuern, StiftsB, Man. cart. 99, 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum de natiuitate domini. Quidam bonus sacerdos in nativitate domini volens celebrare ad ecclesiam solitariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum de confessione et dyaboli calliditate. Quedam nobilis puella deo deuota ab infancia et post religiosa effecta morabatur circa fratres Padue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Literatur: Index exemplorum. A Handbook of Medieval Religious Tales by Frederic C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Helsinki 1969 (FF communications 204).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Stephanus de Borbone: Tractatus de diversis materiis praedicabilibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum de paciencia quam habere debemus. Quidam sanctus abbas, cum esset excecatus, dicebat: Gracias ago deo meo, qui vindicauit me de aduersario meo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1939; Edition: Nr. 140a, S. 23, Z. 170-174) \endash  (223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Multi dicunt se velle corrigere actus suos. Quidam preco, dum duceret, vt audiui, ad forum sancti Michaelis vaccam et vitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1297; Edition: Nr. 140d, S. 29, Z. 321-336). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De hiis qui multa promittunt. Dicitur de quodam nigromantico, qui habuit discipulum, qui promittebat ei multa bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tubach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3137; Edition: Nr. 154b, S. 127, Z. 1631-1645).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Stephani de Borbone Tractatus de diversis materiis predicabilibus. Prologus. Prima pars de dono timoris, cura et studio Jacques \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Berlioz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Jean-Luc \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Eichenlaub.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Turnhout 2002 (CCCM 124; Exempla medii aevi 1).}

