\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Augustinus: De omnibus virtutibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus ad matrem de caritate. Cum igitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [de] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 plurimis virtutibus te admonere desiderem. Primum cum Paulo apostolo hortor, ut caritatis virtutem ante omnia habere studeas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 argumenta et machinamenta omnia antiqui hostis destruit. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Enthalten sind cap. 1-9, 11, 13-14. \endash  Druck: Sancti Aurelii Augustini \u8230 \'85 sermones inediti, cura et studio Armand-Benjamin \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Caillau\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Paris 1842, Sp. 242a, Z. 52-Sp. 250b, Z. 9.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Introduxit me rex in cellam vinariam
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In refectorio anime sew infirmitorio. Infirmatus est feruor religionis, qui animam febricitantem discalciat operibus mortuis et post hec ponit ipsam in lectum quietis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic moritur mundo facta insensibilis et tunc angeli deducunt eam in paradisum voluptatis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Gerhard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bauer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Claustrum animae. Untersuchungen zur Geschichte der Metapher vom Herzen als Kloster. Bd. 1: Entstehungsgeschichte. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1973, S. 385, Z. 125-S. 387, Z. 146, zum Text und zur handschriftl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung ebd. S. 359-376.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugo de Sancto Caro: Speculum ecclesiae cum speculo sacerdotum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Speculum ecclesie. De numero, ordine et significacione sacerdotalium vestium. Dicit apostolus ad Ephesios vi\u176 \'b0: Induite vos armatura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Eph 6,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec armatura est vestis sacerdotalis significatiua septuplicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 virtutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et optatur hiis requies eterna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 12) Appendix: De horis canonicis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iterum dicit Psalmus: Septies in die laudem dixi tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 118,164), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 propter quod ecclesia constituit septem horas dicendas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que precedit et subsequitur hominem in bonis operibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 S\u246 \'f6lch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 53-55). \endash  (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit speculum sacerdotum volencium celebrare missam. Et primo ante missam habenda sunt tria scilicet intencio: discussio, generalis contricio et pura confessio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui debes esse plenus deo. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Versus: Cum domino psalles, psallendo tu tria serues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O vos sacerdotes dei, vos tangent sermones mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 13074; Ute \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schwab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Die Reimrede der zw\u246 \'f6lf Meister von den Fr\u252 \'fcchten der Messe, in: Annali. Sezione Germanica 6 (1963), S. 13-64, hier S. 14).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: verglichen mit GW n0264 = BSB-Ink H-428; Hugonis a St. Charo tractatus super missam seu speculum ecclesiae, ed. Gisbert \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 S\u246 \'f6lch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . M\u252 \'fcnster 1940 (Opuscula et textus historiam ecclesiae eiusque vitam atque doctrinam illustrantia 9). \endash  Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Messe, S. 474f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 1, S. 48, Nr. 2aw; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Kaeppeli/Panella), Scriptores 2, Nr. 1990, S. 276-280 (S. 278 Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1589; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Supplement) 1589.}

