\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes de Sancto Geminiano: Liber de exemplis ac similitudinibus rerum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De suspicione. Judicium suspiciosum et temerarium procedit quandoque ex corrupcione judicantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sicut apis, que amaros et venenatos succos in mel conuertit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Liber 9, cap. 37. \endash  Druck: verglichen mit GW M14691 = BSB-Ink I-516, Bl. kk1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Petrus Chrysologus: Collectio sermonum (Sermo 59)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Argumentum autem infallibile, quod resurreccio erit quottidie habemus, vnde dicit Petrus Ravennas. Crede te, homo, in morte posse resurgere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tecum quasi moreris et resurgis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 52, 365A). \endash  Daran: Johannes Gerson, De differentia peccatorum venialium et mortalium. Consideratio 24: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecce videtis, quod nichil est securitatis in hac vita, que non est nisi temptacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vel qualis sit in judicio domini sui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Joannis Gersonii \u8230 \'85 Opera Omnia 2, ed. Ludovicus Ellies \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Du Pin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Paris 1706, Sp. 489-504, hier Sp. 502.).}

