\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Thomas de Aquino: Epistola de modo studendi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola sancti Thome de Aquino de modo studendi, adipiscendi scienciam per studium continuum. Quia quesisti a me, qualiter oporteat intendere in thesauris sciencie acquirendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad illud attingere poteris, quod affectas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Pierre \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mandonnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sancti Thomae Aquinatis opuscula omnia 4. Paris 1927, S. 535, Nr. 44. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 1, S. 103 Nr. 14fh.}

