\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Gerson: Opera spiritualia et pastoralia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De arte moriendi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ars moriendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sciencia mortis. Si veraces fidelesque amici cuiuspiam egroti curam diligencius agant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sicut in domo dei Parisius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. Parisiis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 laudabiliter obseruatur. Explicit Tractatus de arte moriendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Joannis Gersonii \u8230 \'85 Opera Omnia 1, ed. Ludovicus Ellies \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Du Pin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Paris 1706, Sp. 447-450. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  5610.}

