\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De arte audiendi confessiones
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de arte audiendi confessiones. Et si virtus quam assuefaccio gignit, cercius quam ars operetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et orando quam legendo erudietur atque proficiet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 8, S. 10-17 Nr. 401. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes, S. 81f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2030; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Supplement) 2030.}

