\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De confessione mollitiei
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus eiusdem doctoris. De confessione molliciei. Qvidam magister in theologia Parisius per experienciam multam et studium diligens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 facinus dignetur radicitus extirpare, qui est benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 8, S. 71-74 Nr. 407. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  4815.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De remediis contra recidivum peccati
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de remediis contra recidiuum peccati secundum exercicium et doctrinam eiusdem magistri Johannis de Gerson. Habet hoc proprium ars quelibet, vt faciliori compendio ad finem ducat optatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que omne desiderium superant sequamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Daran: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Preterea ille circumstancie, que habentur per hunc versum inquirende sunt in confessione: Quis, quid, vbi, quibus auxiliis, cur, quomodo, quando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 16103; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 25432). \endash  (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tempus, locus, modus, numerus, mora, sciencia, etas etc. Finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gerson \u338 \'8cuvres 8, S. 67-70 Nr. 406. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2270; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Supplement) 2270.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Excerpta
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De septem petitionibus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De ordine ipsarum peticionem ad septem vicia capitalia. Nvnc videndum venit, qualiter in hiis septem peticionibus cohiberi petuntur septem capitalia vicia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum ibi petatur amocio omnis mali presentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Sp. 308). \endash  (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De septem donis spiritus sancti: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo per septem dona spiritus sancti excluduntur septem vicia capitalia. Ultimo dicendum est, qualiter per septem dona excluduntur septem peccata mortalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qua quis impudice in suo misero corpore delectatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. Deo gracias.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Sp. 313). \endash  (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De vitiis tam naturae quam voluntatis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Septem vicia capitalia septem ferocibus bestiis comparantur. Notandum preterea, quod predicta septem peccata capitalia septem tam ferocibus bestiis quam eciam inmundis comparari consueuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ideo ex gula nascitur luxuria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Sp. 325f.).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Joannis Gersonii \u8230 \'85 Opera Omnia 1, ed. Ludovicus Ellies \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Du Pin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Paris 1706.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Herolt: Sermones discipuli de tempore et de sanctis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 30: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sinite vtraque crescere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 13,30). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sciendum, quod in celo sunt solummodo boni, in inferno solummodo mali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sic eciam inter homines est in isto seculo. Quantum ad secundam partem illius sermonis dicendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || wohl Textabbruch (Druck: Bl. [g] 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 20). \endash  (283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  letzte Zeile) Sermo 101: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia est quintuplex differencia inter ignem inferni, in quo zizania, id est mali, comburantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad istum ignem perpetuum zizania, id est mali homines, mittentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. [y] 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 43-[y] 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 28). \endash  (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10) Sermo 7T: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quantum ad tercium est dicendum, quomodo triticum, id est boni homines, congregabuntur in horreum, id est in celum, pro quo dicendum, quod boni habebunt ineffabile gaudium in celo et maximam claritatem, vnde Matheus 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (V. 43) \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tanteque glorie participes haberemur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. [b] 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 23-[b] 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 2). \endash  (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 18-25) Caesarius Heisterbacensis, Dialogus miraculorum, dist. 5, cap. 10: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si esset columpna ferrea erecta et rasoriis et clauis acutissimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de qua propter superbiam meam cecidi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Edition: Josef \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Strange\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bd. 1. K\u246 \'f6ln u.a. 1851, S. 290, Z. 18-23, mit Abweichungen).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: verglichen mit GW 12348 = BSB-Ink H-195.}

