\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quaestiones tres Christi (Io 10,22-39)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota, quod Christus disputauit inter duo in templo cum Judeis et respondit et interrogauit. Sciendum, quod Christus tres proposuit questiones: prima an ex prophetis et veteri testamento haberent, quod Christus esset purus homo, an deus et homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt ostendetur ex dictis Zacharie: Gaude, filia Syon. Ecce rex tuus veniet tibi super azinam mansuetus et pauper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Za 9,9).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Defectus humanae naturae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iterum dicit Gregorius: Recessit lex a sacerdotibus, justicia a principibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nunc enim Christus a potentibus huius seculi quasi peregrinus habetur. Hec ille\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 16445a;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5109).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De arte praedicandi (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erit igitur provisus de talibus videlicet memorare nouissima tua et in eternum non peccabis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 7,40). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quatuor igitur sunt memoranda, videlicet mors, infernus, celum et judicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 juuenis igitur cum gaud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o ad propria remeauit. Amen. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch u.d.T.: Corpus artium praedicandi. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung aus Emmeram: Clm 14669, 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Fassung der vorliegenden Hs. stimmt mit 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 11-263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 31 der Parallelhs. \u252 \'fcberein). \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Caplan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Mediaeval artes praedicandi, S. 13, Nr. 60; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Charland\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Artes praedicandi, S. 101; Antonio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Alberte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ret\u243 \'f3rica medieval. Historia de las artes predicatorias. Madrid 2003, S. 215f. \endash  Als Autorit\u228 \'e4t wird h\u228 \'e4ufig ein sermocinator genannt, der wohl mit Papst Clemens VI. identisch ist; vgl. Diana S. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wood\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Maximus sermocinator verbi Dei: the Sermon Literature of Pope Clement VI, in: The Materials, Sources and Methods of Ecclesiastical History. Papers Read at the 12. Summer Meeting and the 13. Winter Meeting of the Ecclesiastical History Society, ed. Derek \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Baker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Oxford 1975 (Studies in Church History 11), S. 163-172, hier S. 163-165.}

