\pard\fi0\li0\tx6870\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Hieronymus Savonarola: Regulae quaedam brevissimae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Regulae quaedam brevissimae ac ualde utiles, quae ad omnes Religiosos pertinent. Principale studium Religiosi est conari die noctuque, ut anima sua sit Domino Deo coniuncta per orationem et contemplationem continuumque amorem actualem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut simus meliores homines mundi et magnam coronam acquiramus in coelis, ubi regnat benedictus Deus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  312\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -318\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18\cf17  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Directorium asceticum, in quo de viri spiritualis eruditione tutissima sanctorum patrum documenta traduntur, ed. Matthaeus Iosephus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rousset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Freiburg 1893, S. 297-300.}

