\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 5-37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Belethus: Rationale divinorum officiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Exzerpte, de divinis officiis)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collecta proprie dicitur in processione cum populus et clerus de una ad aliam procedunt ecclesiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 37; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola dicitur ab episcopi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Graduale dicitur quoniam in gradibus minoribus ante altare solent cantare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequencia id est quam nos prosam nominamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 38; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prosa est oracio a lege metri absoluta. Ymnus id est laus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alleluia id est laus Ihesu Christe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Offertorium dicitur ab offe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [re]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ndo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 41; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In secreto debemus orare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prefacio id est prelocucio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 45; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Panem nostrum cotidianum id est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 47; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prima enim hora christus a iudeis pilato traditus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 29; (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vota nostra domino debemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 16; (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de transfiguratione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 144; (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z.13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 beatus Laurentius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  cap. 145; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 IIIIor sunt humanae mentis affectiones, gaudium, spes, tristicia, dolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 r \u8230 \'85 (n.id.), (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicto simbolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 cap. 40; (Z. 15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod IIIIor sunt simbola, minimum quod a cunctis dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iube domine et absque benedictione.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  cap. 30.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Sehr kurze Erkl\u228 \'e4rungen zu Grundbegriffen der Messe, zumeist kurze, teils w\u246 \'f6rtliche, teils paraphrasierende Ausz\u252 \'fcge basierend auf Johannes Beleth, Rationale divinorum officiorum, Druck: PL 202, 45C-46D, 50B-C, 53B, 54C, 40B-D, 29C-30A, 147C-148C, 49D-50B, 41C; gelegentlich Einsch\u252 \'fcbe aus nicht identifizierbaren Quellen.}

