\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epilogus et recapitulatio supradictorum. Prima etas ab Adam siue? a constitutione mundi usque ad Noe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Basierend auf: Beda, Liber de temporibus, cap. XVI (mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen), PL 90, 288A.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Z. 28 [de IIII vigiliis]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Romani diuiserunt tempora in IIIIor partes vel uigilias. Prima uigilia dicitur conticinium, secunda intempestrum, tercia gallicinium quarta antelucanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, (Z. 31) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Similiter quatuor sunt tempora noctis vel uigilie secundum theologos scilicet contemptus mundi, mortificatio carnis, apetitus virtutum, desiderium celestium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 temptationem in qua subcumbat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

