\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Z. 27 [de officiis ecclesiasticis]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Offert homo denarium et osculat sacerdotis manus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Est ieiunium meroris. Ieiunium exultationis. Ieiunium meroris sit ieiunio propter duo, scilicet in abstinentia ciborum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Petite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt. 7,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Petite orando, querite operando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (Z. 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Per pacientiam intellegitur caritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (Z. 23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Judei dicebant Christum intrasse sancta sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (Z. 31) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ista duo nomina doctrina et ueritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (aus: Petrus Comestor PL 198, 1184D); (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scientia non auget meritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (Z. 13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Durum est et laboriosum ad serenitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Augustinus, Enarrationes in psalmos, PL 36, 93).}

