\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ioht fau he het\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Umschrift hebr\u228 \'e4ischer Buchstaben?]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnipotens sempiterne deus, qui his quatuor literis tuum mirabile nomen scribi precepist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 i \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 4) [in honore XXIV seniorum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si quis tribulatur vel angustiatur in honore XXIIIIorum seniorum dicat XXIIIIor diebus hoc psalmum. Expectans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps. 39,2) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 finitis XXIIIIor diebus dabit XXIIIIor panes integros \u8230 \'85 absque dubio liberabitur. Eadem die roget sacerdotem missam istam cantare. Venite benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
