\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 11. Jh.\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S\u252 \'fcddeutschland. Lage 14 aus Kalbspergament. Schriftraum: (Lage 13) 11\u215 \'d78, 24-26 Zeilen; (Lage 14-17): 10-11\u215 \'d78; 20 Zeilen. Sp\u228 \'e4tkarolingische Minuskel von mindestens f\u252 \'fcnf H\u228 \'e4nden: H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ); H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ); H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ); H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), H\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Vereinzelt rote Initialen.}

