\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Am oberen Rand von Hand des Aventinus:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Geometria. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Z. 15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Est quedam ratio altitudinem uidendi ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 plana fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Cap. IV, 48, Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bubnov\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gerberti Opera, S. 358. Entspricht Cap. 82 in PL 139, 148A-B.}

