\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugo Argentinensis: Compendium theologicae veritatis (Exz.)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec sunt consilia, que Christus adiecit preceptis, sunt in numero duodecim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo notandum, quod consilium prout diuiditur contra preceptum, est persuasio melioris boni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quoniam si quis ex deliberacione contrarium faceret, mortaliter peccaret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus de xii consiliis domini nostri Jhesu Christi anno domini M cccc xlvii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lib. 5, cap. 69-70. \endash  Druck: Alberti Magni opera omnia. Bd. 34: Compendium theologicae veritatis in septem libros digestum, ed. Auguste \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Borgnet\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Paris 1895, S. 1-261, hier S. 197-200.}

