\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Forma honestae et spiritualis vitae
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 De quattuor beneficiis dei\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In virtute sancte religionis proficere ceptumque bonum laudabiliter et feliciter consumare. Religiose frater ac domine N., dileccionem tuam attencius deprecor, quatenus inter infinita dei beneficia ista quattuor habeas in mente tua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut simul cantemus alleluia. Gloria laus omnipotenti deo, cui est honor et gloria in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis, De regimine vitae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De perfeccione. Si vis esse perfectus, hec racionabiliter teneas: Semper habeas pre oculis tuis mala tua et aliorum bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 maxime in ecclesia et infirmaria dominus tecum sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5677; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Supplement) 5677\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; vgl. auch PL 81, 867C). \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De regimine propriae personae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De horis dicendis. Qvoniam, ut ait apostolus, primo Corinthiorum xiiii\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Cor 14,40): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnia honeste et secundum ordinem fiant in vobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui facit opus domini negligenter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Weitere Kapitel: (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De leccione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De exitu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De comestione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De confessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De solitudine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De conuersacione exteriori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De obediencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De paupertate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De castitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De tribulacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De compassione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De visitacione infirmi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In fine horarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quod negligenter actum est, clementer ignosce. Per Christum dominum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De oracione ceterisque exerciciis spiritualibus. In oracione quasi in presencia dei et in conspectu angelorum assiste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quantum possibile est commorare. Amen\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr. 5042; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (Supplement), Nr. 5042)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Der Traktat setzt sich aus drei Teilen zusammen. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Darmstadt, Hessische UuLB, Hs 1102, 249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; K\u246 \'f6ln, Historisches Archiv, GB 8\u176 \'b0 116, 252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; GB 8\u176 \'b0 122, 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; GB 8\u176 \'b0 150, 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Mainz, StB, Hs I 151, 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Trier, StBuStArchiv, Hs. 771/1350 oct., 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Wien, Schottenstift, Cod. 67, 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

