\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lekt\u252 \'fcreplan f\u252 \'fcr die Tischlesung im Refektorium
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Q]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vique secundum modum ac consuetudinem monachorum nigrorum quemadmodum ad mensam refectorii per annum sacre scripture libros legere scire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [t] \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et primo notandum est, quod in Septuagesima inponi et sine medio legi debent quinque libri Moysi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 incipientur in dominica prima post octavam Epiphanye, ut aliquando propter breuitatem temporis debent anticipari. Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red51\green51\blue51;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -329\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Interrogatoria visitatorum super singulis defectibus monasterii ex officia pertinencia
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur registrum de visitacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item interrogatoria secundum que primo abbas, deinde singuli monachi monasterii visitandi debent ex officio per visitatores diligenter examinari et interrogari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deinde inquisitores vel visitatores faciant fieri capitulum, in quo vnus visitatorum dabit iuramentum abbati et monachis simul de respondendo et dicendo veritatem super interrogatoriis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Z. 9) Eid der Visitatoren: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cuius forma talis est: Ego N. iuro, quod de omnibus et singulis, super quibus per vos uel aliquem vestrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hec sancta dei Ewangelia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deinde singulatim interrogetur et examinetur abbas, deinde monachi, nulla precedente deliberacione nec aliquo termino dato ad deliberandum super infrascriptis. Sequitur primo, vtrum monachi ipsius monasterii sint professi regulam et ordinem sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que pro laude dei, pro vtilitate monasterii et pro salute ordinis fuerint, cum magna providencia, sapientia et honestate provideant, procurent et perficiant pro presentatibus semper et futuris. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Joseph\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Zeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das Provinzialkapitel im Stifte Petershausen im Jahre 1417, in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Studien und Mitteilungen zur Geschichte des Benediktiner-Ordens und seiner Zweige 41 (1922), S. 1-73, hier S. 63-67, zum Inhalt ebd. S. 28.}

