\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 334\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Humbertus de Romanis: De eruditione religiosorum. Prologus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erudire Iherusalem, ne forte recedat anima mea a te et ponam te desertam terram et inhabitabilem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum igitur deo multum placeat et multum religioni expediat, ut ipsa erudiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: VD16 H 5888, Bl. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 - [8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 29.}

