\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 361\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -362\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quaestio de consuetudinibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Queritur an abbas possit licite nouas leges sew consuetudines condere sew constituere \u8230 \'85, eciam si sufficenciores invenerit. Responditur quod consuetudo siue lex posita, ut recta sit, oportet, quod imitatur legi nature\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et precedenti capitulo Quanto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.31.7), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 capitulo Cum ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. ab) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ecclesiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.31.3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et capitulo Cum in ecclesiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.33.10), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De offi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cio iudicis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ord\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [inarii] (X 31) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

