\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 363\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -383\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De correctione fraterna
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qualiter fratres in capitulo proclamati se debeant habere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Stetit Ihesus coram preside inclinato capite, w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ltu placido\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad verbera promptus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Anselmus Cantuariensis, Meditatio XV; PL 158, 790BC). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sic fratres stemus in capitulo. Sustineamus hic virgam blande corrigentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (363\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 11) Hugo de Folieto, De claustro animae, lib. 2, cap. 21: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde secundum Hugonem libro secundo de claustro anime: Intollerabilis est hec abvsio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 loqui aliquatenus presumat. Hec Hugo libro secundo de claustro anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 176, 1077A-1080A); (364\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 11) Lib. 3, cap. 6: [P]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Residens in capitulo aduertere debet diligenter eaque ponit Hugo libro tertio de claustro anime sic dicens: Sic in capitulo rigor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 occulta manifestantur. Hec ille\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 176, 1093C-1094A). \endash  (365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item in capitulo turbato fratre non respondeat presidens, nisi id quod liceat, deceat et expediat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et notandum, quod multiplices sunt fructus capitulorum proclamationis sew fraterne correctionis. Vnus est anime liberacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundus est dyaboli effugacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tercius est peccati cognicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quartus est cautela de futuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quintus est prauitatis augmentacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sextus est amicie acquisicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 7) Humbertus de Romanis, Expositio regulae S. Augustini, cap. 97: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa premissam queritur, an liceat culpam fratris indicare prelato vel fratribus aliquibus uel in capitulo proclamare publice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed in casu opportuno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Berthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1, S. 304 Z. 18-306 Z. 26). \endash  (369\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 16) Thomas de Aquino, Summa theologiae\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20\cf17  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II\u170 \'aa-IIae qu. 33 art. 7 ad 4-5: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [etrus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [herius] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicit, quod huiusmodi proclamaciones, que in religiosorum fiunt in capitulis, sunt communiter de leuibus delictis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uel ecclesiasticus potest exigere iuramentum de veritate dicenda secundum Thomam. Hec P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [etrus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [herius]. \endash  (370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 9) Humbertus de Romanis, Expositio, cap. 97 Schluss, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Berthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1, S. 306 Z. 29-307 Z. 8; (370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 9) cap. 99-100, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Berthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1, S. 314 Z. 7-318 Z. 19; (376\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12) cap. 103, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Berthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1, S. 329 vorletzte Zeile-330 Z. 31; (377\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 8) cap. 100 Schluss, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Berthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1, S. 319 Z. 12-28. \endash  (378\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si autem ex aliciuius fratris proclamacione vbi culpa, esset magna et diffamatoria non publica, sequi posset probabiliter infamia sew nocumentum monasterio, presertim si monasterium in ciuitate magna et populosa esset situm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (379\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  letzte Zeile) Humbertus de Romanis, Expositio, cap. 111, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Berthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1, S. 355 Z. 4-22; daran Regula Benedicti, cap. 46; (380\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 15) cap. 104 Schluss, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Berthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1, S. 336 Z. 10-25. \endash  (381\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item circa proclamaciones officialium monasterii notandum, quod quia officiales monasterii, qui circa eis commissa officia fideliter agere et deum pre oculis habere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (382\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 8) X 5.1.24: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Insuper quia abbates et alii prelati quasi signum sunt positi ad sagittam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ianua precludatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (382\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12) Benedictus XII. papa, Bulle Summi magistri, cap. 5. \endash  384\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -386\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Weite Textpartien zitieren w\u246 \'f6rtlich aus Humberts Auslegung zur Augustinus-Regel oder geben die Inhalte paraphrasierend wieder. \endash  Druck: B. Humberti de Romanis quinti Praedicatorum magistri generalis opera de vita regulari edita, ed. Joachim Joseph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Berthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bde. 1-2. Rom 1888-1889. \endash  Bulle Summi Magistri: Magnum Bullarium Romanum 1, ed. Laertius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cherubinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  et. al. Luxemburg 1727, S. 218-237, hier S. 222.}

