\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 //\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uel obedienciam debitam ac deuotam semper premissam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Discrecioni vestre desidero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (notificare durchgestrichen)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  certificare quod sanus sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; dazu am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Narracio, peticio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Infirmo littera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Predilecto caritatiuo in Christo fratri Johanni, ordinis Minorum domus Augustensis frater N. eiusdem ordinis salutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; dazu am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Infirmo; salutacio, exordium, narracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omni qua valeo reuerenciam et quisquis amicus amico socius socio salubrius et felicius poterit adoptare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Humillima et spontanea subieccione cum omni condigna reuerencia premissis vnde me ipsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oraciones meas humillimas cum omni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rogo ut igniculus caritatis et amoris inter vestram paternitatem et me a multis annis incensus non extinguatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Wohl zu 244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  geh\u246 \'f6rig; s. dort.}

