\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sixtus IV., Papa: Bulla \u8218 \'82Dum singulos\lquote 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota bullam concordiae ... a Sixto papa datam anno pontificatus sui 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Confirmacio et jnnouacio litterarum ... domini Pauli pape 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ne ordinum mendicancium loca conuentualium per fratres de obseruancia nuncupatos recipiantur uel mutentur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sixtus episcopus seruus seruorum dei ad perpetuam rej memoriam. Dum singulos regulares ordines et loca sanctimonie dedita moxque personas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 se nouerit incursurum. Datum Rome aput Sanctum Petrum Anno incarnacionis dominice millesimo quadringentesimo septuagesimo quinto kalendas may, pontificatus nostri anno quarto etc. M.S.P.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Bullarium Franciscanum continens constitutiones, epistulas, diplomata Romani Pontificis Sixti IV ad tres ordines S.P.N. Francisci spectantia, hrsg. von Ioseph M. Pou Y Marti (Nova series III, 1471-1484). Ad Claras Aquas (Quaracchi) 1949, S. 320-322 (Nr. 704). \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sanftl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  I, p. 745.}

