\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sixtus IV., Papa: Bulla \u8218 \'82Etsi pro ministerio\lquote 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sixtus papa quartus dilectis filijs vniuersis et singulis vtriusque sexus ordinis beati Francisci et sancte Clare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et si pro ministerio pastoralis officii cupimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si originales littere exhibite et ostense forent. Datum Romae apud Sanctum Petrum sub annulo piscatoris dye XXII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  may 1479 pontificatus nostri anno octauo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
