\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item antequam homo moritur habet tria in se: Primo incipit infirmari, 2\u176 \'b0 febricitari, 3\u176 \'b0 agonisari. Sic eciam contingit morientibus in peccatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut deus omnipotens liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nos ab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 peccatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  durchgestrichen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 infirmitatibus id est a peccatis et perducat post hanc miseram vitam ad eternam. Quod nobis prestare digne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deus pater et filius et spiritus sanctus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

