\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Exhortationes ad sacerdotes
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O uos sacerdotes dei, vos tangunt sermones mei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non ventre, sed debet portare mente.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec Bernhardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Item dicit idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Sacerdotes, hoc scitote, nichil magis sacerdote, vos sacrauit sacra dote. Sacra dote uos sacrauit, dum ad Petrum ter clamauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 licet sit indignus, ille clemens et benignus. Dominus ita ordinauit, qui nos sua carne pauit. Illum simul deprecemur, ne iehenne prius demur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: N\u252 \'fcrnberg, GNM, Hs 101221, 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Edition: Nicole \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Eichenberger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geistliches Erz\u228 \'e4hlen. Zur deutschsprachigen religi\u246 \'f6sen Kleinepik des Mittelalters. Berlin 2015 (Hermaea 136), S. 510, Anm. 62. \endash  (Nr. 2) Druck: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 AH 46, Nr. 301, v. 42-44, 46-53, 2 Zusatzverse, v. 54-61, 2 Zusatzverse, v. 63, 62, 2 Zusatzverse, v. 66-77, 2 Zusatzverse; mit Abweichungen.}

