\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugo Argentinensis: Compendium theologicae veritatis
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Liber primus de natura deitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Incipit prologus in compendium theologice ueritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Ueritatis theologice sublimitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 , [cum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 superni sit splendoris radius illuminans intellectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Liber primus de natura diuinitatis. Quid deus est. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Deum esse multis modis ostenditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) lib. 2; (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) lib. 3; (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) lib. 4; (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) lib. 5; (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) lib. 6; (224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) lib. 7. \endash  (245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 que cum felici fine quisque beatus secundum merita recipiet sine fine. Explicit liber de theologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 . \endash  246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 -247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Alberti Magni opera omnia. Bd. 34: Compendium theologicae veritatis in septem libros digestum, ed. Auguste \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Borgnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Paris 1895, S. 1-270. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 RS 368 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Scriptores 2, 1982 (ohne diese Hs.), Bd. 4, Nr. II 261: 1982 (Hs. S. 124 genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Distelbrink, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bonaventurae scripta, S. 104\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Nr. 75\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  6399 (Hs. genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Georg \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Steer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Hugo Ripelin von Stra\u223 \'dfburg. Zur Rezeptions- und Wirkungsgeschichte des \u8222 \'84Compendium theologicae veritatis\ldblquote  im deutschen Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalter. T\u252 \'fcbingen 1981 (Texte und Textgeschichte 2), S. 47-239, hier S. 104, Nr. 269 (diese Hs.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 d\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 ers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat8 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 4 (1983), Sp. 252-266, hier Sp. 265f.; Aegidii Romani opera omnia. Bd. 1,1,5,1: Catalogo dei manoscritti (457-505). Repubblica Federale di Germania (Monaco), a cura di Barbara \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Faes de Mottoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Florenz 1990 (Corpus philosophorum medii aevi. Testi e studi 10), S. 275, 283 (zur Zuschreibung des Compendiums an Aegidius Romanus in dieser Hs. auf I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , s.o. Einband).}

