\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De patribus latinis Augustino et Hieronymo
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gregorius ad prefectum Affrice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beati Augustini compatriote vestri opuscula legite \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 nostrum furfurem non queratis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PL 77, 1095A). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cassiodorus in prologo super psalmos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus est litterarum omnium magister egregius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nulla fece pollutus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 70, 9B). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jeronimus: Augustinus episcopus volans per moncium cacumina \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 claro sermone pronunciat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PL 23, 724A). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus super Cantica: Augustinus hic est validissimus malleus hereticorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PL 183, 1170A). \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sicut enim malleus ictibus suis incudem firmat \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 sic Augustinus doctrinis suis ecclesiam confirmat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Johannis Tyrel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anno domini 430 sanctus Augustinus Ypponensis episcopus, ecclesie Christi et katholice fidei propugnator et defensor inuictissimus quinto kalendas Septembris migrauit ad dominum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anno domini 420 Bethleem Jeronimus presbyter, doctor et interpres incomparabilis scripturarum anno etatis nonagesimo primo obiit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prosperus in libro de vita contempla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tiva]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctus Augustinus fuit nobilis ingenio, suauis eloquio \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 in ecclesiasticis laboribus operosus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 59, 516C). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Remigius: Quod licet Jeronimus sex milia voluminum Origenis se legisse fateatur, Augustinus tomum tanta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!, wohl:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 tomos tantos) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scripsit, ut nullus possit libros eius omnibus diebus suis legere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 4b) \u196 \'c4hnliches Zitat: De nomine Marci evangelista, in: Iacopo da Varazze, Legenda aurea. Edizione critica a cura di Giovanni Paolo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maggioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 1. \u178 \'b2Florenz 1998, S. 399, \u167 \'a7 7-8. \endash  (Nr. 8) \u196 \'c4hnliches Zitat: Isidorus Hispalensis, Etymologiarum liber VI.7.2-3: Qui multa scripserunt; Ed.: Isidori Hispalensis episcopi Etymologiarum sive originum libri XX. Bd. 1: Libri I-X, ed. Wallace M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lindsay\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . ND Oxford 1962.}

