\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gennadius Massiliensis: Liber de ecclesiasticis dogmatibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Albini et Alani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber beati Augustini epicopi de ecclesiasticis dogmatibus. Capitulum de sancta trinitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Credimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 unum deum esse patrem et filium et spiritum sanctum. Patrem eo, quod habeat filium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 libere confitemur, ymaginem in eternitate: similitudinem in moribus invenire. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Augustinus de ecclesiasticis dogmatibus per manus Johannis Tyrolf Anno 1434\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 42, 1213-1222. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kurz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5/1, S. 93-95 (S. 94 Nr. 18 Hs. genannt);\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  CPL 958.}

