\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Flaccus Alcuinus: De laude psalmorum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus de laude psalmorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prophecie spiritus non semper prophetarum mentibus presto est, quatenus cum hunc non habent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in psalterio solo ad obitum vite tue habes materiam legendi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scrutandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 101, 465B-467D. \endash  Edition: Jonathan \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Black\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Psalm Uses in Carolingian Prayerbooks: Alcuin and the Preface to \u8218 \'82De Psalmorum usu\lquote , in: Medieaval Studies 64 (2002), S. 1-60, hier S. 45-60 Z. 247, S. 41 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Lit.:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 54; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kurz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5/1, S. 189 Nr. 7 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Clavis Galliae 2, Nr. 33 (Hs. S. 146 genannt).}

