\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis: Psalterium de passione domini
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus de passione domini et dicitur Granum deuocionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 docendi, in quo inuenies Prophetas, Ewangelistas atque Apostolos et omnes diuinos libros spiritualiter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ad medullas intimi intellectus per dei graciam pervenies. Amen. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit in die Marci ewangeliste Anno 1435 per Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tyrolf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ratis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [bonensem]. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Meditacio Bernhardi de passione domini Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Prima Quinquagena: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Te, ut in memoriam, reuocem salvator, Michi benignissimus assit consolator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Secunda Quinquagena; (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tertia Quinquagena; expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dulcis Ihesu, offero te summum in bonis, requiro pro munere retribucionis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit per manus Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tyrolf in die Vitalis martyris 1435\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Emmeramer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 14528, 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck: AH 35, S. 26-39 Nr. 2; zur Zuschreibung an Bernhard ebd., S. 43. \endash  Lit.: Jean-Barth\u233 \'e9lemy \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haur\u233 \'e9au\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Des po\u232 \'e8mes latins attribu\u233 \'e9s \u224 \'e0 saint Bernard. Paris 1890, S. 78-80 (Hs. S. 79 genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia carminum 19092.}

