\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Claudius Gordianus Fulgentius: De fide ad Petrum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Kopfzeile: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 IHS XPS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber sancti Augustini de fide ad Petrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistolam fili Petre tue caritatis accepi, in qua te significasti velle Ierosolimam pergere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et si quid aliter sapit, hoc quoque illi deus reuelabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen. Explicit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 40, 753-778; PL 65, 671-706. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 27; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kurz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5/1, S. 117-119 (S. 118 Nr. 28 Hs. genannt);\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  CPL 826.}

