\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Augustinus: Speculum liber I
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In der Fu\u223 \'dfzeile zu Beginn \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Petrus Lombardus, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Libri IV Sententiarum, lib. 1, dist. 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Li\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [bro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 pri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 [mo], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 di. 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 Hec trinitas unius eiusdemque substantie uel essencie dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 nisi per iusticiam fidei emundetur. Hec Augustinus libro primo de trinititat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat8 e (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 PL 192, 525). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber, qui dicitur Manuale siue Floriger Beati Augustini Episcopi Ypponensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Adesto michi verum lumen, deus pater omnipotens, adesto michi verum lumen de lumine uerbum dei deus omnipotens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per infinita et indefessa et immortalia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 40, 967-984; PL 101, 1027D-1048A. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 28; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kurz, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5/1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 223f. Nr. 19 (Hs. genannt).}

