\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augustinus: De decem chordis (= Sermo IX)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus sancti Augustini Episcopi de decem cordis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad utilitatem ecclesiasticem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus et deus noster, misericors et miserator longanimis et multum misericors et verax\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 erit ergo illud sabbatum sabbatorum, ut, quod hic desideramus, ibi inveniamus. Amen bone Ihesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit per manus Johannis Tyrolf presbyteri Anno 1435\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 38, 75-91. \endash  Edition: CCL 41, ed. Cyrille \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lambot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1961), S. 105-151. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kurz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5/1, S. 79 Nr. 19 (Hs. genannt); CPPM 1A, 456; CPL 284.}

