\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis: Epistola de cura rei familiaris
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit epistola s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardi, quam misit Reymundo militi de cura domestica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gracioso et felici, domino militi Reymundo, domino Castri sancti Ambrosii \u8230 \'85 Doceri petisti a nobis de cura et modo rei familiaris utilius gubernando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad quem etiam eam perducunt merita sue dampnabilis senectutis. Amen. Explicit de cura domus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Wahrscheinlich verfasst von Bernardus Silvestris. \endash  Druck: PL 182, 647-651. \endash  Edition: Clive D. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cossar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The German Translations of the Pseudo-Bernhardine \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Epistola de cura rei familiaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . G\u246 \'f6ppingen 1975 (G\u246 \'f6ppinger Arbeiten zur Germanistik 166), S. 97-102. \endash  Zur Zuschreibung an Bernardus Silvestris s. Sancti Bernardi opera. Bd. 8: Epistolae 181-547,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ad fidem codicum recensuit Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Henri \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Rom 1972, S. 431, sowie \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cossar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. ii.}

