\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ps.-Isidorus Hispalensis: De norma vivendi
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit epistola siue libellus Ysidori Episcopi de norma vite ad quendam adolescentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Age, fili, ut oportet; age, ut decet; age, ut dignum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vide deinceps, ne quod bonum, quod cepisti, despicias. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Epistola Ysidori Episcopi per manus Johannes Tyrolf presbyteri Anno 1435 die post\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [festum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Leonhardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Darunter Schreiberspruch: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isto completo, sursum salio pede leto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx4605\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 83, 1247-1252. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D\u237 \'edaz y D\u237 \'edaz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Index \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 103 Nr. 383 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  340\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 CPPM 2B, 3434\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 CPL 1227a; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (Supplement) 340\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

