\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cvmque intinxerit sacerdos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Lv 4,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sicut scriptum est in Leui et potest hoc verbum predicari de passione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec est victoria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (I Io 5,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ita scribitur in epistula hodierna sumpta de prima canona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pulsate et aperitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Lc 11,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Magna gratia quia sicut apok. I\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  clauem habet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Conradus de Saxonia; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1, S. 757 Nr. 154); 
