\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Videntibus illis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Act 1,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quare illis videntibus sit eleuatus Iesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...;
