\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctus sanctus sanctus dominus deus Sabaoth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Is 6,3 / Mt 21,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In vtroque testamento proclamat dominus ter ab angelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Conradus de Saxonia; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1, S. 767 Nr. 292);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pulcherrima feminarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Idc 5,30). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec verba conuenienter possent dici de festo hodierno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\u228 \'e4hnlich Graeculus; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 228 Nr. 154).
