\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De nupcijs spiritualibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Simile factum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est regnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Mt 22,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sciendum quod nupcie sunt triplices\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 143); (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gaudete iusti in domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...(Mt 5,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex quo peragitur solempnitas omnium sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 180); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anima mea turbata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Ps 6,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex quo peragitur dies omnium animarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 181); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hora est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Rm 13,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Boecius de consolacione philosophie: vnicuique inserta est natura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 2); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Caro mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Io 6,56). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Unde dicit Aristoteles 4 Ethicorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Terribilissimum omnium terribilum videtur esse mors\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 89);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si quis wlt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Mt 16,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wlt igitur Christus ut ipsum sequamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 173);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Filia mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Mt 9,18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sicut enim defuncta est illa puella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 154);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de assumpcione beate Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego mater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Sir 24,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sciendum quod nemo potest digne laudare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 183); im Anschluss Nota mit dt. Taufspruch: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Schold du leben so sey dir da\u223 \'df ein pod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Descendit hic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Lc 18,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic est dicendum quoniam vnusquisque debet iustificari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 121);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Notae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec sunt verba Benedicti ad omnes prelatores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O vos sacerdotes dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fili prebe cor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Prv 23,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex quo in presenti dominica agitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Johannes Herolt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer/H\u246 \'f6dl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1350-1500, <J.H.> 9).}

