\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio de sancta cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine Iesu Christe filij dei qui regnat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oracio de sancta cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Adoro te crux alma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta trinitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine deus omnipotens eterne et ineffabilis sine fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus honor graciarum accio fit tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Quinque confessiones. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Confessio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Confiteor deo patri omnipotenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 misereatur mei qui viuit et regnat deus per omnia secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beati Ieronimi oracio bona ante communionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eya dulcis anima soror mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 5309); (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio ante communionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine sancte pater omnipotens eterne deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia oracio ante communionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnipotens sempiterne deus ecce ego indignus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...}

